(289789, 20215, 4625, '<td valign="top">Niec Crisp image, looks good. intresting angle as well. the background is smooth and fits the picture well. Overall well done.</td>', 'Niec Crisp image, looks good. intresting angle as well. the background is smooth and fits the picture well. Overall well done.', '2003-05-07 01:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(289791, 20643, 1143, '<td valign="top">Dunno if you could desaturate a certain channel to get rid of that green in the middle, but it bugs me a little. I love the lighting along the bottom. Great clarity for such low light. Beautiful.</td>', 'Dunno if you could desaturate a certain channel to get rid of that green in the middle, but it bugs me a little. I love the lighting along the bottom. Great clarity for such low light. Beautiful.', '2003-05-07 01:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(289792, 20675, 4625, '<td valign="top">Could have been rotated counter-clockwise a little bit to make the headlight frame line straighter, since the glass light should be the main focal point here. The image itself looks good, good angle, nice shot. good job.</td>', 'Could have been rotated counter-clockwise a little bit to make the headlight frame line straighter, since the glass light should be the main focal point here. The image itself looks good, good angle, nice shot. good job.', '2003-05-07 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(289795, 20777, 7291, '<td valign="top">I though about doing this EXACT picture, except on the finger tip though.  I hope that''s fake blood.  Excellent composition and good depth of field.</td>', 'I though about doing this EXACT picture, except on the finger tip though.  I hope that''s fake blood.  Excellent composition and good depth of field.', '2003-05-07 01:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(289796, 20683, 4625, '<td valign="top">With a little more light coming from the camera side you might have been able to pick up some details on the fly, that would have helped this picture a lot. It does retain a "glass" feeling because clearly hte fly is standing on something, but it doesn''t convey the thought of glass to the viewer as much as most would probably want for this challenge.</td>', 'With a little more light coming from the camera side you might have been able to pick up some details on the fly, that would have helped this picture a lot. It does retain a "glass" feeling because clearly hte fly is standing on something, but it doesn''t convey the thought of glass to the viewer as much as most would probably want for this challenge.', '2003-05-07 01:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(289797, 20458, 1877, '<td valign="top">wow, how many glasses did you have to go through? very cool shot</td>', 'wow, how many glasses did you have to go through? very cool shot', '2003-05-07 01:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
