(289804, 20433, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nice solid shot. I like the effect with the light, I also like the shades of blue that are present in the shot. I thihnk a white border would have added a bit of contrast to this shot so it wasn''t quite so overwhelmingly blue. THe shot is crisp and clear and meets the challenge well. Good job.</td>', 'Nice solid shot. I like the effect with the light, I also like the shades of blue that are present in the shot. I thihnk a white border would have added a bit of contrast to this shot so it wasn''t quite so overwhelmingly blue. THe shot is crisp and clear and meets the challenge well. Good job.', '2003-05-07 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(289805, 20702, 4625, '<td valign="top">THe background here looks great, very smooth. The glass is great, I love sea worn glass. The lighting is perfect for the subject well done.</td>', 'THe background here looks great, very smooth. The glass is great, I love sea worn glass. The lighting is perfect for the subject well done.', '2003-05-07 01:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(289806, 20646, 1877, '<td valign="top">hmm.. looks familiar... pretty snazzy :)</td>', 'hmm.. looks familiar... pretty snazzy :)', '2003-05-07 01:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
