(289827, 20400, 714, '<td valign="top">You have the right idea but it is so grainy.  Not sure why.  It looks like you used good lighting.  Maybe just your camera or not using a tripod.  Good luck!</td>', 'You have the right idea but it is so grainy.  Not sure why.  It looks like you used good lighting.  Maybe just your camera or not using a tripod.  Good luck!', '2003-05-07 01:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
