(289839, 20365, 4625, '<td valign="top">The focus here seems a bit off, the lighting is a little on the dim side, the the cropping probably should have excluded the left side where you can see the end of the backdrop. Keep trying, This is a good start.</td>', 'The focus here seems a bit off, the lighting is a little on the dim side, the the cropping probably should have excluded the left side where you can see the end of the backdrop. Keep trying, This is a good start.', '2003-05-07 01:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(289841, 20819, 5333, '<td valign="top">Hmm... a very vivid interpretation! :)</td>', 'Hmm... a very vivid interpretation! :)', '2003-05-07 01:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(289842, 20752, 714, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and idea.  Very creative.  Why can''t I think of cool things like this?  Vote 10</td>', 'I love the colors and idea.  Very creative.  Why can''t I think of cool things like this?  Vote 10', '2003-05-07 01:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(289844, 20320, 5705, '<td valign="top">Great Idea, very Original</td>', 'Great Idea, very Original', '2003-05-07 01:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(289845, 20643, 4625, '<td valign="top">Wow is all I can say. This is a beautiful picture. Abstract, and wonderful to look at. I love the colors, so smooth. Overall I think this is definitely a contender for the ribbon that will match the glass. Well done!</td>', 'Wow is all I can say. This is a beautiful picture. Abstract, and wonderful to look at. I love the colors, so smooth. Overall I think this is definitely a contender for the ribbon that will match the glass. Well done!', '2003-05-07 01:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(289852, 20163, 4625, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but it seems to be lacking somewhat. The focus is a bit off in the foreground. It would have been better from a different angle persona. to cut out the stairs and lamp in the reflection, and maybe (if possible) include the pictures in the non reflection as well as the reflection. A good idea, but it just didn''t turn out perfect this time. (also closing the door in the reflection would have been a good idea) Oh I do like the sadows on the wall in th reflection too, I just noticed that.</td>', 'A good idea, but it seems to be lacking somewhat. The focus is a bit off in the foreground. It would have been better from a different angle persona. to cut out the stairs and lamp in the reflection, and maybe (if possible) include the pictures in the non reflection as well as the reflection. A good idea, but it just didn''t turn out perfect this time. (also closing the door in the reflection would have been a good idea) Oh I do like the sadows on the wall in th reflection too, I just noticed that.', '2003-05-07 01:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(289854, 20185, 4625, '<td valign="top">I like the theme of this shot. I like the use of depth of field, The bottle and message could have been a bit clearer though, tehy seem too soft. Nice shot none the less.</td>', 'I like the theme of this shot. I like the use of depth of field, The bottle and message could have been a bit clearer though, tehy seem too soft. Nice shot none the less.', '2003-05-07 01:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(289856, 20749, 6870, '<td valign="top">The glass seems to be between him and the world he wants to see....  Hey, this looks like the boy in Life Span a few weeks ago!</td>', 'The glass seems to be between him and the world he wants to see....  Hey, this looks like the boy in Life Span a few weeks ago!', '2003-05-07 01:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(289857, 20726, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image, the only complaint I would have is that the focal point of the image seems to be the pills rather than the glass.</td>', 'Nice crisp image, the only complaint I would have is that the focal point of the image seems to be the pills rather than the glass.', '2003-05-07 01:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(289861, 20608, 714, '<td valign="top">The light could have been better here.  Maybe use a 40 watt and shine it down from the top.  That would elimanate the graininess.  It is also a bit blurry. not sure if that is from you camera or what.  Try using a tripod.  did you try to lighten it up with your picture program?</td>', 'The light could have been better here.  Maybe use a 40 watt and shine it down from the top.  That would elimanate the graininess.  It is also a bit blurry. not sure if that is from you camera or what.  Try using a tripod.  did you try to lighten it up with your picture program?', '2003-05-07 01:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(289862, 20365, 7504, '<td valign="top">Neat blue shadow, this needs a tighter crop though.  Good idea!</td>', 'Neat blue shadow, this needs a tighter crop though.  Good idea!', '2003-05-07 01:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(289863, 20311, 4625, '<td valign="top">The focus here seems a bit off. There''s also a watermark type stain or something on the 2nd from left glass which caught my attention right away. I like the contrast in this shot, and I like the idea. The perspective is also great. The framing looks good and is very fitting. Overall well done.</td>', 'The focus here seems a bit off. There''s also a watermark type stain or something on the 2nd from left glass which caught my attention right away. I like the contrast in this shot, and I like the idea. The perspective is also great. The framing looks good and is very fitting. Overall well done.', '2003-05-07 01:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(289864, 20643, 1717, '<td valign="top">gorgeous!  beautiful lighting and shadows and i love the blue color.  very well done!  10 from me.</td>', 'gorgeous!  beautiful lighting and shadows and i love the blue color.  very well done!  10 from me.', '2003-05-07 01:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(289874, 20835, 4625, '<td valign="top">The shot looks a little messy to me, lots of specs (fish food?) the glass gives a neat curvey background effect . I think if you put fresh water in teh fish bowl, then shot it, and adjusted the contrast a bit it would look much better.</td>', 'The shot looks a little messy to me, lots of specs (fish food?) the glass gives a neat curvey background effect . I think if you put fresh water in teh fish bowl, then shot it, and adjusted the contrast a bit it would look much better.', '2003-05-07 01:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(289876, 20776, 1143, '<td valign="top">very cool. not crazy about the red line but the idea is wonderful. nice lines. maybe u can clone out the pink areas in the lower corners after the challenge</td>', 'very cool. not crazy about the red line but the idea is wonderful. nice lines. maybe u can clone out the pink areas in the lower corners after the challenge', '2003-05-07 01:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(289881, 20522, 4625, '<td valign="top">Great angle! This looks like a wireframing for a 3d image! Really neat perspective. I think there could have been a bit more contrast in the shot, otherwise it looks great. well done.</td>', 'Great angle! This looks like a wireframing for a 3d image! Really neat perspective. I think there could have been a bit more contrast in the shot, otherwise it looks great. well done.', '2003-05-07 01:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(289884, 20803, 4625, '<td valign="top">Very abstract, very artistic. I love the smoothness of this picture. It has a great feel to it. Well done.</td>', 'Very abstract, very artistic. I love the smoothness of this picture. It has a great feel to it. Well done.', '2003-05-07 01:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(289888, 20458, 5400, '<td valign="top">How many glasses did you need to break doing this picture? Very nice!</td>', 'How many glasses did you need to break doing this picture? Very nice!', '2003-05-07 01:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(289889, 20652, 4625, '<td valign="top">Might have been better to include the whole pyramid in the shot. Seems a bit lacking without the peak. Also seems a bit soft, might just be the reflections on the glass.</td>', 'Might have been better to include the whole pyramid in the shot. Seems a bit lacking without the peak. Also seems a bit soft, might just be the reflections on the glass.', '2003-05-07 01:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(289893, 20754, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nice abstraction.</td>', 'Nice abstraction.', '2003-05-07 01:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(289894, 20416, 7242, '<td valign="top">This one blows me away! 10</td>', 'This one blows me away! 10', '2003-05-07 01:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(289896, 20729, 4625, '<td valign="top">I think the color might be a bit too oversatured in this one. I like the glass itself it''s a nice piece and pleasing to look at with the curved neck. the colors of the light is nice, but the saturation takes away from the image overall.</td>', 'I think the color might be a bit too oversatured in this one. I like the glass itself it''s a nice piece and pleasing to look at with the curved neck. the colors of the light is nice, but the saturation takes away from the image overall.', '2003-05-07 01:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(289897, 20608, 4625, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the focus seems way off, the background color should have been something to contrast the amber color of the appljuice? in the glasses. Champagne or something sparkling would have looked better, and more natural for those glasses. With a little more light, a better focus (maybe a tripod) and a better background this shot would look really good.</td>', 'Good idea, but the focus seems way off, the background color should have been something to contrast the amber color of the appljuice? in the glasses. Champagne or something sparkling would have looked better, and more natural for those glasses. With a little more light, a better focus (maybe a tripod) and a better background this shot would look really good.', '2003-05-07 01:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(289901, 20767, 7151, '<td valign="top">Might have been an interesting idea, but it''s just too small to make out well.  It''s so small, I can''t even evaluate it on technical merits. :-(</td>', 'Might have been an interesting idea, but it''s just too small to make out well.  It''s so small, I can''t even evaluate it on technical merits. :-(', '2003-05-07 01:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(289902, 20755, 7706, '<td valign="top">Your image is very small. Should try and size them between 600-640 pixles</td>', 'Your image is very small. Should try and size them between 600-640 pixles', '2003-05-07 01:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(289904, 20734, 4625, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this shot, looks really good. The focus seems to be a bit too soft though. Also look a bit cluttered and unorganized. Maybe with a smaller subject range (two of the strands maybe?) it would have looked a bit better.</td>', 'I like the colors in this shot, looks really good. The focus seems to be a bit too soft though. Also look a bit cluttered and unorganized. Maybe with a smaller subject range (two of the strands maybe?) it would have looked a bit better.', '2003-05-07 01:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(289906, 20463, 352, '<td valign="top">Incredible, absolutely incredible</td>', 'Incredible, absolutely incredible', '2003-05-07 01:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(289907, 20452, 352, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Great reflection...</td>', 'Nice shot.  Great reflection...', '2003-05-07 01:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(289908, 20597, 4625, '<td valign="top">I like the flares under the a they look really good. A different background (whatever''s behind the bottle) might have helped the shot a bit. Maybe something solid? A piece of paper, or a red and white mix (since it''s coke)... The perspective is interesting. It shows that you don''t need to focus on the coca-cola logo to have it known what''s in the shot.</td>', 'I like the flares under the a they look really good. A different background (whatever''s behind the bottle) might have helped the shot a bit. Maybe something solid? A piece of paper, or a red and white mix (since it''s coke)... The perspective is interesting. It shows that you don''t need to focus on the coca-cola logo to have it known what''s in the shot.', '2003-05-07 01:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(289909, 20645, 7151, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Good job, it''s a nice, clear capture of the horse, and the colors refracted in the glass are nice. Good DOF.  I think it might have been better either centered on the horse, or maybe with a wider crop.</td>', 'Very interesting.  Good job, it''s a nice, clear capture of the horse, and the colors refracted in the glass are nice. Good DOF.  I think it might have been better either centered on the horse, or maybe with a wider crop.', '2003-05-07 01:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
