(289991, 20675, 92, '<td valign="top">ok now this is unique and it''s a top fav of mine. I like the lines and b/w of this. GREAT photo !</td>', 'ok now this is unique and it''s a top fav of mine. I like the lines and b/w of this. GREAT photo !', '2003-05-07 02:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(289992, 20407, 2978, '<td valign="top">Wow cool effect. I personally like this composition and the colour gives the mysterious look to the image. I just click on this photo first.  Good luck</td>', 'Wow cool effect. I personally like this composition and the colour gives the mysterious look to the image. I just click on this photo first.  Good luck', '2003-05-07 02:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(289993, 20810, 6886, '<td valign="top">The dof is excellent. Keep it up!</td>', 'The dof is excellent. Keep it up!', '2003-05-07 02:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(289994, 20785, 4625, '<td valign="top">I think a lot of detail is lost in the smallness of this shot. The blacks look good, very dark, the image itself is pretty crisp. IT doesn''t look perfectly centered (The right side is wider than teh left( the framing is nice, But again I think the frame isn''t quite centered either. (looks like it''s missing a pixel on teh top and hte left)</td>', 'I think a lot of detail is lost in the smallness of this shot. The blacks look good, very dark, the image itself is pretty crisp. IT doesn''t look perfectly centered (The right side is wider than teh left( the framing is nice, But again I think the frame isn''t quite centered either. (looks like it''s missing a pixel on teh top and hte left)', '2003-05-07 02:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(289996, 20459, 92, '<td valign="top">To me this has almost a pencil on rich paper feel to it. It''s like a piece of art. GREAT job ! This will make a great print !</td>', 'To me this has almost a pencil on rich paper feel to it. It''s like a piece of art. GREAT job ! This will make a great print !', '2003-05-07 02:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(289997, 20460, 6388, '<td valign="top">another of my favourites.  I''d frame this, and it meets the challenge.  by all rights should get a decent score.  7 in my books.  my only criticism (meant in the critiquing sense of the word) is the reflection on the wall at the left of the photo. Just moving the candles a few more inches would take care of that.  unless of course you meant them to be there, in which case you did it perfectly.  :)</td>', 'another of my favourites.  I''d frame this, and it meets the challenge.  by all rights should get a decent score.  7 in my books.  my only criticism (meant in the critiquing sense of the word) is the reflection on the wall at the left of the photo. Just moving the candles a few more inches would take care of that.  unless of course you meant them to be there, in which case you did it perfectly.  :)', '2003-05-07 02:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(289999, 20689, 7151, '<td valign="top">Is it on purpose that the text in through the glasses is slightly clearer than the rest of the text.  If so, well done.  If not.... well done. :-) Though that leaves the frame a bit soft as well.  Overall, it''s not a real "wow" shot, but it''s clever and well executed.</td>', 'Is it on purpose that the text in through the glasses is slightly clearer than the rest of the text.  If so, well done.  If not.... well done. :-) Though that leaves the frame a bit soft as well.  Overall, it''s not a real "wow" shot, but it''s clever and well executed.', '2003-05-07 02:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(290000, 20715, 4625, '<td valign="top">Awesome abstract! That''s a lightbulb isn''t it? wow. The colors are great very smooth looks sweet! Could just be me but it doesn''t look perfectly square with the frame (probably just me) Overall I like this a lot, well done.</td>', 'Awesome abstract! That''s a lightbulb isn''t it? wow. The colors are great very smooth looks sweet! Could just be me but it doesn''t look perfectly square with the frame (probably just me) Overall I like this a lot, well done.', '2003-05-07 02:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(290001, 20623, 92, '<td valign="top">oh love the yellow color.  The lip and neck area of the bottle just catch my attention. GREAT photo !</td>', 'oh love the yellow color.  The lip and neck area of the bottle just catch my attention. GREAT photo !', '2003-05-07 02:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(290002, 20233, 6388, '<td valign="top">white may not have been the best bet here for a backdrop.   lots of the detail is lost.</td>', 'white may not have been the best bet here for a backdrop.   lots of the detail is lost.', '2003-05-07 02:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(290003, 20603, 4625, '<td valign="top">The angle on this one isn''t done so great. the reflection on the front glass looks good and is fitting to this shot. Lighting doens''t look too bad, overall not bad.</td>', 'The angle on this one isn''t done so great. the reflection on the front glass looks good and is fitting to this shot. Lighting doens''t look too bad, overall not bad.', '2003-05-07 02:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(290004, 20266, 6388, '<td valign="top">very technically sound picture.  it doesn''t have that jump-out-and-grab-ya composition, but the lighting, focus, depth, etc are very well executed.</td>', 'very technically sound picture.  it doesn''t have that jump-out-and-grab-ya composition, but the lighting, focus, depth, etc are very well executed.', '2003-05-07 02:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(290005, 20800, 4625, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, I like the green, very vibrant. The glass doesn''t seem to be the main subject of the shot but it''s definitely there, and I think I like that. The white border seems a bit much, maybe a thin 1 pixel white border with another 10 pixel black border outside that owuld have looked better, or no border at all. nice abstraction. well done.</td>', 'Very cool shot, I like the green, very vibrant. The glass doesn''t seem to be the main subject of the shot but it''s definitely there, and I think I like that. The white border seems a bit much, maybe a thin 1 pixel white border with another 10 pixel black border outside that owuld have looked better, or no border at all. nice abstraction. well done.', '2003-05-07 02:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(290006, 20547, 2978, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject. It creates such a colour scheme. A lil bit sharpness would be nice</td>', 'Good choice of subject. It creates such a colour scheme. A lil bit sharpness would be nice', '2003-05-07 02:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(290007, 20718, 4625, '<td valign="top">Just a little too dark I think. THe colors are nice, the image is nice, maybe a bit to over sharpened though.</td>', 'Just a little too dark I think. THe colors are nice, the image is nice, maybe a bit to over sharpened though.', '2003-05-07 02:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(290008, 20553, 6388, '<td valign="top">a darker colour and shorter lens would make it clearer what this is...I get it now that I''ve looked a bit, but it took me a few seconds.  good concept.</td>', 'a darker colour and shorter lens would make it clearer what this is...I get it now that I''ve looked a bit, but it took me a few seconds.  good concept.', '2003-05-07 02:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(290010, 20849, 7151, '<td valign="top">Oh, no!  A flag shot!  Let the fur fly!  Seriously, interesting shot.  I think I would have liked it better if you had gotten a corner of the blue into the action.  I think (hard to say for sure - the glass may be distorting the focus) that a bit of a wider DOF would have been better.  As it is, it appears that some of the corners closest to the lens are blurred, which really has a disturbing effect.  But except for those couple of spots, it''s very clear and gives a nice effect.</td>', 'Oh, no!  A flag shot!  Let the fur fly!  Seriously, interesting shot.  I think I would have liked it better if you had gotten a corner of the blue into the action.  I think (hard to say for sure - the glass may be distorting the focus) that a bit of a wider DOF would have been better.  As it is, it appears that some of the corners closest to the lens are blurred, which really has a disturbing effect.  But except for those couple of spots, it''s very clear and gives a nice effect.', '2003-05-07 02:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(290013, 20787, 4625, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a bit sporadic to me. They don''t seem to fit together well. I like the lighting in the shot it looks good. Just overall it doesn''t seem to flow.</td>', 'The colors seem a bit sporadic to me. They don''t seem to fit together well. I like the lighting in the shot it looks good. Just overall it doesn''t seem to flow.', '2003-05-07 02:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(290015, 20416, 4625, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot. The ladbug is a bit too shadowed though I think, but it''s not bad like that. Very nice macro.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot. The ladbug is a bit too shadowed though I think, but it''s not bad like that. Very nice macro.', '2003-05-07 02:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(290019, 20458, 2978, '<td valign="top">Wow! don''t have to say anything on this image. Motion capture and lighting are well executed. Just wonder how many glasses you''ve broken.</td>', 'Wow! don''t have to say anything on this image. Motion capture and lighting are well executed. Just wonder how many glasses you''ve broken.', '2003-05-07 02:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(290020, 20630, 5925, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject and colors in this picture, but I think there is too much white.  Maybe a little less brightness would do it.</td>', 'I really like the subject and colors in this picture, but I think there is too much white.  Maybe a little less brightness would do it.', '2003-05-07 02:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(290022, 20549, 4625, '<td valign="top">Definitely too grainy. I don''t know if I would call this a glass shot... The lighting is very poor here, but the spotlight effect looks neat.</td>', 'Definitely too grainy. I don''t know if I would call this a glass shot... The lighting is very poor here, but the spotlight effect looks neat.', '2003-05-07 02:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(290023, 20450, 5925, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t know what you were depicting here.  Maybe if it wasn''t so close up I could make it out better.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t know what you were depicting here.  Maybe if it wasn''t so close up I could make it out better.', '2003-05-07 02:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(290024, 20746, 5925, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection on the glass!</td>', 'I really like the reflection on the glass!', '2003-05-07 02:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(290025, 20836, 1143, '<td valign="top">tad oversharpened maybe . with all that texture it''s easy to do. very cute and original tho</td>', 'tad oversharpened maybe . with all that texture it''s easy to do. very cute and original tho', '2003-05-07 02:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(290026, 20845, 5925, '<td valign="top">Hehe, cute name for the pic.  The blue hue adds a lot to this one!</td>', 'Hehe, cute name for the pic.  The blue hue adds a lot to this one!', '2003-05-07 02:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(290028, 20845, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the lighting and composition.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the lighting and composition.', '2003-05-07 02:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(290030, 20752, 5925, '<td valign="top">Cool idea for this picture!</td>', 'Cool idea for this picture!', '2003-05-07 02:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(290031, 20639, 5925, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s neat.  How did you do that?</td>', 'Wow, that''s neat.  How did you do that?', '2003-05-07 02:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(290033, 20794, 5007, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection in the glass. It makes it look very abstract. Nice focus. I might have brought the bottom edge of the piece of glass into the photo but it is not that problematic. Good job.</td>', 'I really like the reflection in the glass. It makes it look very abstract. Nice focus. I might have brought the bottom edge of the piece of glass into the photo but it is not that problematic. Good job.', '2003-05-07 02:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(290035, 20847, 5925, '<td valign="top">I just love how you made an ordinarily plain piece of glass very interesting with use of color!  The lighting is great too, and makes this picture in my opinion.</td>', 'I just love how you made an ordinarily plain piece of glass very interesting with use of color!  The lighting is great too, and makes this picture in my opinion.', '2003-05-07 02:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(290036, 20635, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like this because it is so abstract. Interesting shapes and distortions. The lines draw your eyes around the frame.</td>', 'I like this because it is so abstract. Interesting shapes and distortions. The lines draw your eyes around the frame.', '2003-05-07 02:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(290037, 20818, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like this abstract background and the cubes of ice in the glass. Good colors.</td>', 'I like this abstract background and the cubes of ice in the glass. Good colors.', '2003-05-07 02:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(290038, 20496, 5925, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty picture, but maybe a little too bright.</td>', 'This is a very pretty picture, but maybe a little too bright.', '2003-05-07 02:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(290041, 20778, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very excellent execution of this technique.</td>', 'Very excellent execution of this technique.', '2003-05-07 02:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(290043, 20794, 5925, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is an interesting picture to look at!  I like it.</td>', 'Wow, this is an interesting picture to look at!  I like it.', '2003-05-07 02:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(290045, 20729, 7706, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but its very dark. Havn''t I see that glass twice before? lol</td>', 'nice shot, but its very dark. Havn''t I see that glass twice before? lol', '2003-05-07 02:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(290046, 20311, 3669, '<td valign="top">I like the unique-ness of this photo.  I like the angle at which the glasses where shot and the lines of the window panes.  I do think, however, this would have been better to be in true black and white.  There is color along some of the edges that I feel takes away from the quality of the shot.</td>', 'I like the unique-ness of this photo.  I like the angle at which the glasses where shot and the lines of the window panes.  I do think, however, this would have been better to be in true black and white.  There is color along some of the edges that I feel takes away from the quality of the shot.', '2003-05-07 02:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(290047, 20604, 5925, '<td valign="top">I think what really makes this picture stand out is all of the colors you have going on in there.  The wires also add a little bit of interest.  Good pic.</td>', 'I think what really makes this picture stand out is all of the colors you have going on in there.  The wires also add a little bit of interest.  Good pic.', '2003-05-07 02:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(290050, 20326, 5925, '<td valign="top">This picture looks like it would be so neat, except that it''s so bright I can''t see what''s going on.  Otherwise, I like the colors.</td>', 'This picture looks like it would be so neat, except that it''s so bright I can''t see what''s going on.  Otherwise, I like the colors.', '2003-05-07 02:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(290051, 20747, 7706, '<td valign="top">this image appears to be very out of focus</td>', 'this image appears to be very out of focus', '2003-05-07 02:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(290052, 20767, 7706, '<td valign="top">this photo is very small, its hard to make out details</td>', 'this photo is very small, its hard to make out details', '2003-05-07 02:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(290056, 20840, 5925, '<td valign="top">The colors are great!</td>', 'The colors are great!', '2003-05-07 02:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(290057, 20452, 5925, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, that reflection is beautiful!</td>', 'Oh wow, that reflection is beautiful!', '2003-05-07 03:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(290058, 20695, 7067, '<td valign="top">Aha!  I finally find out what a mason jar is.  Cool.  I''m learning new things all the time with DPC.<br/> <br/>I like the gritty dirty look of the jars and the empty space on the bottom left but would like to see a less cropped version.  Good lighting.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Aha!  I finally find out what a mason jar is.  Cool.  I''m learning new things all the time with DPC. I like the gritty dirty look of the jars and the empty space on the bottom left but would like to see a less cropped version.  Good lighting. ', '2003-05-07 03:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(290059, 20772, 7751, '<td valign="top">What is this??? Interesting photo.</td>', 'What is this??? Interesting photo.', '2003-05-07 03:04:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(290064, 20740, 7067, '<td valign="top">Very pretty set of goblets.  The relfections are either too light to be impactful or too obvious that they are distracting.  Try either using a non reflecting surface (if you want to remove them) or a stronger reflecting surface (if you want to emphasize them).</td>', 'Very pretty set of goblets.  The relfections are either too light to be impactful or too obvious that they are distracting.  Try either using a non reflecting surface (if you want to remove them) or a stronger reflecting surface (if you want to emphasize them).', '2003-05-07 03:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(290066, 20656, 5925, '<td valign="top">So simple... yet so elegant.  Love the color and subject!</td>', 'So simple... yet so elegant.  Love the color and subject!', '2003-05-07 03:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(290069, 20646, 7570, '<td valign="top">the top of the glass shows some flares, and slight blurs on the supposedly black area of the cup''s upper area. The effect might have been better if you have used a completely clear glass instead of this one. The flower pattern on the top did not create a very good effect of light and shadows.</td>', 'the top of the glass shows some flares, and slight blurs on the supposedly black area of the cup''s upper area. The effect might have been better if you have used a completely clear glass instead of this one. The flower pattern on the top did not create a very good effect of light and shadows.', '2003-05-07 03:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(290071, 20355, 7570, '<td valign="top">my guess is you used flash. There is a flare area visible on the upper right side of your glass ball.</td>', 'my guess is you used flash. There is a flare area visible on the upper right side of your glass ball.', '2003-05-07 03:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(290072, 20799, 7751, '<td valign="top">I think this photo could be centered a bit more left to right. There is great detail in this picture. I''m not exactly sure what the letters read, I assume they are factory stamp, or the artisan...Nice photo.</td>', 'I think this photo could be centered a bit more left to right. There is great detail in this picture. I''m not exactly sure what the letters read, I assume they are factory stamp, or the artisan...Nice photo.', '2003-05-07 03:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(290075, 20397, 7570, '<td valign="top">smart angle! I like this one, it DOES create an illusion of a pool at the bottom. I''m not sure if it was done on purpose, but the photo wasn''t taken at exactly the middle of the glass "pool". Anyway, i like this one.</td>', 'smart angle! I like this one, it DOES create an illusion of a pool at the bottom. I''m not sure if it was done on purpose, but the photo wasn''t taken at exactly the middle of the glass "pool". Anyway, i like this one.', '2003-05-07 03:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(290077, 20831, 5925, '<td valign="top">Wow, now this is just a stunning picture!  You''ve got some great lines going here, and the light source is placed perfectly to accentuate those lines.</td>', 'Wow, now this is just a stunning picture!  You''ve got some great lines going here, and the light source is placed perfectly to accentuate those lines.', '2003-05-07 03:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(290078, 20686, 7751, '<td valign="top">With both the glass and the crack in the pavement this is an interesting picture. I think without one of those elements it would be boring.</td>', 'With both the glass and the crack in the pavement this is an interesting picture. I think without one of those elements it would be boring.', '2003-05-07 03:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(290082, 20541, 7751, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. It is nice to see the old textures in the glass, and the effect on your background. Very pretty.</td>', 'This is a great photo. It is nice to see the old textures in the glass, and the effect on your background. Very pretty.', '2003-05-07 03:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(290083, 20315, 7751, '<td valign="top">The only thing I don''t like about this photo is the cropping of the butterfly''s wing.</td>', 'The only thing I don''t like about this photo is the cropping of the butterfly''s wing.', '2003-05-07 03:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(290084, 20244, 5925, '<td valign="top">I give you kudos for having a funny, light-hearted picture!</td>', 'I give you kudos for having a funny, light-hearted picture!', '2003-05-07 03:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(290085, 20773, 7751, '<td valign="top">I think maybe some people might find this title a bit offensive. I see your point, this is very creative. I wish we could see the top corner of the shadow.</td>', 'I think maybe some people might find this title a bit offensive. I see your point, this is very creative. I wish we could see the top corner of the shadow.', '2003-05-07 03:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(290087, 20825, 7751, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what this has to do with glass...I''m a little confused maybe. The photo is not bad. It seems a little soft. But it seems to be a very natural stance.</td>', 'I don''t understand what this has to do with glass...I''m a little confused maybe. The photo is not bad. It seems a little soft. But it seems to be a very natural stance.', '2003-05-07 03:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(290088, 20837, 5925, '<td valign="top">Awesome reflections there.</td>', 'Awesome reflections there.', '2003-05-07 03:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(290090, 20778, 5333, '<td valign="top">Tried and tested. :) very nice indeed. Mayb a hint of nioise.</td>', 'Tried and tested. :) very nice indeed. Mayb a hint of nioise.', '2003-05-07 03:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(290091, 20372, 7570, '<td valign="top">the lighting used overall could be better, maybe a balanced all-round light will help. The shatter design on the glass is too complex.</td>', 'the lighting used overall could be better, maybe a balanced all-round light will help. The shatter design on the glass is too complex.', '2003-05-07 03:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(290093, 20227, 7570, '<td valign="top">if the light from the bulb could be dimmed, then couple that with a long exposure from the camera, it would create a much softer image? anyway for this image, the cropping is not exactly interesting.</td>', 'if the light from the bulb could be dimmed, then couple that with a long exposure from the camera, it would create a much softer image? anyway for this image, the cropping is not exactly interesting.', '2003-05-07 03:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(290095, 20652, 7570, '<td valign="top">the reflection are distracting on the lower left</td>', 'the reflection are distracting on the lower left', '2003-05-07 03:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(290096, 20623, 5333, '<td valign="top">A libiec condenser?  Like what u''ve done to the background. Obiviously i think that the shadow has to go.  :)</td>', 'A libiec condenser?  Like what u''ve done to the background. Obiviously i think that the shadow has to go.  :)', '2003-05-07 03:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(290097, 20463, 5925, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat picture, you got the hammer breaking the glass at exactly the right moment.</td>', 'This is a really neat picture, you got the hammer breaking the glass at exactly the right moment.', '2003-05-07 03:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(290099, 20824, 6388, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you titled it like that, otherwise I''d never have known...</td>', 'I''m glad you titled it like that, otherwise I''d never have known...', '2003-05-07 03:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(290100, 20300, 5333, '<td valign="top">my guess that the lamp post my go.  :)</td>', 'my guess that the lamp post my go.  :)', '2003-05-07 03:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(290101, 20458, 6388, '<td valign="top">I figured someone would do this kind of pic...I didn''t trust myself to time it well enough.  it could take a lot of glasses.  you did it well though.  nice job...lots of cropping?</td>', 'I figured someone would do this kind of pic...I didn''t trust myself to time it well enough.  it could take a lot of glasses.  you did it well though.  nice job...lots of cropping?', '2003-05-07 03:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(290102, 20588, 6388, '<td valign="top">i like the overhead lighting.  nice job.</td>', 'i like the overhead lighting.  nice job.', '2003-05-07 03:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(290103, 20177, 6388, '<td valign="top">one of my favourites.  it''s very simple...framable.  I''m not sure if I like the long lens...I might have liked it with a more defined base...hard to say.  great either way...8.</td>', 'one of my favourites.  it''s very simple...framable.  I''m not sure if I like the long lens...I might have liked it with a more defined base...hard to say.  great either way...8.', '2003-05-07 03:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(290104, 20632, 6388, '<td valign="top">a bit shadowy...nice composition though</td>', 'a bit shadowy...nice composition though', '2003-05-07 03:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
