(290326, 20798, 8274, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what a different depth of field would have given? The subject however is very colourful.</td>', 'I am not sure what a different depth of field would have given? The subject however is very colourful.', '2003-05-07 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(290327, 20670, 8274, '<td valign="top">These are beautiful - simply yet affective.</td>', 'These are beautiful - simply yet affective.', '2003-05-07 10:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(290330, 20738, 5112, '<td valign="top">They talk about Jennifer and Brad, and Madonna, in your country also?</td>', 'They talk about Jennifer and Brad, and Madonna, in your country also?', '2003-05-07 10:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(290332, 20772, 8488, '<td valign="top">This looks pasted-together-in-photoshop - the background and the sphere are not lit anything like the same, and it''s just floating there, disconnected, with no reason for the clouds to even be there. Kind of pretty, but could have been so much better. I''d even grade just a photo of the sphere on a neutral background higher than this.</td>', 'This looks pasted-together-in-photoshop - the background and the sphere are not lit anything like the same, and it''s just floating there, disconnected, with no reason for the clouds to even be there. Kind of pretty, but could have been so much better. I''d even grade just a photo of the sphere on a neutral background higher than this.', '2003-05-07 10:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(290334, 20818, 8488, '<td valign="top">That''s a really bizarre photoshopped background. Just the glass on a plain background, or with interesting shadows, I''d grade higher.</td>', 'That''s a really bizarre photoshopped background. Just the glass on a plain background, or with interesting shadows, I''d grade higher.', '2003-05-07 10:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(290336, 20762, 8488, '<td valign="top">I don''t see much glass in this, unfortunately. Pretty image, pretty lily shot, but ''lilies'' isn''t the theme.</td>', 'I don''t see much glass in this, unfortunately. Pretty image, pretty lily shot, but ''lilies'' isn''t the theme.', '2003-05-07 10:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(290337, 20278, 8488, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot of water. Unfortunately, the theme is ''glass.''</td>', 'Great macro shot of water. Unfortunately, the theme is ''glass.''', '2003-05-07 10:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(290338, 20751, 8488, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what the focus of this is supposed to be. The composition doesn''t lead the eye, so the eye just sits there and goes, ''Huh?''</td>', 'I can''t tell what the focus of this is supposed to be. The composition doesn''t lead the eye, so the eye just sits there and goes, ''Huh?''', '2003-05-07 10:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(290339, 20359, 8488, '<td valign="top">Kind of bright and glarey; I can''t really tell what the picture is of.</td>', 'Kind of bright and glarey; I can''t really tell what the picture is of.', '2003-05-07 10:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(290340, 20121, 8488, '<td valign="top">That''s a great shot of stems and water. Unfortunately, the only glass in this is ''offscreen,'' as it were, holding the water back. Maybe a different crop, to show the shape of the vase, would have gotten a higher mark from me. Nice macro focus, though, and use of the meniscus.</td>', 'That''s a great shot of stems and water. Unfortunately, the only glass in this is ''offscreen,'' as it were, holding the water back. Maybe a different crop, to show the shape of the vase, would have gotten a higher mark from me. Nice macro focus, though, and use of the meniscus.', '2003-05-07 10:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(290341, 20183, 8488, '<td valign="top">A *little* less brightness, so it''s clear that the feet of the glasses are feet of the glasses (and not disconnected little nipple-shaped things sitting on the background in front of short shot-glass style glasses) might have gotten a better grade from me. Still, very good shot.</td>', 'A *little* less brightness, so it''s clear that the feet of the glasses are feet of the glasses (and not disconnected little nipple-shaped things sitting on the background in front of short shot-glass style glasses) might have gotten a better grade from me. Still, very good shot.', '2003-05-07 10:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(290342, 20778, 8488, '<td valign="top">I completely fail to see how this is glass. If the flower is pressed in a spherical glass paperweight which is photoshopped all over the screen, then it probably doesn''t qualify for the competition at all; if not, is this just a bunch of reflections in ... water-drops?</td>', 'I completely fail to see how this is glass. If the flower is pressed in a spherical glass paperweight which is photoshopped all over the screen, then it probably doesn''t qualify for the competition at all; if not, is this just a bunch of reflections in ... water-drops?', '2003-05-07 10:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(290343, 20840, 8488, '<td valign="top">The focus is mostly on the scarf and the colors, with the glass being secondary to the shot, so I have to grade this a little lower (even though it''s a gorgeous shot!) to leave more room in my rankings for things closer to the theme.</td>', 'The focus is mostly on the scarf and the colors, with the glass being secondary to the shot, so I have to grade this a little lower (even though it''s a gorgeous shot!) to leave more room in my rankings for things closer to the theme.', '2003-05-07 10:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(290344, 20593, 8488, '<td valign="top">Cropped so close it could be anything from a butterfly''s wing to an abstract painting. Cropped to incoherence, IMHO.</td>', 'Cropped so close it could be anything from a butterfly''s wing to an abstract painting. Cropped to incoherence, IMHO.', '2003-05-07 10:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(290346, 20827, 8488, '<td valign="top">My, that''s a massive border. I don''t really see how it adds to the shot (in fact, I''d prefer to see more of the actual image and less of the border, personally), though I like the rotational strength of the composition.</td>', 'My, that''s a massive border. I don''t really see how it adds to the shot (in fact, I''d prefer to see more of the actual image and less of the border, personally), though I like the rotational strength of the composition.', '2003-05-07 10:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(290347, 20639, 8488, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this photograph is supposed to be of, at all.</td>', 'I can''t tell what this photograph is supposed to be of, at all.', '2003-05-07 10:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(290349, 20773, 8488, '<td valign="top">Wow. That''s a lovely piece of glass, even before you took a photo of it. :-&gt;</td>', 'Wow. That''s a lovely piece of glass, even before you took a photo of it. :->', '2003-05-07 10:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(290350, 20643, 8488, '<td valign="top">The contrast is so extreme/shot is so dark that it''s almost hard to make out what''s going on.</td>', 'The contrast is so extreme/shot is so dark that it''s almost hard to make out what''s going on.', '2003-05-07 10:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(290352, 20400, 5112, '<td valign="top">If your picture were sharp, it would be one of my favourites.  The layout and the colours are good, but you need a better camera!</td>', 'If your picture were sharp, it would be one of my favourites.  The layout and the colours are good, but you need a better camera!', '2003-05-07 10:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(290355, 20824, 8488, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this picture is supposed to be.</td>', 'I can''t tell what this picture is supposed to be.', '2003-05-07 10:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(290356, 20326, 8488, '<td valign="top">Wow, great stop-motion.</td>', 'Wow, great stop-motion.', '2003-05-07 10:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(290359, 20564, 8488, '<td valign="top">This is cropped closely enough and contrasted darkly enough that it''s hard to tell what it''s meant to be. Also, great shot of condensation, but the theme is ''glass,'' so I have to downgrade a bit.</td>', 'This is cropped closely enough and contrasted darkly enough that it''s hard to tell what it''s meant to be. Also, great shot of condensation, but the theme is ''glass,'' so I have to downgrade a bit.', '2003-05-07 10:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(290360, 20166, 8488, '<td valign="top">This is blurred to incoherence. I can''t see what''s supposed to be in the picture.</td>', 'This is blurred to incoherence. I can''t see what''s supposed to be in the picture.', '2003-05-07 10:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(290364, 20175, 8488, '<td valign="top">Kind of pixelated. A sharper focus might have helped.</td>', 'Kind of pixelated. A sharper focus might have helped.', '2003-05-07 10:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(290366, 20685, 8488, '<td valign="top">Uhm. That''s water, not glass. If the theme were ''reflections,'' ''ovals,'' ''old people,'' or ''gardens,'' this would be an easy 8.</td>', 'Uhm. That''s water, not glass. If the theme were ''reflections,'' ''ovals,'' ''old people,'' or ''gardens,'' this would be an easy 8.', '2003-05-07 10:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
