(290589, 20825, 8488, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any glass. It''s a lovely portrait, but technical quality and beauty are just two of the three criterion I grade on. The third is theme, and it''s just as important. Good technique, beautiful shot, but I don''t see how it fits the theme at all, so I have to grade it low.</td>', 'I don''t see any glass. It''s a lovely portrait, but technical quality and beauty are just two of the three criterion I grade on. The third is theme, and it''s just as important. Good technique, beautiful shot, but I don''t see how it fits the theme at all, so I have to grade it low.', '2003-05-07 12:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
