(290830, 20387, 2677, '<td valign="top">Those aren''t cheap!  It''s look but don''t touch or eat in MY house!</td>', 'Those aren''t cheap!  It''s look but don''t touch or eat in MY house!', '2003-05-07 14:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(290831, 20326, 3607, '<td valign="top">wow - i hope you didn''t have to take this shot to many times.  very neat photo, great capture of action, only complaint is that i assume the glass is being shattered but i can''t make out any of the pieces from the water (and maybe its a little over exposed) but still, very cool.</td>', 'wow - i hope you didn''t have to take this shot to many times.  very neat photo, great capture of action, only complaint is that i assume the glass is being shattered but i can''t make out any of the pieces from the water (and maybe its a little over exposed) but still, very cool.', '2003-05-07 14:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(290834, 20748, 3607, '<td valign="top">elegant composition and colors.  maybe a bit too dark but i love how the dolphins stand out against the black background.</td>', 'elegant composition and colors.  maybe a bit too dark but i love how the dolphins stand out against the black background.', '2003-05-07 14:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(290836, 20568, 3607, '<td valign="top">looks like a nice day for a fight.  i love the sky through the chess pieces.  i wonder if using the dof helps here - it might have been pretty neat if the far pieces were also in focus and we were seeing the sky through them as well.</td>', 'looks like a nice day for a fight.  i love the sky through the chess pieces.  i wonder if using the dof helps here - it might have been pretty neat if the far pieces were also in focus and we were seeing the sky through them as well.', '2003-05-07 14:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(290838, 20215, 1176, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and lighting</td>', 'Nice angle and lighting', '2003-05-07 14:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(290839, 20591, 3607, '<td valign="top">i like the composition.  i think it would have been more powerful if you had been able to use the lighting and post processing to hide the black matt even further.  i just copied into my photo software, decreased the light (gamma), increased the contrast and it was too dark overall, but the backdrop became invisible and i''m sure playing around with light and processing you could have achieved that outcome w/great effect.</td>', 'i like the composition.  i think it would have been more powerful if you had been able to use the lighting and post processing to hide the black matt even further.  i just copied into my photo software, decreased the light (gamma), increased the contrast and it was too dark overall, but the backdrop became invisible and i''m sure playing around with light and processing you could have achieved that outcome w/great effect.', '2003-05-07 14:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(290841, 20830, 1176, '<td valign="top">it´s a bit blury and does not do it for my regarding the topic</td>', 'it´s a bit blury and does not do it for my regarding the topic', '2003-05-07 14:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(290844, 20770, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice symmetry and colors.  the glass is so well lit that i think you could have reduced the gamma (light) overall in the picture, boosted the saturation a bit and had an even stronger picture with strong bright colors contrasting against a darker background.</td>', 'nice symmetry and colors.  the glass is so well lit that i think you could have reduced the gamma (light) overall in the picture, boosted the saturation a bit and had an even stronger picture with strong bright colors contrasting against a darker background.', '2003-05-07 14:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(290845, 20585, 1176, '<td valign="top">right on topic</td>', 'right on topic', '2003-05-07 14:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(290847, 20603, 1176, '<td valign="top">it´s a bit tilted.<br/>better angle would have goten a higher grade from me</td>', 'it´s a bit tilted.better angle would have goten a higher grade from me', '2003-05-07 14:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(290848, 20826, 7778, '<td valign="top">The problem with some subjects is ''connotation'' (just thinking out loud)... And that one would expect something more than mere ''depiction'' of what was there, i.e. a capture making new the inherent natural qualities we perceive prior to filtering the image through camera...<br/> <br/>Since the colour hues found here (especially the leaves bottom left) are rarely seen anymore, this shot gives me something most others can''t. <br/> <br/></td>', 'The problem with some subjects is ''connotation'' (just thinking out loud)... And that one would expect something more than mere ''depiction'' of what was there, i.e. a capture making new the inherent natural qualities we perceive prior to filtering the image through camera... Since the colour hues found here (especially the leaves bottom left) are rarely seen anymore, this shot gives me something most others can''t.  ', '2003-05-07 14:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(290849, 20779, 3607, '<td valign="top">this is a very fun shot.  my only complaint would be that through the trees it looks like its still dusk outside which kind of ruins the ''night time w/neon lights'' mood (i know, its a nit).</td>', 'this is a very fun shot.  my only complaint would be that through the trees it looks like its still dusk outside which kind of ruins the ''night time w/neon lights'' mood (i know, its a nit).', '2003-05-07 14:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(290850, 20808, 1176, '<td valign="top">needs more contrast...or lighting</td>', 'needs more contrast...or lighting', '2003-05-07 14:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(290851, 20146, 3607, '<td valign="top">as i found out with my ''weather'' submission, a little more contrast would have made it a lot stronger submission.  still, very cool patterns and capture.</td>', 'as i found out with my ''weather'' submission, a little more contrast would have made it a lot stronger submission.  still, very cool patterns and capture.', '2003-05-07 14:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(290853, 20842, 7778, '<td valign="top">Overly perfected, too commercial. Lacks humanity (IMO).</td>', 'Overly perfected, too commercial. Lacks humanity (IMO).', '2003-05-07 14:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(290854, 20718, 1176, '<td valign="top">to dark for me</td>', 'to dark for me', '2003-05-07 14:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
