(290861, 20830, 3607, '<td valign="top">and symmetry.  neat idea and well done.  i don''t know of you could have done anything about the additional light/shadow spots on the lower left side, but that would be the only nit i could find.</td>', 'and symmetry.  neat idea and well done.  i don''t know of you could have done anything about the additional light/shadow spots on the lower left side, but that would be the only nit i could find.', '2003-05-07 14:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(290862, 20706, 1176, '<td valign="top">the colors are a bit dull</td>', 'the colors are a bit dull', '2003-05-07 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(290866, 20774, 3607, '<td valign="top">neat.  nice lighting, focus and composition.  where the lower left edge looks like it melts into the gold border that can distract the eye, but that''s just a small nit.</td>', 'neat.  nice lighting, focus and composition.  where the lower left edge looks like it melts into the gold border that can distract the eye, but that''s just a small nit.', '2003-05-07 14:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(290867, 20726, 7778, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, technically perfect, well presented with the sepia linking to title, albeit not something likely to inspire, emote or capable of telling something new or differently.</td>', 'Excellent composition, technically perfect, well presented with the sepia linking to title, albeit not something likely to inspire, emote or capable of telling something new or differently.', '2003-05-07 14:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(290868, 20157, 1176, '<td valign="top">very clear, almost looks like a rendering</td>', 'very clear, almost looks like a rendering', '2003-05-07 14:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(290869, 20634, 3607, '<td valign="top">cool idea and well done.  the blue lighting was also a cool choice.  must have been a pain to focus through the glass, but the outcome is great.</td>', 'cool idea and well done.  the blue lighting was also a cool choice.  must have been a pain to focus through the glass, but the outcome is great.', '2003-05-07 14:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(290873, 20228, 7778, '<td valign="top">but the subject remains a dull one...</td>', 'but the subject remains a dull one...', '2003-05-07 14:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(290874, 20623, 7758, '<td valign="top">both good and bad use of DOF in my opinion.... works well on the background.... but detracts from the image with the loss of focus in the foreground... i would perhaps have rotated the bottle to get the entire thing in focus.... of course that may not have been possible.... overall I like it... just a little distracting that bit in the foreground.... good luck Todd.</td>', 'both good and bad use of DOF in my opinion.... works well on the background.... but detracts from the image with the loss of focus in the foreground... i would perhaps have rotated the bottle to get the entire thing in focus.... of course that may not have been possible.... overall I like it... just a little distracting that bit in the foreground.... good luck Todd.', '2003-05-07 14:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(290876, 20793, 7758, '<td valign="top">Technically quite good..... not wrapped in the background colour....</td>', 'Technically quite good..... not wrapped in the background colour....', '2003-05-07 14:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(290878, 20770, 7778, '<td valign="top">Does this shot give us anything beyond what was there prior to camera interference?</td>', 'Does this shot give us anything beyond what was there prior to camera interference?', '2003-05-07 14:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(290881, 20767, 7778, '<td valign="top">Damn, this is small!</td>', 'Damn, this is small!', '2003-05-07 14:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(290885, 20458, 3607, '<td valign="top">wow.  awesome photo.  hope you didn''t have too many takes for this one.  please make more mistakes next time so i will find something constructive to say ;-)  oh yeah, maybe if you boosted the saturation a bit the red would have come out a little brighter which against the strong white exposure might have given the photo a little more zing.</td>', 'wow.  awesome photo.  hope you didn''t have too many takes for this one.  please make more mistakes next time so i will find something constructive to say ;-)  oh yeah, maybe if you boosted the saturation a bit the red would have come out a little brighter which against the strong white exposure might have given the photo a little more zing.', '2003-05-07 14:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
