(290912, 20496, 6388, '<td valign="top">I''m all for high key images, but I think in this case you''d have had a nicer result without the overexposure.  I think it''s because of the light colors - the edges of the vase and petals of the flower wash out a bit much for my taste.  I like what you were going for though.  very nice lighting setup...just a bit too intense.</td>', 'I''m all for high key images, but I think in this case you''d have had a nicer result without the overexposure.  I think it''s because of the light colors - the edges of the vase and petals of the flower wash out a bit much for my taste.  I like what you were going for though.  very nice lighting setup...just a bit too intense.', '2003-05-07 15:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
