(291060, 20840, 7758, '<td valign="top">nice use of light.... the image stands up pretty well.... perhaps I would have blue lit the glass and red lit the scarf.... I think this would highlight the glass better and make for a stronger composition.... the eye is drawn strongly to the blue rather than the glass..... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'nice use of light.... the image stands up pretty well.... perhaps I would have blue lit the glass and red lit the scarf.... I think this would highlight the glass better and make for a stronger composition.... the eye is drawn strongly to the blue rather than the glass..... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-07 16:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(291064, 20087, 7758, '<td valign="top">not sure what I''m looking at but I like it. Good mood and balance.... can''t fault it technically..... visually it''s very strong..... okay, this is my first 10 for this challenge.... i think this should do really well.... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'not sure what I''m looking at but I like it. Good mood and balance.... can''t fault it technically..... visually it''s very strong..... okay, this is my first 10 for this challenge.... i think this should do really well.... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-07 17:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(291068, 20226, 2677, '<td valign="top">Use the right WB.  I don''t like the orange tone.</td>', 'Use the right WB.  I don''t like the orange tone.', '2003-05-07 17:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(291071, 20783, 208, '<td valign="top">Well conceived shot. I really like the framing and the color contrast. I think, though, the base is out of place; could have used either color or texture. Overall a great shot.</td>', 'Well conceived shot. I really like the framing and the color contrast. I think, though, the base is out of place; could have used either color or texture. Overall a great shot.', '2003-05-07 17:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(291072, 20764, 7857, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject choice, and unusual sample. Shame you were unable to get it all in focus, still a very nice shot!</td>', 'Excellent subject choice, and unusual sample. Shame you were unable to get it all in focus, still a very nice shot!', '2003-05-07 17:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(291074, 20568, 7969, '<td valign="top">i like your composition,  and outdoors, but wish pieces were sharper</td>', 'i like your composition,  and outdoors, but wish pieces were sharper', '2003-05-07 17:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(291075, 20450, 7758, '<td valign="top">it may be clever but it''s just possible that I''m not..... if that glass is in the far hole, the one that is in focus, then I can''t see it.... if it''s the round bit that''s closer, then it''s out of focus..... either way I don''t think this is an overly strong image..... too much foreground and background and the round thing on the left is quite distracting too.... I''d be happy to discuss this with you after the challenge, maybe I''m missing something..... not sure...... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'it may be clever but it''s just possible that I''m not..... if that glass is in the far hole, the one that is in focus, then I can''t see it.... if it''s the round bit that''s closer, then it''s out of focus..... either way I don''t think this is an overly strong image..... too much foreground and background and the round thing on the left is quite distracting too.... I''d be happy to discuss this with you after the challenge, maybe I''m missing something..... not sure...... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-07 17:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(291081, 20837, 7969, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect of the reflection,  but the bottom of the glass is a bit too white.</td>', 'I really like the effect of the reflection,  but the bottom of the glass is a bit too white.', '2003-05-07 17:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(291082, 20651, 7994, '<td valign="top">very nice composition</td>', 'very nice composition', '2003-05-07 17:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(291084, 20316, 2677, '<td valign="top">Glass?</td>', 'Glass?', '2003-05-07 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(291086, 20416, 7758, '<td valign="top">Strong visual, nice focus.... possibly a bit grainy or reddish spots in the blue.... but overall it''s a well balanced image.... I think this will do well.... the blue and the red work well to create a nice contrast..... very good, hopefully the ladybug is made of glass too! I''m giving it a 9.... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'Strong visual, nice focus.... possibly a bit grainy or reddish spots in the blue.... but overall it''s a well balanced image.... I think this will do well.... the blue and the red work well to create a nice contrast..... very good, hopefully the ladybug is made of glass too! I''m giving it a 9.... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-07 17:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
