(291089, 20325, 208, '<td valign="top">The smoke effect is nice, but it''s the hint of color I like best in this shot.</td>', 'The smoke effect is nice, but it''s the hint of color I like best in this shot.', '2003-05-07 17:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
