(291156, 20458, 6464, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.  Hopefully you didn''t have to try it too many times to capture the shot.  I like how more of the glass ended up to the left, and more liquid to the right.</td>', 'Great action shot.  Hopefully you didn''t have to try it too many times to capture the shot.  I like how more of the glass ended up to the left, and more liquid to the right.', '2003-05-07 18:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
