(291166, 20749, 6565, '<td valign="top">A bit more reflection in the window would make me feel like this was focused more on the challenge, but the photo itself is lovely!</td>', 'A bit more reflection in the window would make me feel like this was focused more on the challenge, but the photo itself is lovely!', '2003-05-07 18:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
