(291354, 20146, 1202, '<td valign="top">A real nice idea, I would have liked more definition and contrast.   I also think your focus is qiute a bit off, too much for this type of shot.  5</td>', 'A real nice idea, I would have liked more definition and contrast.   I also think your focus is qiute a bit off, too much for this type of shot.  5', '2003-05-07 20:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(291355, 20798, 1176, '<td valign="top">cool focus trick<br/>I would have liked it more if the birds had more space between them so I could see the one in the center better.<br/>That way it might not have been so bussy.</td>', 'cool focus trickI would have liked it more if the birds had more space between them so I could see the one in the center better.That way it might not have been so bussy.', '2003-05-07 20:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(291356, 20591, 2333, '<td valign="top">The reflections add so much to this image. That and your choice of exposure. Focus is exactly where it needed to be, right on the sharp broken edges.<br/>Are the reflections a window treatment or the inside of a light tent?</td>', 'The reflections add so much to this image. That and your choice of exposure. Focus is exactly where it needed to be, right on the sharp broken edges.Are the reflections a window treatment or the inside of a light tent?', '2003-05-07 20:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(291357, 20463, 6388, '<td valign="top">you''d have had me if I only saw the thumbnail.  nice setup either way.  :)</td>', 'you''d have had me if I only saw the thumbnail.  nice setup either way.  :)', '2003-05-07 20:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(291358, 20522, 6388, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this meets the challenge.  I''m kidding.  what a great building...and a whole lot of glass.  refreshing angle to shoot a building at.</td>', 'I don''t see how this meets the challenge.  I''m kidding.  what a great building...and a whole lot of glass.  refreshing angle to shoot a building at.', '2003-05-07 20:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(291359, 20782, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice use of depth...i like the blue cast to it, and the good news is I can''t tell if it''s photoshop or natural.  good job</td>', 'nice use of depth...i like the blue cast to it, and the good news is I can''t tell if it''s photoshop or natural.  good job', '2003-05-07 20:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(291360, 20157, 6388, '<td valign="top">I''m glad I saw the validation...it''s surreal looking  one of the more creative ones in my opinion.  nice.</td>', 'I''m glad I saw the validation...it''s surreal looking  one of the more creative ones in my opinion.  nice.', '2003-05-07 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(291361, 20452, 8023, '<td valign="top">Love this idea....what city is the photo taken in??</td>', 'Love this idea....what city is the photo taken in??', '2003-05-07 20:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(291362, 20533, 6388, '<td valign="top">I assume those colours are photoshopped, but I really like the effect.  good job.</td>', 'I assume those colours are photoshopped, but I really like the effect.  good job.', '2003-05-07 20:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(291363, 20496, 772, '<td valign="top">the lighting here is lovely... beautiful work with the soft colors.. = 10 - setzler</td>', 'the lighting here is lovely... beautiful work with the soft colors.. = 10 - setzler', '2003-05-07 20:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(291364, 20642, 6388, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, but might have used a backdrop with less texture, or a darker colour.  it kind of washes out the vase IMO.  otherwise very nice.</td>', 'I like the lighting, but might have used a backdrop with less texture, or a darker colour.  it kind of washes out the vase IMO.  otherwise very nice.', '2003-05-07 20:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(291365, 20829, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful work... i would tive this shot a 10 with a touch more depth of field to increase the sharpness on the bottom and top portion of the glass... great work :) = 9 - setzler</td>', 'beautiful work... i would tive this shot a 10 with a touch more depth of field to increase the sharpness on the bottom and top portion of the glass... great work :) = 9 - setzler', '2003-05-07 20:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(291366, 20223, 6388, '<td valign="top">beautiful colour.  very difficult to shoot stained glass in my mind.  i like the title as well.</td>', 'beautiful colour.  very difficult to shoot stained glass in my mind.  i like the title as well.', '2003-05-07 20:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(291367, 20837, 2158, '<td valign="top">The shadows are great, but that white spot where the light is doesn''t work too well for me.  Perhaps if you''d had your light source a bit higher up, it would have solved this problem.  This is one of the more creative entries I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'The shadows are great, but that white spot where the light is doesn''t work too well for me.  Perhaps if you''d had your light source a bit higher up, it would have solved this problem.  This is one of the more creative entries I''ve seen so far.', '2003-05-07 20:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(291368, 20800, 6388, '<td valign="top">I know I won''t be the only one to say this, but I''d lighten it a liiiiitle.  I get what you''re going for, and I like the idea,  I''d just like a little more to go on.</td>', 'I know I won''t be the only one to say this, but I''d lighten it a liiiiitle.  I get what you''re going for, and I like the idea,  I''d just like a little more to go on.', '2003-05-07 20:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(291369, 20326, 6388, '<td valign="top">a little heavy on the saturation (unless it''s just my monitor) for my tastes, but i like the idea.  good shot.</td>', 'a little heavy on the saturation (unless it''s just my monitor) for my tastes, but i like the idea.  good shot.', '2003-05-07 20:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(291370, 20740, 2741, '<td valign="top">This looks great. Color is soft... Detail is very good.... Composition very good.. and the reflection adds a little mood. 9....</td>', 'This looks great. Color is soft... Detail is very good.... Composition very good.. and the reflection adds a little mood. 9....', '2003-05-07 21:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(291371, 20836, 2158, '<td valign="top">This is a really good picture, but I don''t really see the glass as the subject of the photo.</td>', 'This is a really good picture, but I don''t really see the glass as the subject of the photo.', '2003-05-07 21:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(291372, 20304, 6388, '<td valign="top">If it were mine I''d maybe crop to centre it (or make it more off centre...either one) and lighten it enough to silhouette the stem.  but that''s just me.  very nice shot.</td>', 'If it were mine I''d maybe crop to centre it (or make it more off centre...either one) and lighten it enough to silhouette the stem.  but that''s just me.  very nice shot.', '2003-05-07 21:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(291375, 20820, 6388, '<td valign="top">the resolution appears really low...maybe you just cropped it too much?</td>', 'the resolution appears really low...maybe you just cropped it too much?', '2003-05-07 21:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(291380, 20211, 6388, '<td valign="top">well lit, nice crop.  the bottom left seems to wash out a bit...not sure why.  It''s a pretty distinct line, so maybe just an anomoly in the glass.  nice pic either way.</td>', 'well lit, nice crop.  the bottom left seems to wash out a bit...not sure why.  It''s a pretty distinct line, so maybe just an anomoly in the glass.  nice pic either way.', '2003-05-07 21:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(291382, 20266, 2158, '<td valign="top">I love the angle you''ve used here.  One little thing - you should have turned that top strawberry around so that the white patch didn''t show.</td>', 'I love the angle you''ve used here.  One little thing - you should have turned that top strawberry around so that the white patch didn''t show.', '2003-05-07 21:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(291388, 20201, 3308, '<td valign="top">Whoa...brings back a lot of late-night memories.  *grin*  Great perspective, I especially like the "beer goggle" effect of the keypad on the telephone.  I''m sure some might comment on the uneven lighting, but for me it helps me feel the "last call" ambience.</td>', 'Whoa...brings back a lot of late-night memories.  *grin*  Great perspective, I especially like the "beer goggle" effect of the keypad on the telephone.  I''m sure some might comment on the uneven lighting, but for me it helps me feel the "last call" ambience.', '2003-05-07 21:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(291389, 20763, 2923, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  It''s not in focus, but who the hell cares, you stil l get a 10 :-)</td>', 'I like this a lot.  It''s not in focus, but who the hell cares, you stil l get a 10 :-)', '2003-05-07 21:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(291394, 20215, 2923, '<td valign="top">i''d like to see less shadows on the background.  but it''s very nice. 8</td>', 'i''d like to see less shadows on the background.  but it''s very nice. 8', '2003-05-07 21:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(291395, 20800, 2158, '<td valign="top">The lemon is the highlight here and there is too little of the glass visible.  The top right corner would be great for some other challenge.</td>', 'The lemon is the highlight here and there is too little of the glass visible.  The top right corner would be great for some other challenge.', '2003-05-07 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(291396, 20737, 3308, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I wish you could have had a bit more natural light to help the background appear less non-distinct, but it does help give this a "cold" feel.  Good macro, too.</td>', 'Great idea.  I wish you could have had a bit more natural light to help the background appear less non-distinct, but it does help give this a "cold" feel.  Good macro, too.', '2003-05-07 21:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(291406, 20682, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have attempted a very difficult shot.   Low light on subject and intense light from the candle.   This type of shot has to be taken with a very small f-stop and as long an exposere that you can use to keep the candle from being over exposed.  As I said very difficult.   4</td>', 'You have attempted a very difficult shot.   Low light on subject and intense light from the candle.   This type of shot has to be taken with a very small f-stop and as long an exposere that you can use to keep the candle from being over exposed.  As I said very difficult.   4', '2003-05-07 21:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(291408, 20546, 3308, '<td valign="top">Great use of reflection and light here.  Reminds me a bit of an MC Escher drawing.  Very interesting photo. :)</td>', 'Great use of reflection and light here.  Reminds me a bit of an MC Escher drawing.  Very interesting photo. :)', '2003-05-07 21:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(291410, 20142, 1202, '<td valign="top">You are pretty brave with the Deppresion Glass title with the young audience on DPC.   I doubt that many know what you are referring to.   I like your shot but I think more backlight would give it some needed life.  5</td>', 'You are pretty brave with the Deppresion Glass title with the young audience on DPC.   I doubt that many know what you are referring to.   I like your shot but I think more backlight would give it some needed life.  5', '2003-05-07 21:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(291414, 20166, 1202, '<td valign="top">Abstract it is, and "cobalt" it is also, however it doesn''t hold my interest.   Maybe a long sided crop would add to its interest.   Correct spelling in a title is sooooo very important!   4</td>', 'Abstract it is, and "cobalt" it is also, however it doesn''t hold my interest.   Maybe a long sided crop would add to its interest.   Correct spelling in a title is sooooo very important!   4', '2003-05-07 21:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(291418, 20831, 1202, '<td valign="top">Simplicity is wonderful. A 9 from me for your use of light and imagination.</td>', 'Simplicity is wonderful. A 9 from me for your use of light and imagination.', '2003-05-07 21:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
