(291442, 20720, 6388, '<td valign="top">high ISO?  It''s really grainy, but that doesn''t actually take away from it for me.   Great timing...and interesting use of an...ashtray(?) to smash the bulb on.</td>', 'high ISO?  It''s really grainy, but that doesn''t actually take away from it for me.   Great timing...and interesting use of an...ashtray(?) to smash the bulb on.', '2003-05-07 21:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
