(291502, 20726, 4967, '<td valign="top">Was this picture taken straight downwards on a piece of white paper, with the glass just sticking straigght up, looks too perfect to be falling pills, but it''s a very cool trick.  Very interesting what you did here... I like the border with the single pixel (or two?) offwhite line before the black,  I think your lighting is very nicely done... what kind of pills are these really?  Are they actually depression pills?  Nice job. -8-</td>', 'Was this picture taken straight downwards on a piece of white paper, with the glass just sticking straigght up, looks too perfect to be falling pills, but it''s a very cool trick.  Very interesting what you did here... I like the border with the single pixel (or two?) offwhite line before the black,  I think your lighting is very nicely done... what kind of pills are these really?  Are they actually depression pills?  Nice job. -8-', '2003-05-07 22:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
