(291504, 20812, 4967, '<td valign="top">Interesting what you went for here, but it''s not as clear as nice as I think it should be, one of the probleems with shooting through glass... it can be very hard with lighting and everything... the whole thing looks a little muted.  good idea though.</td>', 'Interesting what you went for here, but it''s not as clear as nice as I think it should be, one of the probleems with shooting through glass... it can be very hard with lighting and everything... the whole thing looks a little muted.  good idea though.', '2003-05-07 22:48:04.000000', NULL, 1);
