(291509, 20215, 4967, '<td valign="top">I find this to be very beautiufl, very nice job with your lighting, awesome effect with the marbles and the stem inside the glass... Cool perspective, overall a very nice job, what is the white in the bottom middle though?  -9-</td>', 'I find this to be very beautiufl, very nice job with your lighting, awesome effect with the marbles and the stem inside the glass... Cool perspective, overall a very nice job, what is the white in the bottom middle though?  -9-', '2003-05-07 22:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
