(291986, 20631, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, well set up and the lighting is very fitting. Your border also fits the image perfectly which I can''t say for too many borders I have been seeing lately.</td>', 'Wonderful image, well set up and the lighting is very fitting. Your border also fits the image perfectly which I can''t say for too many borders I have been seeing lately.', '2003-05-08 11:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(291987, 20725, 7758, '<td valign="top">nice try..... those little gaps are distracting and it might have been better to try and shoot this with a different lighting source.... it looks like you used the flash on the camera.... might have been better to shoot it using daylight.... maybe not direct sunlight but perhaps in the shade or using daylight through a window.... not sure.... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'nice try..... those little gaps are distracting and it might have been better to try and shoot this with a different lighting source.... it looks like you used the flash on the camera.... might have been better to shoot it using daylight.... maybe not direct sunlight but perhaps in the shade or using daylight through a window.... not sure.... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-08 11:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(291988, 20085, 5728, '<td valign="top">I thought I would see more marbles in this challenge but surprisingly enough there are very few. This is the best shot of all the marbles I''ve seen so far, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I thought I would see more marbles in this challenge but surprisingly enough there are very few. This is the best shot of all the marbles I''ve seen so far, good luck in the challenge.', '2003-05-08 11:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(291990, 20365, 7758, '<td valign="top">this need tighter cropping and straightening, maybe could be a little sharper.... good effort though, I like the shadow in the background... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'this need tighter cropping and straightening, maybe could be a little sharper.... good effort though, I like the shadow in the background... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-08 11:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(291997, 20723, 7639, '<td valign="top">Gives a strange three dimensional effect - like the surface of water.</td>', 'Gives a strange three dimensional effect - like the surface of water.', '2003-05-08 11:32:44.000000', NULL, 1);
