(292014, 20634, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very original indeed! And you have mastered the lighting and post processing perfectly. I take my hat off to you!</td>', 'Very original indeed! And you have mastered the lighting and post processing perfectly. I take my hat off to you!', '2003-05-08 11:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
