(292020, 20679, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.   If you could have done this without the demarcation of table top and backdrop it would have been super.  A little tilted which shows up exagerated in the reflection.  6</td>', 'Nice concept.   If you could have done this without the demarcation of table top and backdrop it would have been super.  A little tilted which shows up exagerated in the reflection.  6', '2003-05-08 11:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
