(292370, 20223, 5869, '<td valign="top">Is this a stained glass windows or a kaleidascope?  Glass?  colour good, focus good?image good?</td>', 'Is this a stained glass windows or a kaleidascope?  Glass?  colour good, focus good?image good?', '2003-05-08 16:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(292372, 20837, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept but the overly bright spot in the glass detracts from the whole picture.   If you could tone that down a bit I would rate it very high.   7</td>', 'This is a great concept but the overly bright spot in the glass detracts from the whole picture.   If you could tone that down a bit I would rate it very high.   7', '2003-05-08 17:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(292373, 20183, 5869, '<td valign="top">Yep sure is glasses with colour.  Meets the challenge and adds interest with nice choice of colours.</td>', 'Yep sure is glasses with colour.  Meets the challenge and adds interest with nice choice of colours.', '2003-05-08 17:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(292375, 20787, 5869, '<td valign="top">Stained and Glass.  Nice image</td>', 'Stained and Glass.  Nice image', '2003-05-08 17:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(292376, 20458, 1204, '<td valign="top">Þetta er náttúrulega bara tær snilld.  Það eina sem má gagnrýna er að menn afhjúpi myndir sínar á netinu áður en kosningu er lokið.  En þetta er 10 samt.</td>', 'Þetta er náttúrulega bara tær snilld.  Það eina sem má gagnrýna er að menn afhjúpi myndir sínar á netinu áður en kosningu er lokið.  En þetta er 10 samt.', '2003-05-08 17:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(292377, 20547, 6663, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity on the shot, lovely range of blues.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity on the shot, lovely range of blues.', '2003-05-08 17:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(292378, 20441, 5869, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Unfortunately the abstract bit detracts from the galss bit (in my ever so humble opinion) and the galss bit is a tad over exposed mid right.  Still I really like the image</td>', 'Great idea.  Unfortunately the abstract bit detracts from the galss bit (in my ever so humble opinion) and the galss bit is a tad over exposed mid right.  Still I really like the image', '2003-05-08 17:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(292380, 20604, 5869, '<td valign="top">yeahhhhh</td>', 'yeahhhhh', '2003-05-08 17:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(292383, 20836, 6663, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge.', '2003-05-08 17:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(292384, 20397, 1204, '<td valign="top">Bright idea!  Question of a tighter crop and skip the sky altogether - make the illusion perfect.</td>', 'Bright idea!  Question of a tighter crop and skip the sky altogether - make the illusion perfect.', '2003-05-08 17:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(292387, 20845, 6663, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting, beautiful sense of perspective. A very good picture. Congratulations.</td>', 'Fantastic lighting, beautiful sense of perspective. A very good picture. Congratulations.', '2003-05-08 17:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(292394, 20365, 6388, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a little flat for my taste, but I like it.  It''s no blue glass head, mind you, but the idea is the same.</td>', 'the lighting is a little flat for my taste, but I like it.  It''s no blue glass head, mind you, but the idea is the same.', '2003-05-08 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(292395, 20818, 6388, '<td valign="top">one of the better ones of this nature. I love the backdrop</td>', 'one of the better ones of this nature. I love the backdrop', '2003-05-08 17:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(292396, 20760, 6663, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent idea. Creative photography.</td>', 'This is an excellent idea. Creative photography.', '2003-05-08 17:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(292398, 20463, 6663, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Really original take on the ''broken glass'' theme to include the hammer. Perfectly-timed shutter too - caught exactly the right moment. Excellent.</td>', 'Great photo. Really original take on the ''broken glass'' theme to include the hammer. Perfectly-timed shutter too - caught exactly the right moment. Excellent.', '2003-05-08 17:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(292402, 20825, 6663, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I see no real reference to glass here.</td>', 'I''m afraid I see no real reference to glass here.', '2003-05-08 17:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(292405, 20320, 6663, '<td valign="top">I was hoping someone would pull one of these off this week - I didn''t have a prism and in the end I didn''t submit anything either! I thought this was a good idea for the theme anyway, so I''m pleased to see it in here at last!</td>', 'I was hoping someone would pull one of these off this week - I didn''t have a prism and in the end I didn''t submit anything either! I thought this was a good idea for the theme anyway, so I''m pleased to see it in here at last!', '2003-05-08 17:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(292407, 20815, 6663, '<td valign="top">Why the purple border? I feel it drags the eye away from the (rather beautiful) subject of the photo.</td>', 'Why the purple border? I feel it drags the eye away from the (rather beautiful) subject of the photo.', '2003-05-08 17:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(292408, 20780, 6388, '<td valign="top">careful.  Gin''ll make you go blind.  Although that shouldn''t apply to Tanqueray...it''s like mother''s milk.</td>', 'careful.  Gin''ll make you go blind.  Although that shouldn''t apply to Tanqueray...it''s like mother''s milk.', '2003-05-08 17:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(292409, 20157, 6663, '<td valign="top">Ahhh...JPG! Lovely stuff.</td>', 'Ahhh...JPG! Lovely stuff.', '2003-05-08 17:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(292410, 20761, 6388, '<td valign="top">I like that.  not the crack...I hate those.  but i like your picture.  nice tight crop, and the BW works.</td>', 'I like that.  not the crack...I hate those.  but i like your picture.  nice tight crop, and the BW works.', '2003-05-08 17:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(292411, 20586, 6388, '<td valign="top">really like the lighting on this. you achieved where many others failed in this challenge I think.  good job</td>', 'really like the lighting on this. you achieved where many others failed in this challenge I think.  good job', '2003-05-08 17:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(292412, 20397, 6663, '<td valign="top">This is excellent work. Took me a few seconds to realise this is looking straight up. Really clever photo, and a very well-chosen title.</td>', 'This is excellent work. Took me a few seconds to realise this is looking straight up. Really clever photo, and a very well-chosen title.', '2003-05-08 17:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(292420, 20737, 7504, '<td valign="top">Not really thrilled about the background, but the broken glass is cool!</td>', 'Not really thrilled about the background, but the broken glass is cool!', '2003-05-08 17:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(292422, 20738, 7504, '<td valign="top">Cute, I like the glass on the magazine.</td>', 'Cute, I like the glass on the magazine.', '2003-05-08 17:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(292423, 20453, 6388, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like borders, but you did this one very well.  Unlike a thread I just read, my opinion is that you CAN ruin a nice pic with a bad border.  The only thing I''d change about this (and this is reeeeeally being nit-picky) is the crop at the top.  My personal taste would have left either more or less of the title of the book showing.  The box around the title disappears off-angle, and then shows up again in corner, and throws the balance off a bit.  I like the lighting and shadows..even the flare on the glasses; which technically we''re supposed to avoid, aren''t we?  :)  very nice composition, John...er..whoever you are. (nice that the authors kept the press plates from their book...was that Dad and Grandpa  who wrote that?)</td>', 'I don''t usually like borders, but you did this one very well.  Unlike a thread I just read, my opinion is that you CAN ruin a nice pic with a bad border.  The only thing I''d change about this (and this is reeeeeally being nit-picky) is the crop at the top.  My personal taste would have left either more or less of the title of the book showing.  The box around the title disappears off-angle, and then shows up again in corner, and throws the balance off a bit.  I like the lighting and shadows..even the flare on the glasses; which technically we''re supposed to avoid, aren''t we?  :)  very nice composition, John...er..whoever you are. (nice that the authors kept the press plates from their book...was that Dad and Grandpa  who wrote that?)', '2003-05-08 17:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(292424, 20662, 7504, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the frame straightened, but that''s just a personal preference.  Beautiful window!</td>', 'I''d like to see the frame straightened, but that''s just a personal preference.  Beautiful window!', '2003-05-08 17:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(292426, 20392, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like the circles in this.  Very creative.  Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'I like the circles in this.  Very creative.  Nice take on the challenge.', '2003-05-08 17:43:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(292427, 20644, 1897, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  There is not a element that "pops" but I am not sure how to do that, maybe some color or contrast?  Good work - 8</td>', 'I like this a lot.  There is not a element that "pops" but I am not sure how to do that, maybe some color or contrast?  Good work - 8', '2003-05-08 17:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(292429, 20732, 6388, '<td valign="top">fantastic clarity...impressive for under 150kb.  a couple of hot spots from the overhead lighting, but not too bad.  I like it</td>', 'fantastic clarity...impressive for under 150kb.  a couple of hot spots from the overhead lighting, but not too bad.  I like it', '2003-05-08 17:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(292430, 20163, 7504, '<td valign="top">I love the yellow wall and the flowers in the reflection.  Nice job!</td>', 'I love the yellow wall and the flowers in the reflection.  Nice job!', '2003-05-08 17:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(292433, 20825, 1897, '<td valign="top">great portrait, but what is the glass element?</td>', 'great portrait, but what is the glass element?', '2003-05-08 17:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(292434, 20794, 1897, '<td valign="top">excellent, great reflections</td>', 'excellent, great reflections', '2003-05-08 17:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(292435, 20299, 1897, '<td valign="top">Great black and white, nice contrast</td>', 'Great black and white, nice contrast', '2003-05-08 17:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(292436, 20680, 1897, '<td valign="top">colors are a little soft, 7</td>', 'colors are a little soft, 7', '2003-05-08 17:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(292438, 20747, 6388, '<td valign="top">hard to know where to focus on these shots.  using a short lens (or wide angle) would help.  it just looks a little soft to me.  I like how ou tried to match up the horizons.  good shot.</td>', 'hard to know where to focus on these shots.  using a short lens (or wide angle) would help.  it just looks a little soft to me.  I like how ou tried to match up the horizons.  good shot.', '2003-05-08 17:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(292440, 20418, 6388, '<td valign="top">the post adds a nice bit of character to this.  I took about  a thousand building shots and didn''t get one I liked.  nice job.</td>', 'the post adds a nice bit of character to this.  I took about  a thousand building shots and didn''t get one I liked.  nice job.', '2003-05-08 17:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(292441, 20827, 6388, '<td valign="top">not sure about the angle you chose.  I don''t love borders on pictures...I usually find them a bit distracting, and this is no exception.  with the angles in the photo and the angles in the border, I find myself wanteing to tilt my head. (in fact...I''m tilting it right now as I type).  I don''t know how else to do it, but that''s my initial impression.  It''s refreshing though, especially after 260 pics or so.  good idea.  Pedro</td>', 'not sure about the angle you chose.  I don''t love borders on pictures...I usually find them a bit distracting, and this is no exception.  with the angles in the photo and the angles in the border, I find myself wanteing to tilt my head. (in fact...I''m tilting it right now as I type).  I don''t know how else to do it, but that''s my initial impression.  It''s refreshing though, especially after 260 pics or so.  good idea.  Pedro', '2003-05-08 17:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(292444, 20755, 6388, '<td valign="top">is that like beer goggles? :)  the lighting came out a little flat for my taste.  I might have boosted the contrast a bit, or desaturated it completely if it were mine.  just a thought...</td>', 'is that like beer goggles? :)  the lighting came out a little flat for my taste.  I might have boosted the contrast a bit, or desaturated it completely if it were mine.  just a thought...', '2003-05-08 17:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(292446, 20212, 6388, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see kitty''s face a bit clearer...i think if you lighted it lower, or  used more of a backlight, you could have cleared her up a bit.  It''d get rid of that shadow and the little flares too.  or maybe you like those :)  that''s just my opinion.  Pedro</td>', 'I''d like to see kitty''s face a bit clearer...i think if you lighted it lower, or  used more of a backlight, you could have cleared her up a bit.  It''d get rid of that shadow and the little flares too.  or maybe you like those :)  that''s just my opinion.  Pedro', '2003-05-08 17:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(292447, 20836, 6388, '<td valign="top">my favourite of the day!  this better get a ribbon friend, I really like it.  If I''m being reeeeally picky, I''d say a slightly darker backdrop would give some (IMO) needed costrast to the bowl.  Go to DCPrints with this.  Excellent. 9 (my only vote over an 8 by the way)</td>', 'my favourite of the day!  this better get a ribbon friend, I really like it.  If I''m being reeeeally picky, I''d say a slightly darker backdrop would give some (IMO) needed costrast to the bowl.  Go to DCPrints with this.  Excellent. 9 (my only vote over an 8 by the way)', '2003-05-08 17:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(292449, 20567, 6388, '<td valign="top">these birds are hard to photograph becasue of all the hot spots the lighting creates.  I might have thrown  a little blue into the backdrop if it were my, but that''s just an opinion.  Pedro</td>', 'these birds are hard to photograph becasue of all the hot spots the lighting creates.  I might have thrown  a little blue into the backdrop if it were my, but that''s just an opinion.  Pedro', '2003-05-08 18:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(292453, 20188, 6388, '<td valign="top">salut!  I would like to see this with a little more light/detail on your hands.  I like the composition, it just feels like it''s missing something with you thumb all shadowy.  Pedro</td>', 'salut!  I would like to see this with a little more light/detail on your hands.  I like the composition, it just feels like it''s missing something with you thumb all shadowy.  Pedro', '2003-05-08 18:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(292454, 20636, 6388, '<td valign="top">too bad about the tree reflections, but nice effect overall.  I like it.</td>', 'too bad about the tree reflections, but nice effect overall.  I like it.', '2003-05-08 18:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(292457, 20121, 6388, '<td valign="top">one of my favourites of the competition.  I like that you left this in it;s naturaly habitat so to speak...it wouldn''t have worked with a bland studio backdrop nearly as well.  8</td>', 'one of my favourites of the competition.  I like that you left this in it;s naturaly habitat so to speak...it wouldn''t have worked with a bland studio backdrop nearly as well.  8', '2003-05-08 18:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(292480, 20747, 7857, '<td valign="top">The ball is a nice subject, gets a good effect from the horizon, slightly more focused would have been nice. Great shot all the same!</td>', 'The ball is a nice subject, gets a good effect from the horizon, slightly more focused would have been nice. Great shot all the same!', '2003-05-08 18:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(292481, 20649, 7474, '<td valign="top">beautiful light setting you used<br/>and I think it was a good choice to go with black and white :)</td>', 'beautiful light setting you usedand I think it was a good choice to go with black and white :)', '2003-05-08 18:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(292484, 20814, 2716, '<td valign="top">Poor Leafs.  Could''ve been a contendah!  Nice colours  Looks a bit too grainy.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Poor Leafs.  Could''ve been a contendah!  Nice colours  Looks a bit too grainy.  Jacko.  7', '2003-05-08 18:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(292486, 20433, 7857, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, love it! I wish I could get shutter control on my camera  :( gj!</td>', 'Fantastic shot, love it! I wish I could get shutter control on my camera  :( gj!', '2003-05-08 18:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(292488, 20754, 6660, '<td valign="top">Really interesting shot - looks as though it is a wine glass upside down in a stainless steel sink. I really like the ripples and light created at the top left and right and bottom right, and think it is a pity it could not be reproduced on the bottom left.<br/>Am also not sure about what looks like hair, in the bottom right. Very good shot otherwise</td>', 'Really interesting shot - looks as though it is a wine glass upside down in a stainless steel sink. I really like the ripples and light created at the top left and right and bottom right, and think it is a pity it could not be reproduced on the bottom left.Am also not sure about what looks like hair, in the bottom right. Very good shot otherwise', '2003-05-08 19:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(292490, 20690, 6660, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, pity your DOF is so shallow, would have been nicer to have seen the whole lot in focus, so could get the reflection coming back at you, and would have put the middle two birds in focus. Would have been better to have kept the two in the middle in focus rather than the outside ones, as I believe it woul keep your focus better.</td>', 'Nice subject, pity your DOF is so shallow, would have been nicer to have seen the whole lot in focus, so could get the reflection coming back at you, and would have put the middle two birds in focus. Would have been better to have kept the two in the middle in focus rather than the outside ones, as I believe it woul keep your focus better.', '2003-05-08 19:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(292501, 20418, 6660, '<td valign="top">Very interesting glass building, which I believe would have made a much better shot own its own, as the patterns with the glass panel are fascinating, however it is let down by the lamp pole? on the left.</td>', 'Very interesting glass building, which I believe would have made a much better shot own its own, as the patterns with the glass panel are fascinating, however it is let down by the lamp pole? on the left.', '2003-05-08 19:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(292503, 20700, 6660, '<td valign="top">Very novel concept, let down by the following:<br/>Seems to be a lot of noise (could have been prevented by using more light and a lower ISO). there is also very uneven lighting, far too much from the left, might have been better to have had your light from behind the fern.<br/>The ashtray looks dirty, so if it had been poperly cleaned prior to the challenge it might have paid to have bought a new one which might have been a bit clearer.<br/>Feel that the empty space on the left should have been filled with the fern to create a more symetric foto. Would also have been nice to see the colour of the flowers the whole way around the base of the ashtray.</td>', 'Very novel concept, let down by the following:Seems to be a lot of noise (could have been prevented by using more light and a lower ISO). there is also very uneven lighting, far too much from the left, might have been better to have had your light from behind the fern.The ashtray looks dirty, so if it had been poperly cleaned prior to the challenge it might have paid to have bought a new one which might have been a bit clearer.Feel that the empty space on the left should have been filled with the fern to create a more symetric foto. Would also have been nice to see the colour of the flowers the whole way around the base of the ashtray.', '2003-05-08 19:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(292507, 20602, 6660, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a lovely shot, if you had done the following:<br/>Taken the picture so that it was level. Cropped it so that there was only the barest hint of a frame from the window frame. Taken the shot when he light was different as it has washed out most of the colours (it might have been better on the inside of he house/church)</td>', 'I think this could have been a lovely shot, if you had done the following:Taken the picture so that it was level. Cropped it so that there was only the barest hint of a frame from the window frame. Taken the shot when he light was different as it has washed out most of the colours (it might have been better on the inside of he house/church)', '2003-05-08 19:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(292512, 20608, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the balance and composition but the low lighting makes the image dull and soft.  Also, there is some reflection in the right glass - it''s very difficult to photograph well.</td>', 'I like the balance and composition but the low lighting makes the image dull and soft.  Also, there is some reflection in the right glass - it''s very difficult to photograph well.', '2003-05-08 20:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(292513, 20755, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and I like the concept.  There is nothing particularly wrong with this image.</td>', 'Nice composition, and I like the concept.  There is nothing particularly wrong with this image.', '2003-05-08 20:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(292514, 20740, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great work  - I like the composition and the reflections are well managed.</td>', 'Great work  - I like the composition and the reflections are well managed.', '2003-05-08 20:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(292518, 20450, 1647, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot of a CD player.  Unfortunately the lens is slightly out of focus - the focus seems to be about 1cm in front of the lens.</td>', 'Interesting shot of a CD player.  Unfortunately the lens is slightly out of focus - the focus seems to be about 1cm in front of the lens.', '2003-05-08 20:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(292519, 20674, 1647, '<td valign="top">The composition and background distract slightly from this shot.  The blue light in the background does reflect well in the glass though.</td>', 'The composition and background distract slightly from this shot.  The blue light in the background does reflect well in the glass though.', '2003-05-08 20:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(292520, 20458, 554, '<td valign="top">My favorite....I hope you post some outtakes of this...some that show the background.....10</td>', 'My favorite....I hope you post some outtakes of this...some that show the background.....10', '2003-05-08 20:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(292521, 20250, 1647, '<td valign="top">This image appears to be slightly over sharpened.</td>', 'This image appears to be slightly over sharpened.', '2003-05-08 20:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(292523, 20188, 554, '<td valign="top">another favorite......I wish the hand was a little lighter....10</td>', 'another favorite......I wish the hand was a little lighter....10', '2003-05-08 20:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(292524, 20146, 1204, '<td valign="top">The subject is excellent.  With more even exposure, a bitt less exposure and more contraxt (2 out of 3 are photoshop exercises) this would have been perfect.  As is, 5.</td>', 'The subject is excellent.  With more even exposure, a bitt less exposure and more contraxt (2 out of 3 are photoshop exercises) this would have been perfect.  As is, 5.', '2003-05-08 20:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(292525, 20825, 1204, '<td valign="top">As a portrait, above average.  How does it fit the challenge?</td>', 'As a portrait, above average.  How does it fit the challenge?', '2003-05-08 20:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(292526, 20684, 1647, '<td valign="top">You appear to have used a lot of sharpening in this photo, but I think it works fairly well to create an artistic (almost surreal) photo.</td>', 'You appear to have used a lot of sharpening in this photo, but I think it works fairly well to create an artistic (almost surreal) photo.', '2003-05-08 20:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(292528, 20680, 554, '<td valign="top">one of the prettiest in the contest...I would have liked it better if the top of glass was included.....9</td>', 'one of the prettiest in the contest...I would have liked it better if the top of glass was included.....9', '2003-05-08 20:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(292529, 20701, 4049, '<td valign="top">not in focus</td>', 'not in focus', '2003-05-08 20:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(292530, 20778, 1647, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice execution of a familiar technique.  I like the simplicity of the single flower - making it the star of every bubble.</td>', 'This is a really nice execution of a familiar technique.  I like the simplicity of the single flower - making it the star of every bubble.', '2003-05-08 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(292531, 20749, 554, '<td valign="top">love the natural lighting here but a little fill at head and shoulder would help?...9</td>', 'love the natural lighting here but a little fill at head and shoulder would help?...9', '2003-05-08 20:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
