(292567, 20604, 7743, '<td valign="top">Monet would like this.  Exposure is good.  For composition I would have had the transition between blue and green a little lower in the framed giving it more balance.</td>', 'Monet would like this.  Exposure is good.  For composition I would have had the transition between blue and green a little lower in the framed giving it more balance.', '2003-05-08 21:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(292568, 20718, 7743, '<td valign="top">The image as a whole seems dark and there are some areas where the lighting is too harsh.  It looks like with more balanced lighting the pattern in the stem could have been brought out.</td>', 'The image as a whole seems dark and there are some areas where the lighting is too harsh.  It looks like with more balanced lighting the pattern in the stem could have been brought out.', '2003-05-08 21:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(292571, 20747, 7743, '<td valign="top">The perspective on this is almost perfect .  A little lower perspective and the horizon in the ball would have lined up with the horizon in the rest of the image.  Also, if the ball had been placed on a stand of some sort to take the picture you would have had more options for vantage points.</td>', 'The perspective on this is almost perfect .  A little lower perspective and the horizon in the ball would have lined up with the horizon in the rest of the image.  Also, if the ball had been placed on a stand of some sort to take the picture you would have had more options for vantage points.', '2003-05-08 21:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(292577, 20233, 7743, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very flat therefore leaving the image with not much contrast.  It also seems to have a magenta cast (maybe this was intentional).</td>', 'The lighting is very flat therefore leaving the image with not much contrast.  It also seems to have a magenta cast (maybe this was intentional).', '2003-05-08 21:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(292578, 20693, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the look of the plaid through the glass and the perspective chosen for this image. the Plaid as a background is very distracting.  This shot might have worked better in macro mode since it would be easier to really blur the background.</td>', 'I like the look of the plaid through the glass and the perspective chosen for this image. the Plaid as a background is very distracting.  This shot might have worked better in macro mode since it would be easier to really blur the background.', '2003-05-08 21:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
