(292681, 20453, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and contrast, really sharp and well focused. (Looks like an actual printing plate?).  The glare on the glass lens is a minor distraction, but it could be helping define the glass as well.  Good job!</td>', 'Very nice color and contrast, really sharp and well focused. (Looks like an actual printing plate?).  The glare on the glass lens is a minor distraction, but it could be helping define the glass as well.  Good job!', '2003-05-09 00:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
