(292683, 20749, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely shot and I understand the integration of glass, but I don''t feel it is the dominant element in this photo.  Only a subtle reflection even shows that the glass it there.  The shot is technically very good - great focus and exposure, perhaps cropped a little too close at the top.</td>', 'It''s a lovely shot and I understand the integration of glass, but I don''t feel it is the dominant element in this photo.  Only a subtle reflection even shows that the glass it there.  The shot is technically very good - great focus and exposure, perhaps cropped a little too close at the top.', '2003-05-09 00:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
