(292686, 20636, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the geometry of this shot - and I love this style of architecture.  Your composition is very good and technically it has been well executed.</td>', 'I love the geometry of this shot - and I love this style of architecture.  Your composition is very good and technically it has been well executed.', '2003-05-09 00:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
