(292758, 20315, 4767, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked more butterfly and less tree.  Good color, and the green compliments the glass nicely, but I have issues with the distractions in the background.</td>', 'I''d have liked more butterfly and less tree.  Good color, and the green compliments the glass nicely, but I have issues with the distractions in the background.', '2003-05-09 02:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
