(292777, 20845, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now I got you :-) I guess not many people on DPC have chess sets like this one! Choice set-up, although the game hasn''t been completely lost yet.</td>', 'Now I got you :-) I guess not many people on DPC have chess sets like this one! Choice set-up, although the game hasn''t been completely lost yet.', '2003-05-09 04:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(292778, 20635, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures you have here. The idea was good and you composed it well. I maybe would have balanced the lighting up a tad but other than that nothing to criticize.</td>', 'Interesting textures you have here. The idea was good and you composed it well. I maybe would have balanced the lighting up a tad but other than that nothing to criticize.', '2003-05-09 04:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(292779, 20301, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, I actually thought of doing this with a big pyramid of glasses but my wife wouldn''t let me use the good crystal :-) Anyway this is well done, I think you could maybe have used a more interesting background though.</td>', 'Very good idea, I actually thought of doing this with a big pyramid of glasses but my wife wouldn''t let me use the good crystal :-) Anyway this is well done, I think you could maybe have used a more interesting background though.', '2003-05-09 04:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(292780, 20646, 5728, '<td valign="top">I wondered if anyone would do something like this or not. You are the only one as far as I know. It is good too, although I would like to have seen more of the red in the glass. The blackness is shrouding it out too much around the left side and the bottom.</td>', 'I wondered if anyone would do something like this or not. You are the only one as far as I know. It is good too, although I would like to have seen more of the red in the glass. The blackness is shrouding it out too much around the left side and the bottom.', '2003-05-09 04:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(292781, 20266, 8056, '<td valign="top">The blue colored glass had spoilted the entire image, if the glass is in transparent, the image should look better, with pure white and reddish combination.</td>', 'The blue colored glass had spoilted the entire image, if the glass is in transparent, the image should look better, with pure white and reddish combination.', '2003-05-09 04:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
