(293088, 20553, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice absract. The tones and shapes are interesting and calming. The rim of the glass should be either more pronounced or absent, IMO. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice absract. The tones and shapes are interesting and calming. The rim of the glass should be either more pronounced or absent, IMO. Nice work.', '2003-05-09 10:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(293091, 20655, 1202, '<td valign="top">I am fairly sure you were taken with the bursts of light, and you captured them well.  The problem to me , is that the shot is too head on to the subject and all of the flaws show, which distracts from the light bursts.   I always heard that with a B/W picture you should try to include the full range of the gray scale in your picture.  For sure look for the bright whites and the dark blacks.  5</td>', 'I am fairly sure you were taken with the bursts of light, and you captured them well.  The problem to me , is that the shot is too head on to the subject and all of the flaws show, which distracts from the light bursts.   I always heard that with a B/W picture you should try to include the full range of the gray scale in your picture.  For sure look for the bright whites and the dark blacks.  5', '2003-05-09 10:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(293102, 20632, 1202, '<td valign="top">I feel that your extremly close crop detracts from the cobalt blue bottle.  Also as you look at the sides of the bottle they are not parallel with the sides of the frame. Try moving your lighting around and take from different angles to see what different effects you can create to bring more interest into the shot. 5</td>', 'I feel that your extremly close crop detracts from the cobalt blue bottle.  Also as you look at the sides of the bottle they are not parallel with the sides of the frame. Try moving your lighting around and take from different angles to see what different effects you can create to bring more interest into the shot. 5', '2003-05-09 10:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(293103, 20672, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is very abstract for sure. The blue and purple work well together. How did you manage to achieve a dead white background like that?</td>', 'This is very abstract for sure. The blue and purple work well together. How did you manage to achieve a dead white background like that?', '2003-05-09 10:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(293105, 20662, 5728, '<td valign="top">By the look for the buildings in the background I guess this is a church window right? Good example for the glass challenge, everything is in focus. Good luck.</td>', 'By the look for the buildings in the background I guess this is a church window right? Good example for the glass challenge, everything is in focus. Good luck.', '2003-05-09 10:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(293106, 20183, 7758, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really strong image... I could see it on the wall of a trendy cafe.... is the backdrop cream? I hope so..... if not your whites are a little off.... but overall I think it is a strong image. Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'I think this is a really strong image... I could see it on the wall of a trendy cafe.... is the backdrop cream? I hope so..... if not your whites are a little off.... but overall I think it is a strong image. Good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-09 10:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(293107, 20595, 5728, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective. I like the color combination of white and aqua, good.</td>', 'Simple but effective. I like the color combination of white and aqua, good.', '2003-05-09 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(293108, 20433, 2792, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Neat light, wonder what you did to create that effect (laser pen?).  Great colors and setup.  9</td>', 'Love it!  Neat light, wonder what you did to create that effect (laser pen?).  Great colors and setup.  9', '2003-05-09 10:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(293109, 20799, 1202, '<td valign="top">I am sure you have heard of trying to put a round peg in a square hole.   Well this is kind of what has happened with this shot.   The two shapes don''t work well together, maybe if you had positioned the complete circular shape  inside a portion of the frame it would be more pleasing to the eye.  5</td>', 'I am sure you have heard of trying to put a round peg in a square hole.   Well this is kind of what has happened with this shot.   The two shapes don''t work well together, maybe if you had positioned the complete circular shape  inside a portion of the frame it would be more pleasing to the eye.  5', '2003-05-09 10:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
