(293116, 20315, 2792, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast of the red glass and green background. Wish I could see a little more of the bottom (tip of the butterfly''s bottom right wing cropped off).  Nice job!  =-)   7</td>', 'Like the contrast of the red glass and green background. Wish I could see a little more of the bottom (tip of the butterfly''s bottom right wing cropped off).  Nice job!  =-)   7', '2003-05-09 10:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(293117, 20242, 7758, '<td valign="top">Technically this appears to be pretty well executed..... I think it lacks a focal point.... it is defiately a nice pattern..... also it does not obviously (not that it needs to be bleedingly obvious) depict glass... though I assume the water is sitting on glass.... I gave this a 6 as I think it is a good effort, just feel it could better represent the topic.... Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'Technically this appears to be pretty well executed..... I think it lacks a focal point.... it is defiately a nice pattern..... also it does not obviously (not that it needs to be bleedingly obvious) depict glass... though I assume the water is sitting on glass.... I gave this a 6 as I think it is a good effort, just feel it could better represent the topic.... Good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-09 10:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(293118, 20290, 1202, '<td valign="top">I assume that this ship is fairly small, If so it is a great marco and nice composition.   I don''t really care for the ghost patterns in the background, but not all that bad.   good job.  7</td>', 'I assume that this ship is fairly small, If so it is a great marco and nice composition.   I don''t really care for the ghost patterns in the background, but not all that bad.   good job.  7', '2003-05-09 10:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
