(293121, 20787, 1202, '<td valign="top">A nice shot in an elementary sort of way.   Good focus, no distortion and nice crop.   The colors look to be a bit on the grainy side from over compression, which doesn''t allow it to be as bright as one would expect.  6</td>', 'A nice shot in an elementary sort of way.   Good focus, no distortion and nice crop.   The colors look to be a bit on the grainy side from over compression, which doesn''t allow it to be as bright as one would expect.  6', '2003-05-09 11:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
