(293125, 20600, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have a great subject in your shot.   I think the lattice work in the background just about distroys your work.   It is very distracting   Those shapes just don''t compliment the shapes of yout thermometer.  Maybe you could try a low angle shot with just a clear sky in the background.   5</td>', 'You have a great subject in your shot.   I think the lattice work in the background just about distroys your work.   It is very distracting   Those shapes just don''t compliment the shapes of yout thermometer.  Maybe you could try a low angle shot with just a clear sky in the background.   5', '2003-05-09 11:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(293126, 20837, 7758, '<td valign="top">Really good use of light..... I think this image works really well.... if anything it is maybe a little blown out in the bottom of the glass.... but then a trade-off was required here somewhere... besides, without the constraints of the challenge you could correct this in photoshop..... I think this should rate well... it gets an 8 from me.... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'Really good use of light..... I think this image works really well.... if anything it is maybe a little blown out in the bottom of the glass.... but then a trade-off was required here somewhere... besides, without the constraints of the challenge you could correct this in photoshop..... I think this should rate well... it gets an 8 from me.... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-09 11:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
