(293364, 20680, 7780, '<td valign="top">I love the subject matter.  It was a great idea to turn the two other glasses upside down behind it. Nice job!</td>', 'I love the subject matter.  It was a great idea to turn the two other glasses upside down behind it. Nice job!', '2003-05-09 14:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(293368, 20842, 5266, '<td valign="top">Coloured glass beads may have worked better here.  I like the idea and the ribbon is nice, but an amber or cobalt set of beads would be more exciting.</td>', 'Coloured glass beads may have worked better here.  I like the idea and the ribbon is nice, but an amber or cobalt set of beads would be more exciting.', '2003-05-09 14:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(293370, 20624, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Good composition with colors.  I think that the picture is a little out of focus though, because the image itself looks a little dull.</td>', 'Nice image.  Good composition with colors.  I think that the picture is a little out of focus though, because the image itself looks a little dull.', '2003-05-09 14:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(293372, 20839, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Good idea.  I like the way the lighting helps the glass stand out.  I also like the contrast between the shadows and the way it shows up on the background.</td>', 'Nice image.  Good idea.  I like the way the lighting helps the glass stand out.  I also like the contrast between the shadows and the way it shows up on the background.', '2003-05-09 14:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
