(293377, 20556, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image and good angle.  I think that maybe taken with something else in the background, or more contrast and value in the sky might have helped more to attract more interest to the viewer.</td>', 'Nice image and good angle.  I think that maybe taken with something else in the background, or more contrast and value in the sky might have helped more to attract more interest to the viewer.', '2003-05-09 14:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(293379, 20796, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Good laying out of the objects.  I think that more lighting could have been used to add more to attract the viewers eye.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Good laying out of the objects.  I think that more lighting could have been used to add more to attract the viewers eye.', '2003-05-09 14:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(293382, 20639, 6451, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that this image has much uniquness to it.  Something else needs to be photographed with the pattern in order for the image to be something of interest.  But nice use of pattern and glass.</td>', 'I don''t think that this image has much uniquness to it.  Something else needs to be photographed with the pattern in order for the image to be something of interest.  But nice use of pattern and glass.', '2003-05-09 14:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(293385, 20594, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but the colors are a bit dull and the image is out of focus at the bottom and this distracts the eye.</td>', 'Nice image, but the colors are a bit dull and the image is out of focus at the bottom and this distracts the eye.', '2003-05-09 14:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(293386, 20400, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Good use of objects and background to provide nice shadowing and contrast in the image.</td>', 'Nice image.  Good use of objects and background to provide nice shadowing and contrast in the image.', '2003-05-09 14:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(293389, 20549, 6451, '<td valign="top">This image doesnt really catch my attention too much.  I think that better lighting could have made the image better.  But I don''t think that the way you chose to photography this image, worked real well.</td>', 'This image doesnt really catch my attention too much.  I think that better lighting could have made the image better.  But I don''t think that the way you chose to photography this image, worked real well.', '2003-05-09 14:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(293390, 20701, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The image is grainy though, and could have been sharpened more.  I also think that better lighting conditions might have improved the quality of the image.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The image is grainy though, and could have been sharpened more.  I also think that better lighting conditions might have improved the quality of the image.', '2003-05-09 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(293391, 20201, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Good use of lighting.  I like the way the colors reflect from the glass and add a nice touch to the image.</td>', 'Nice image.  Good use of lighting.  I like the way the colors reflect from the glass and add a nice touch to the image.', '2003-05-09 14:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(293393, 20757, 6451, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I think that this pic however, could have been shot in better lighting conditions.  The way this image is taken, it doesnt provide for much interest.</td>', 'Good idea.  I think that this pic however, could have been shot in better lighting conditions.  The way this image is taken, it doesnt provide for much interest.', '2003-05-09 14:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(293396, 20766, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Good use of pattern and I also like the way the reflection is shown on the glass. This goes together very well.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Good use of pattern and I also like the way the reflection is shown on the glass. This goes together very well.', '2003-05-09 14:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(293399, 20702, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but something else needs to be added to the image.  There isn''t enough contrast or value to catch the viewers eye.</td>', 'Nice idea, but something else needs to be added to the image.  There isn''t enough contrast or value to catch the viewers eye.', '2003-05-09 14:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(293401, 20597, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  The way you focused the image, you can see the depth of the lettering and the effect it has on the interest of the image is very good.</td>', 'Very nice image.  The way you focused the image, you can see the depth of the lettering and the effect it has on the interest of the image is very good.', '2003-05-09 14:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(293403, 20566, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I really like the way the lighting causes a reflection and the range of color in the image.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  I really like the way the lighting causes a reflection and the range of color in the image.  Good job.', '2003-05-09 14:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(293404, 20771, 6451, '<td valign="top">This image looks a little bland to me.  It needs some more variety.  Yo should have put an object in front of the rocks.  Also where is the glass??</td>', 'This image looks a little bland to me.  It needs some more variety.  Yo should have put an object in front of the rocks.  Also where is the glass??', '2003-05-09 14:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(293405, 20689, 7857, '<td valign="top">Ah ha, nice concept, nice setup, great shot overall - 8</td>', 'Ah ha, nice concept, nice setup, great shot overall - 8', '2003-05-09 14:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(293408, 20416, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love this!  simple and beautiful.  great DOF and the colors are wonderful.  well done!</td>', 'i love this!  simple and beautiful.  great DOF and the colors are wonderful.  well done!', '2003-05-09 14:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(293413, 20752, 1717, '<td valign="top">absolutely stunning!  the color is amazing and it has a Camera Obscura quality to it.  excellent work.  10 from me.</td>', 'absolutely stunning!  the color is amazing and it has a Camera Obscura quality to it.  excellent work.  10 from me.', '2003-05-09 15:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(293415, 20445, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, and I like your lighting - no weird reflections that distract on the glass.  I think this could have used a touch longer exposure, though.  If it were a bit brighter, it would really make those colors pop.</td>', 'Excellent composition, and I like your lighting - no weird reflections that distract on the glass.  I think this could have used a touch longer exposure, though.  If it were a bit brighter, it would really make those colors pop.', '2003-05-09 15:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(293418, 20248, 5391, '<td valign="top">This composition is interesting, as are the patterns in the glass.  The only thing I don''t care for is that the whites in your background are really "white" and it makes the glass color of the subject actually look a bit grayish - takes away from the interest of the subject itself.</td>', 'This composition is interesting, as are the patterns in the glass.  The only thing I don''t care for is that the whites in your background are really "white" and it makes the glass color of the subject actually look a bit grayish - takes away from the interest of the subject itself.', '2003-05-09 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(293419, 20695, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  Has a very old-timey feel to it.  Great work.  8</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  Has a very old-timey feel to it.  Great work.  8', '2003-05-09 15:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(293423, 20690, 5391, '<td valign="top">I think that a smaller aperature would help this to get everything in focus.  As it is, the viewers eyes are drawn to the birds eyes, and you strain a bit due to the blur.  But it''s a lovely piece of glass that picks up light very nicely, and composed well.</td>', 'I think that a smaller aperature would help this to get everything in focus.  As it is, the viewers eyes are drawn to the birds eyes, and you strain a bit due to the blur.  But it''s a lovely piece of glass that picks up light very nicely, and composed well.', '2003-05-09 15:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(293426, 20778, 5391, '<td valign="top">Positively beautiful.  I don''t think I''ll ever tire of these kinds of shots.  I was wondering why I hadn''t seen one yet!  Thanks for sharing.  The detail you captured in the droplets is wonderful, and I like how each flower is actually encircled by its background.  8</td>', 'Positively beautiful.  I don''t think I''ll ever tire of these kinds of shots.  I was wondering why I hadn''t seen one yet!  Thanks for sharing.  The detail you captured in the droplets is wonderful, and I like how each flower is actually encircled by its background.  8', '2003-05-09 15:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(293432, 20201, 5391, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of the wide angle to add depth to this, as well as the moody lighting.  The blown out reflection on the nearest bottle neck actually adds something to the shot, but I find the blown out spot on the telephone distracting.</td>', 'I like your choice of the wide angle to add depth to this, as well as the moody lighting.  The blown out reflection on the nearest bottle neck actually adds something to the shot, but I find the blown out spot on the telephone distracting.', '2003-05-09 15:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(293434, 20121, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice work, creative way of looking at things!</td>', 'Nice work, creative way of looking at things!', '2003-05-09 15:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(293436, 20603, 5391, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this a bit better if you''d used a polarizer to cut the reflections in the glass.  But it is an interesting subject with nice lines.  It might be interesting to try it at more of a tilt, also, to add a feeling of depth and confusion to the shot...</td>', 'I think I would have liked this a bit better if you''d used a polarizer to cut the reflections in the glass.  But it is an interesting subject with nice lines.  It might be interesting to try it at more of a tilt, also, to add a feeling of depth and confusion to the shot...', '2003-05-09 15:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(293437, 20726, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice tones - I love the white background and I love that you used a wide depth of field so that both the pills and the whole glass are in focus.</td>', 'Nice tones - I love the white background and I love that you used a wide depth of field so that both the pills and the whole glass are in focus.', '2003-05-09 15:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(293439, 20715, 5391, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting subject with good lines, and I like your choice of exposure.  I''m not wild about the subject sitting dead center, however.  I''d like to see a different point of view, I think.</td>', 'It''s an interesting subject with good lines, and I like your choice of exposure.  I''m not wild about the subject sitting dead center, however.  I''d like to see a different point of view, I think.', '2003-05-09 15:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(293440, 20568, 7033, '<td valign="top">Shallow DOF really adds a sense of perspective to this shot; clouds and blue sky add an almost magical effect.  In my opinion, the edge of the chess board is a bit distracting, and might have been better cropped out.</td>', 'Shallow DOF really adds a sense of perspective to this shot; clouds and blue sky add an almost magical effect.  In my opinion, the edge of the chess board is a bit distracting, and might have been better cropped out.', '2003-05-09 15:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(293447, 20276, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I love the black and white and your nearly perfect composition. Is the bottom "carpet" a little off? Perhaps if you had cropped off the bottom portion it wouldn''t have been quite so noticeable. I like your tight cropping on the sides.</td>', 'Very creative. I love the black and white and your nearly perfect composition. Is the bottom "carpet" a little off? Perhaps if you had cropped off the bottom portion it wouldn''t have been quite so noticeable. I like your tight cropping on the sides.', '2003-05-09 15:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(293448, 20397, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - very creative.  It really does almost feel like you''re looking at a swimming pool.  Beautiful.  I bet it''s marvelous in print.  9</td>', 'Wow - very creative.  It really does almost feel like you''re looking at a swimming pool.  Beautiful.  I bet it''s marvelous in print.  9', '2003-05-09 15:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(293449, 20231, 7033, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea. Nice creativity. I do wish the child''s face was clearer and that the pic overall wasn''t so dark. It looks like you''ve captured a neat expression on the child''s face. Nice job.</td>', 'This is a great idea. Nice creativity. I do wish the child''s face was clearer and that the pic overall wasn''t so dark. It looks like you''ve captured a neat expression on the child''s face. Nice job.', '2003-05-09 15:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
