(293590, 20258, 8488, '<td valign="top">Not a particularly bad image, but the almost complete lack of contrast in color kind of detracts from the overall quality for me. It''s like someone put green cellophane in front of the actual photograph. If the fabric were a different color, even white or cream, it would be much more dramatic.</td>', 'Not a particularly bad image, but the almost complete lack of contrast in color kind of detracts from the overall quality for me. It''s like someone put green cellophane in front of the actual photograph. If the fabric were a different color, even white or cream, it would be much more dramatic.', '2003-05-09 17:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(293593, 20397, 8488, '<td valign="top">If the topic were architecture I''d give this a 9, easily. However, the topic''s glass, so I have to mark it lower ... if the reflective bits were metal it wouldn''t change the picture at all, really, so I''m leaving space at the top for entries that explore the topic more thoroughly. Striking, gorgeous image.</td>', 'If the topic were architecture I''d give this a 9, easily. However, the topic''s glass, so I have to mark it lower ... if the reflective bits were metal it wouldn''t change the picture at all, really, so I''m leaving space at the top for entries that explore the topic more thoroughly. Striking, gorgeous image.', '2003-05-09 17:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
