(293608, 20433, 5925, '<td valign="top">I had this one at a lower score originally, but just had to pull it up to a 9 after looking at that light trail a few times.  :)  I really like this picture for it''s high interest value.  Any picture that makes me look twice deserves a high score in my book!  <br/></td>', 'I had this one at a lower score originally, but just had to pull it up to a 9 after looking at that light trail a few times.  :)  I really like this picture for it''s high interest value.  Any picture that makes me look twice deserves a high score in my book!  ', '2003-05-09 17:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
