(293624, 20800, 5925, '<td valign="top">Ah!  I love this picture and the green concept!  Only it''s too dark at the bottom.  Darn it, I wish I could rate it a 9 or 10.  Maybe if you would have cropped the bottom half off.....  Kudos for originality and creativity!</td>', 'Ah!  I love this picture and the green concept!  Only it''s too dark at the bottom.  Darn it, I wish I could rate it a 9 or 10.  Maybe if you would have cropped the bottom half off.....  Kudos for originality and creativity!', '2003-05-09 17:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(293625, 20215, 7806, '<td valign="top">well executed, like the texture of the glass, jags at the top of the tube kind of too bad but great on the whole, 9</td>', 'well executed, like the texture of the glass, jags at the top of the tube kind of too bad but great on the whole, 9', '2003-05-09 17:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
