(293631, 20702, 715, '<td valign="top">Great usage of empty space and very appealing colors. I find the abrupt crop at the bottom disturbing though. Somehow,  I''d like to see either the whole bottom of the botle or a much stronger crop so only half of the bottom would be visible.</td>', 'Great usage of empty space and very appealing colors. I find the abrupt crop at the bottom disturbing though. Somehow,  I''d like to see either the whole bottom of the botle or a much stronger crop so only half of the bottom would be visible.', '2003-05-09 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
