(293675, 20392, 7291, '<td valign="top">Don''t quite understand the title.  But the picture is nice.  Not as sharp as could be though.</td>', 'Don''t quite understand the title.  But the picture is nice.  Not as sharp as could be though.', '2003-05-09 19:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(293676, 20445, 3607, '<td valign="top">interesting setup, but i think it falls short of its potential.  a couple of thoughts: i''m not sure why you felt you needed the mirror on the bottom, but in using one i would have taken a large mirror so the edges were not visible in the photo, and it looks a bit dark, i assume because you wanted to avoid reflections from the light source, but if you had boosted the saturation a bit the m&amp;ms would have come out a bit stronger.</td>', 'interesting setup, but i think it falls short of its potential.  a couple of thoughts: i''m not sure why you felt you needed the mirror on the bottom, but in using one i would have taken a large mirror so the edges were not visible in the photo, and it looks a bit dark, i assume because you wanted to avoid reflections from the light source, but if you had boosted the saturation a bit the m&ms would have come out a bit stronger.', '2003-05-09 19:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(293677, 20746, 3607, '<td valign="top">very nicely done.  good composition, very neat lighting.</td>', 'very nicely done.  good composition, very neat lighting.', '2003-05-09 19:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(293678, 20733, 3575, '<td valign="top">That''s the kind of shot I wanted to do - very nice! I like the reflection of the clouds in the glass.</td>', 'That''s the kind of shot I wanted to do - very nice! I like the reflection of the clouds in the glass.', '2003-05-09 19:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(293680, 20689, 3607, '<td valign="top">i like the set up, i wish there was more of a focus contrast between the text viewed through the lense and the text outside of the lense.</td>', 'i like the set up, i wish there was more of a focus contrast between the text viewed through the lense and the text outside of the lense.', '2003-05-09 19:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(293681, 20643, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very moody pic.  Great job.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Very moody pic.  Great job.  One of my favorites.', '2003-05-09 19:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(293682, 20569, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice find.  i wish the colors were a little brighter (both in light and saturation).  you choose a center cropping.  it might have been interesting to see it a bit off center / not so closely cropped.</td>', 'nice find.  i wish the colors were a little brighter (both in light and saturation).  you choose a center cropping.  it might have been interesting to see it a bit off center / not so closely cropped.', '2003-05-09 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(293683, 20455, 3607, '<td valign="top">it looks like you have a pretty neat object here to photograph, although the cropping is pretty tight and i wonder if you had pulled back a bit if the picture might have been more powerful.</td>', 'it looks like you have a pretty neat object here to photograph, although the cropping is pretty tight and i wonder if you had pulled back a bit if the picture might have been more powerful.', '2003-05-09 19:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(293684, 20794, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great reflection in the glass.  Seeing the blower on the left add some nice perspective.</td>', 'Great reflection in the glass.  Seeing the blower on the left add some nice perspective.', '2003-05-09 19:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(293685, 20632, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice color and lighting, although its a leaning a bit, and i wonder if the very tight cropping works against you here ie: the photo almost is the object, instead of representing the object.</td>', 'nice color and lighting, although its a leaning a bit, and i wonder if the very tight cropping works against you here ie: the photo almost is the object, instead of representing the object.', '2003-05-09 19:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(293686, 20212, 3607, '<td valign="top">clean well composed photo.  you see how the details at the bottom come out because the light source is focused on the top?  i wonder if you had focused the light source on the bottom if the facial details would have come out stronger and created a more powerful photo.  also, the center cropping works, but other less tight croppings might have come out well too.</td>', 'clean well composed photo.  you see how the details at the bottom come out because the light source is focused on the top?  i wonder if you had focused the light source on the bottom if the facial details would have come out stronger and created a more powerful photo.  also, the center cropping works, but other less tight croppings might have come out well too.', '2003-05-09 19:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(293687, 20702, 7628, '<td valign="top">This photo reminds me of sunlight at the beach.  Wonderful colors.</td>', 'This photo reminds me of sunlight at the beach.  Wonderful colors.', '2003-05-09 19:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(293688, 20631, 3607, '<td valign="top">either that''s a giant clove of garlic or a small bottle of olive oil ;-)  i think the photo is well composed and executed.  you might consider putting black paper/cloth on the table that blends in with the faded background to give it a more studio look.</td>', 'either that''s a giant clove of garlic or a small bottle of olive oil ;-)  i think the photo is well composed and executed.  you might consider putting black paper/cloth on the table that blends in with the faded background to give it a more studio look.', '2003-05-09 19:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
