(293697, 20783, 7628, '<td valign="top">great color, a real sense of the translucence of the glass.  Wish yo had gotten it without the black on the bottom.  Maybe a thin, horizontal slice of black, but this large and at the angle detracts from the composition.</td>', 'great color, a real sense of the translucence of the glass.  Wish yo had gotten it without the black on the bottom.  Maybe a thin, horizontal slice of black, but this large and at the angle detracts from the composition.', '2003-05-09 19:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(293698, 20706, 806, '<td valign="top">what is a power insulator? you mean like a fuse? neat object. composition is pretty straight on. This is a macro? It is hard for me to know since I don''t know what it is ;0) .. doesn''t matter.. just curious. I like how it seems to be floating in space. the lighting on the object is neat, and I like how the bottom 2/3 is nicely lit, but the gray on the top 1/3 of the photo I could do without. decent focus. Good overall job.</td>', 'what is a power insulator? you mean like a fuse? neat object. composition is pretty straight on. This is a macro? It is hard for me to know since I don''t know what it is ;0) .. doesn''t matter.. just curious. I like how it seems to be floating in space. the lighting on the object is neat, and I like how the bottom 2/3 is nicely lit, but the gray on the top 1/3 of the photo I could do without. decent focus. Good overall job.', '2003-05-09 19:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(293699, 20828, 7291, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear thekiss when looking at the sun spot on the left.  Great picture.  Seems a bit fuzzy on the bottom half of the glass though.</td>', 'I can almost hear thekiss when looking at the sun spot on the left.  Great picture.  Seems a bit fuzzy on the bottom half of the glass though.', '2003-05-09 19:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
