(293773, 20460, 3028, '<td valign="top">Great job, although there is another shot quite similar that has deep blue bowls and is slightly superior to this. The colors are a bit dull. I really like how the light flows out of these bowls although the table/floor shows a bit of noise due probably to the low-lighting situation. Nevertheless a great job! - 8</td>', 'Great job, although there is another shot quite similar that has deep blue bowls and is slightly superior to this. The colors are a bit dull. I really like how the light flows out of these bowls although the table/floor shows a bit of noise due probably to the low-lighting situation. Nevertheless a great job! - 8', '2003-05-09 20:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
