(293824, 20453, 2178, '<td valign="top">The lighting works great in this shot. The catchlight on the glasses and the shadow along the books edge really give the photo some depth. The colors are great, and I wonder if anyone else caught the name on the typeset...lol  maybe if they print out the shot and hold it too a mirror they will get it...lol</td>', 'The lighting works great in this shot. The catchlight on the glasses and the shadow along the books edge really give the photo some depth. The colors are great, and I wonder if anyone else caught the name on the typeset...lol  maybe if they print out the shot and hold it too a mirror they will get it...lol', '2003-05-09 21:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(293825, 20683, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Nice focus on the fly.</td>', 'LOL.  Nice focus on the fly.', '2003-05-09 21:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(293826, 20320, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very clean and well executed. Love it.</td>', 'Very clean and well executed. Love it.', '2003-05-09 21:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(293828, 20845, 3575, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I love the blue tint and the ghostly pieces in the back. Very nice.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I love the blue tint and the ghostly pieces in the back. Very nice.', '2003-05-09 21:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(293829, 20177, 2178, '<td valign="top">So elegant and simplistic.....beautiful beautiful shot :)</td>', 'So elegant and simplistic.....beautiful beautiful shot :)', '2003-05-09 21:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(293830, 20679, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2003-05-09 21:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(293832, 20634, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Might try a different tint color, but the idea/look is pretty interesting.</td>', 'Very cool.  Might try a different tint color, but the idea/look is pretty interesting.', '2003-05-09 21:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(293833, 20778, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done! One day I''m going to have to try this myself.</td>', 'Beautifully done! One day I''m going to have to try this myself.', '2003-05-09 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(293834, 20212, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and color... I do feel, however, that the very thick black border overpowers the shot.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and color... I do feel, however, that the very thick black border overpowers the shot.', '2003-05-09 21:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(293835, 20740, 4494, '<td valign="top">Great composition, lighting is very good, and nice to look at!</td>', 'Great composition, lighting is very good, and nice to look at!', '2003-05-09 21:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(293839, 20584, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very interesting how the reflections from the building have created an abstractish/modern art-type effect!</td>', 'Very interesting how the reflections from the building have created an abstractish/modern art-type effect!', '2003-05-09 21:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(293842, 20818, 4494, '<td valign="top">That IS bad ass!  Great job, love the waves of color.</td>', 'That IS bad ass!  Great job, love the waves of color.', '2003-05-09 21:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(293843, 20592, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nicely shot!  Sharpness, clarity, color... everything is perfect!  Border also complements the shot well.  --10</td>', 'Very nicely shot!  Sharpness, clarity, color... everything is perfect!  Border also complements the shot well.  --10', '2003-05-09 21:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(293845, 20849, 4494, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting of the glass pieces!  Great focus as well.</td>', 'Excellent lighting of the glass pieces!  Great focus as well.', '2003-05-09 21:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(293846, 20727, 3575, '<td valign="top">I think adding the water drops adds a lot.</td>', 'I think adding the water drops adds a lot.', '2003-05-09 21:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(293848, 20777, 4494, '<td valign="top">Narly dude, it looks real!</td>', 'Narly dude, it looks real!', '2003-05-09 21:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(293849, 20211, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful, the light and shadows adds such life.</td>', 'Very beautiful, the light and shadows adds such life.', '2003-05-09 21:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(293850, 20678, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great image, my pick of the week.  9 Morgan</td>', 'Great image, my pick of the week.  9 Morgan', '2003-05-09 21:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(293851, 20814, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great image, my pick of the week.  9 Morgan<br/> <br/>Also a Leafs fan, oh the shame of it all...<br/> <br/>Little Johnny was in his nursery class when the teacher asked the children what their fathers did for a living. <br/> <br/>All the typical answers came up - fireman, policeman, salesman, etc... Johnny was being uncharacteristically quiet and so the teacher asked him about his father. <br/> <br/>"My father''s an exotic dancer in a gay cabaret and takes off all his clothes in front of other men. <br/> <br/>The teacher, obviously shaken by this statement, hurriedly set the other children to work on some colouring, and took little Johnny aside to ask him, "Is that really true about your father?" <br/> <br/>"No," said Johnny, "he plays for the Leafs but I was too embarrassed to say so."</td>', 'Great image, my pick of the week.  9 Morgan Also a Leafs fan, oh the shame of it all... Little Johnny was in his nursery class when the teacher asked the children what their fathers did for a living.  All the typical answers came up - fireman, policeman, salesman, etc... Johnny was being uncharacteristically quiet and so the teacher asked him about his father.  "My father''s an exotic dancer in a gay cabaret and takes off all his clothes in front of other men.  The teacher, obviously shaken by this statement, hurriedly set the other children to work on some colouring, and took little Johnny aside to ask him, "Is that really true about your father?"  "No," said Johnny, "he plays for the Leafs but I was too embarrassed to say so."', '2003-05-09 21:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(293852, 20458, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great work, my pick of the week - 9 - Morgan</td>', 'Great work, my pick of the week - 9 - Morgan', '2003-05-09 21:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(293853, 20460, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great work, my pick of the week - 9 - Morgan</td>', 'Great work, my pick of the week - 9 - Morgan', '2003-05-09 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(293854, 20825, 1202, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet the glass in your shot is the lens itself.   You have a great portrait but it misses the challenge in my estimation.   For those that really tried to give an entry of glass I have to mark you down.  10 in portait but only a 6 in "Glass"</td>', 'I''ll bet the glass in your shot is the lens itself.   You have a great portrait but it misses the challenge in my estimation.   For those that really tried to give an entry of glass I have to mark you down.  10 in portait but only a 6 in "Glass"', '2003-05-09 22:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(293855, 20836, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding shot.  Even though the glass isn''t the main topic, it is definately "supporting" it.  8</td>', 'This is an outstanding shot.  Even though the glass isn''t the main topic, it is definately "supporting" it.  8', '2003-05-09 22:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(293856, 20121, 2158, '<td valign="top">In terms of the challenge topic, this doesn''t really work for me because you can''t see the glass.</td>', 'In terms of the challenge topic, this doesn''t really work for me because you can''t see the glass.', '2003-05-09 22:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(293857, 20463, 3280, '<td valign="top">How many glasses did you go through!!!!!  This is totally awesome, my favorite of the week!</td>', 'How many glasses did you go through!!!!!  This is totally awesome, my favorite of the week!', '2003-05-09 22:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(293859, 20767, 2158, '<td valign="top">This picture looks really good.  I just wish it wasn''t so small so I could judge it properly.</td>', 'This picture looks really good.  I just wish it wasn''t so small so I could judge it properly.', '2003-05-09 22:35:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(293864, 20326, 554, '<td valign="top">nice bright pretty photo.....I like it</td>', 'nice bright pretty photo.....I like it', '2003-05-09 23:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(293866, 20649, 6600, '<td valign="top">Simple, sharp, decent composition, interesting lighting, great job!</td>', 'Simple, sharp, decent composition, interesting lighting, great job!', '2003-05-09 23:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(293875, 20407, 6548, '<td valign="top">awesome, very awesome</td>', 'awesome, very awesome', '2003-05-10 00:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(293886, 20825, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure you understood the concept of "Challenge".  All photo''s were suppose to be of "glass".  While this is a very nice photo, it has nothing to do with the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not sure you understood the concept of "Challenge".  All photo''s were suppose to be of "glass".  While this is a very nice photo, it has nothing to do with the challenge.', '2003-05-10 00:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(293893, 20684, 6477, '<td valign="top">Great book!  Lord of the Rings:))</td>', 'Great book!  Lord of the Rings:))', '2003-05-10 00:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(293901, 20652, 7033, '<td valign="top">Interesting architecture here... In my opinion, though, the shot could benefit from a bit crisper focus.  Also, the purplish bit at the top (saturation bumped a bit too high?) is pretty distracting.</td>', 'Interesting architecture here... In my opinion, though, the shot could benefit from a bit crisper focus.  Also, the purplish bit at the top (saturation bumped a bit too high?) is pretty distracting.', '2003-05-10 01:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(293902, 20787, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to the challenge; nice also to se something with some color and saturation.  Only nitpick is that the top right square is just a bit too hot for the rest of the shot.  Very nice overall, though!</td>', 'Nice approach to the challenge; nice also to se something with some color and saturation.  Only nitpick is that the top right square is just a bit too hot for the rest of the shot.  Very nice overall, though!', '2003-05-10 01:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(293905, 20827, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition... I just keep trying to figure out exactly what it is, but I keep fixating on the shot.  I do wish the photo background were a bit crisper, perhaps a bit less sharpening?</td>', 'Very interesting composition... I just keep trying to figure out exactly what it is, but I keep fixating on the shot.  I do wish the photo background were a bit crisper, perhaps a bit less sharpening?', '2003-05-10 01:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(293909, 20597, 7033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic macro shot... lighiting and composition is nice.  Light starbursts add a finishing touch.  --9</td>', 'Fantastic macro shot... lighiting and composition is nice.  Light starbursts add a finishing touch.  --9', '2003-05-10 01:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(293911, 20778, 4767, '<td valign="top">This feels like a flashback to the 60''s - maybe a scene from the Beatle''s ''Yellow Submarine'' movie.  All these bubbles of flowers floating towards one...  I LIKE it!</td>', 'This feels like a flashback to the 60''s - maybe a scene from the Beatle''s ''Yellow Submarine'' movie.  All these bubbles of flowers floating towards one...  I LIKE it!', '2003-05-10 01:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(293912, 20597, 4767, '<td valign="top">Not the only detail on a Coke bottle, but awfully well done!</td>', 'Not the only detail on a Coke bottle, but awfully well done!', '2003-05-10 01:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(293913, 20845, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice shot here... I love the lighting, especially the way it appears as though the king is lit from within.  While the shallow DOF works well and is perfectly appropriate here, I find the pieces to the left of the shot distracting with the combination of lighting and lack of focus.  On the other hand, the other (white) pieces are much more subtle, and less distracting.  --8</td>', 'Nice shot here... I love the lighting, especially the way it appears as though the king is lit from within.  While the shallow DOF works well and is perfectly appropriate here, I find the pieces to the left of the shot distracting with the combination of lighting and lack of focus.  On the other hand, the other (white) pieces are much more subtle, and less distracting.  --8', '2003-05-10 01:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(293915, 20647, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, esp on the lid area.  The bubbles would indicate it was shot in a horizontal plane, rather than upright, but it works for me.  I like it!  -7-</td>', 'Nice effect, esp on the lid area.  The bubbles would indicate it was shot in a horizontal plane, rather than upright, but it works for me.  I like it!  -7-', '2003-05-10 01:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(293916, 20266, 7033, '<td valign="top">Composition is very nice... and I love your border!  It accentuates the shot very nicely.  Color and focus on the strawberries is absolutely perfect-- I feel as though I could reach out and eat one right now!  --10.</td>', 'Composition is very nice... and I love your border!  It accentuates the shot very nicely.  Color and focus on the strawberries is absolutely perfect-- I feel as though I could reach out and eat one right now!  --10.', '2003-05-10 01:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(293917, 20825, 7033, '<td valign="top">Glass?</td>', 'Glass?', '2003-05-10 01:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(293918, 20121, 4767, '<td valign="top">this dowmplays the glass but is a striking image!  The blue blobs in the background detract from the simplicity and power of the stems, but who cares?  A GREAT image!  - 8 -</td>', 'this dowmplays the glass but is a striking image!  The blue blobs in the background detract from the simplicity and power of the stems, but who cares?  A GREAT image!  - 8 -', '2003-05-10 01:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(293921, 20842, 7033, '<td valign="top">Use of the glass marbles (and the way they sort of spill out of the glass) is very nice.  Colors complement well...  --9</td>', 'Use of the glass marbles (and the way they sort of spill out of the glass) is very nice.  Colors complement well...  --9', '2003-05-10 01:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(293922, 20445, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and composition... just a bit too dark, in my opinion.  (Perhaps a lighter background or brighter lighting would have introduced a bit more ''snap'' in the shot.)</td>', 'Nice setup and composition... just a bit too dark, in my opinion.  (Perhaps a lighter background or brighter lighting would have introduced a bit more ''snap'' in the shot.)', '2003-05-10 01:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(293925, 20639, 7033, '<td valign="top">Definitely abstract... not certain exactly what I''m looking at, but that''s okay.  Colors are interesting, and the symmetry adds some interest.  Center of the shot seems to be leaning a bit to the left.</td>', 'Definitely abstract... not certain exactly what I''m looking at, but that''s okay.  Colors are interesting, and the symmetry adds some interest.  Center of the shot seems to be leaning a bit to the left.', '2003-05-10 01:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(293928, 20576, 7033, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... ''sunburst'' effect in the marbles is kind of neat.  Reflection from the container they''re in, and the bit at the bottom are overly distracting, in my opinion.</td>', 'Interesting shot... ''sunburst'' effect in the marbles is kind of neat.  Reflection from the container they''re in, and the bit at the bottom are overly distracting, in my opinion.', '2003-05-10 01:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(293929, 20550, 7033, '<td valign="top">Sharpness of the glass and the deeply saturated blues really give this shot some ''snap''.  Very nice overall!  --8</td>', 'Sharpness of the glass and the deeply saturated blues really give this shot some ''snap''.  Very nice overall!  --8', '2003-05-10 01:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(293930, 20604, 4767, '<td valign="top">You obviously have tricks in your pocket, you have things up your sleeve, and you have done it admirably.  Great photo, extraordinary title which seems all too a propos.</td>', 'You obviously have tricks in your pocket, you have things up your sleeve, and you have done it admirably.  Great photo, extraordinary title which seems all too a propos.', '2003-05-10 02:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(293931, 20643, 4767, '<td valign="top">Dang!  That is lovely! - 8 -</td>', 'Dang!  That is lovely! - 8 -', '2003-05-10 02:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(293932, 20828, 7033, '<td valign="top">Kind of amazing that the shadow could be so dark...  I wish the glass were in sharper focus, and that the liquid were level.</td>', 'Kind of amazing that the shadow could be so dark...  I wish the glass were in sharper focus, and that the liquid were level.', '2003-05-10 02:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(293933, 20276, 4767, '<td valign="top">cool glass,  cool stripes, but not pin width, unless the glass is MUCH tinier than it appears in this pic.</td>', 'cool glass,  cool stripes, but not pin width, unless the glass is MUCH tinier than it appears in this pic.', '2003-05-10 02:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(293934, 20842, 4767, '<td valign="top">AMAZINGly great lighting!</td>', 'AMAZINGly great lighting!', '2003-05-10 02:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(293935, 20780, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice, creative approach to the challenge... not sure I completely ''get'' it, though.  Technically, the composition is very nice-- I wish the shot were in better focus overall.</td>', 'Nice, creative approach to the challenge... not sure I completely ''get'' it, though.  Technically, the composition is very nice-- I wish the shot were in better focus overall.', '2003-05-10 02:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(293936, 20816, 4767, '<td valign="top">Bravissimo!!</td>', 'Bravissimo!!', '2003-05-10 02:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(293937, 20762, 6477, '<td valign="top">I would prefer this one in colors...</td>', 'I would prefer this one in colors...', '2003-05-10 02:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(293938, 20636, 4767, '<td valign="top">good eye!  Nice capture!</td>', 'good eye!  Nice capture!', '2003-05-10 02:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(293940, 20460, 4767, '<td valign="top">Impressive perspective, delicious photo!  This is WAY above par!</td>', 'Impressive perspective, delicious photo!  This is WAY above par!', '2003-05-10 02:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(293941, 20763, 7033, '<td valign="top">Creative approach to the challenge!  (How many times did you have to drop something to capture it just right?).  I like the background and the desaturated colors, but it''s a pity the powerlines in the distance are still there... just a bit too distracting.  --8</td>', 'Creative approach to the challenge!  (How many times did you have to drop something to capture it just right?).  I like the background and the desaturated colors, but it''s a pity the powerlines in the distance are still there... just a bit too distracting.  --8', '2003-05-10 02:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(293943, 20843, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice lines.  excelly composition, well photographed!</td>', 'Nice lines.  excelly composition, well photographed!', '2003-05-10 02:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(293944, 20450, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is.  The subject seems to be the round (glass?) thing in the middle of the metallic square thing.  Everything outside that square seems to be wasted space.  I don''t see it adding anything.  Maybe a close up on the subject would have fared better?</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is.  The subject seems to be the round (glass?) thing in the middle of the metallic square thing.  Everything outside that square seems to be wasted space.  I don''t see it adding anything.  Maybe a close up on the subject would have fared better?', '2003-05-10 02:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(293945, 20559, 4767, '<td valign="top">A whole different interpretation to the challenge!  This is excellent!  -8-</td>', 'A whole different interpretation to the challenge!  This is excellent!  -8-', '2003-05-10 02:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(293947, 20541, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very neat effect here... and very creative!  Who would have thought to use a piece of poor-quality glass to create a work of art?  I do wish the tree on the right were a bit... maybe lighter?  A bit less distracting, at least.  Very nice here, though!  --9</td>', 'Very neat effect here... and very creative!  Who would have thought to use a piece of poor-quality glass to create a work of art?  I do wish the tree on the right were a bit... maybe lighter?  A bit less distracting, at least.  Very nice here, though!  --9', '2003-05-10 02:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(293948, 20324, 2337, '<td valign="top">Clever concept / title.  The execution fell a bit short though...  The trim on the left is very distracting (the slant) and the white (curtain?) on the right doesn''t really add anything.</td>', 'Clever concept / title.  The execution fell a bit short though...  The trim on the left is very distracting (the slant) and the white (curtain?) on the right doesn''t really add anything.', '2003-05-10 02:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(293949, 20227, 2337, '<td valign="top">The size of the photo itself hurt this photo for me.  You can have up to 640 pixals on the longest side and up to 150 kb total.  You lost a lot more of your shot then you needed to by trimming down this small.</td>', 'The size of the photo itself hurt this photo for me.  You can have up to 640 pixals on the longest side and up to 150 kb total.  You lost a lot more of your shot then you needed to by trimming down this small.', '2003-05-10 02:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(293951, 20311, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very striking shot!  Very nice!!!  A couple of distractions, though... one is the flaw in the bottom of the one glass.... the other is the border.  It takes a bit too much away from the shot itself, in my opinion.  --9</td>', 'Very striking shot!  Very nice!!!  A couple of distractions, though... one is the flaw in the bottom of the one glass.... the other is the border.  It takes a bit too much away from the shot itself, in my opinion.  --9', '2003-05-10 02:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(293952, 20633, 7033, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, and a very nice shot overall...  One criticism, though-- lose the border (or at least the shadowed portion).  I think it draws too much away from the rest of your shot. --8</td>', 'Beautiful color, and a very nice shot overall...  One criticism, though-- lose the border (or at least the shadowed portion).  I think it draws too much away from the rest of your shot. --8', '2003-05-10 02:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(293953, 20416, 4767, '<td valign="top">What a clever image!  Cuter than a bug''s buuu.....  ear!  -9-</td>', 'What a clever image!  Cuter than a bug''s buuu.....  ear!  -9-', '2003-05-10 02:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(293956, 20389, 4767, '<td valign="top">Yep.  The title made me look again and again.  I assume it was the photographer was nude, or maybe I need new glasses.  NICE image!  Intriguing graphics! - 8 -</td>', 'Yep.  The title made me look again and again.  I assume it was the photographer was nude, or maybe I need new glasses.  NICE image!  Intriguing graphics! - 8 -', '2003-05-10 02:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(293958, 20818, 7033, '<td valign="top">Love the color, texture, composition... and the title!  --10 all the way!</td>', 'Love the color, texture, composition... and the title!  --10 all the way!', '2003-05-10 02:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(293959, 20226, 4767, '<td valign="top">I like the glowing blue rectangles in the pestle.  Interesting photo.<br/></td>', 'I like the glowing blue rectangles in the pestle.  Interesting photo.', '2003-05-10 02:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(293960, 20670, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interesting high key effext, well done.</td>', 'Interesting high key effext, well done.', '2003-05-10 02:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(293962, 20223, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice intense colors.  I wish it were that easy to understand and express agape.</td>', 'Nice intense colors.  I wish it were that easy to understand and express agape.', '2003-05-10 02:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(293965, 20738, 4767, '<td valign="top">CUTE!  CLEVER!  CREATIVE!  (On the other hand, that damned Madonna shows up everywhere, doesn''t she?)  - 7 -</td>', 'CUTE!  CLEVER!  CREATIVE!  (On the other hand, that damned Madonna shows up everywhere, doesn''t she?)  - 7 -', '2003-05-10 02:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(293968, 20646, 4969, '<td valign="top">rip off</td>', 'rip off', '2003-05-10 02:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(293972, 20355, 4967, '<td valign="top">Too much shadow, lighting doesn''t seem to be good... very bright, not extremely interesting.  Subject is cool, with it''s detail, just wish it wouldn''t just be a glass ball sitting on a table.</td>', 'Too much shadow, lighting doesn''t seem to be good... very bright, not extremely interesting.  Subject is cool, with it''s detail, just wish it wouldn''t just be a glass ball sitting on a table.', '2003-05-10 02:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(293974, 20720, 4967, '<td valign="top">Would have been neat with a solid black background with the light shining straight down on it.  The action is very nice... I suggest also zooming in so you get more of the action and less of the background.Too much empty space.</td>', 'Would have been neat with a solid black background with the light shining straight down on it.  The action is very nice... I suggest also zooming in so you get more of the action and less of the background.Too much empty space.', '2003-05-10 02:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(293976, 20768, 4967, '<td valign="top">The lighting is bothersome on this photo, you have too many lights glaring off the object.  Interesting idea with the glass reflections in the mirror.  Watch what sorrounds the vase, the extra stuff takes away from it, control your lighting for a more effectual picture.  Also watch your graininess, not sure whether you cropped or just had a very high iso, but keep that in mind.</td>', 'The lighting is bothersome on this photo, you have too many lights glaring off the object.  Interesting idea with the glass reflections in the mirror.  Watch what sorrounds the vase, the extra stuff takes away from it, control your lighting for a more effectual picture.  Also watch your graininess, not sure whether you cropped or just had a very high iso, but keep that in mind.', '2003-05-10 03:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(293977, 20702, 4967, '<td valign="top">I feel that the lighting looks a little off, and the way that the glass suddenly stops at the end is bothersome.  Good use with the blue background, but there is too much empty space at the top... also keep in mind the rule of thirds, as this is extremely centered, and not very interesting.  Not much there to make this photo worthwhile.</td>', 'I feel that the lighting looks a little off, and the way that the glass suddenly stops at the end is bothersome.  Good use with the blue background, but there is too much empty space at the top... also keep in mind the rule of thirds, as this is extremely centered, and not very interesting.  Not much there to make this photo worthwhile.', '2003-05-10 03:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(293978, 20802, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very cool.... this is a very interesting photo, and I like your lighting, and how it''s just the sun that stands out.  Maybe tone the yellow down just a tad, but beautifully framed and off center, just very well composed.  Interesting subject that could have been construed as someone else art, but you turned it into your own!  Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool.... this is a very interesting photo, and I like your lighting, and how it''s just the sun that stands out.  Maybe tone the yellow down just a tad, but beautifully framed and off center, just very well composed.  Interesting subject that could have been construed as someone else art, but you turned it into your own!  Nice job.', '2003-05-10 03:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(293979, 20228, 4967, '<td valign="top">OOPS!  Hope you didn''t drink all of these &lt;GRIN&gt;  Nice lighting here, and I like the black and white.  great table top reflections... Made my boyfriend laugh :-)  Great use of contrast here... very well done, I''m going for a -10-  Congrats!</td>', 'OOPS!  Hope you didn''t drink all of these <GRIN>  Nice lighting here, and I like the black and white.  great table top reflections... Made my boyfriend laugh :-)  Great use of contrast here... very well done, I''m going for a -10-  Congrats!', '2003-05-10 03:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
