(294035, 20458, 3972, '<td valign="top">The first I''ve commented on so far this week and the one that DESERVES to come FIRST.<br/> <br/>Definitely an image with the sought-after "Wow" factor - as "WOW !!!" is exactly what involuntarily issued from me immediately upon seeing this extraordinarily striking picture.<br/> <br/>There was a "fleet"ing moment when I thought it was a model ship - such was the impact of its shape.<br/> <br/>What is it ? How did you do it ?<br/> <br/>IT''S FANTASTIC !!<br/> <br/>Great good luck to you for your final placing ! Er....10 !</td>', 'The first I''ve commented on so far this week and the one that DESERVES to come FIRST. Definitely an image with the sought-after "Wow" factor - as "WOW !!!" is exactly what involuntarily issued from me immediately upon seeing this extraordinarily striking picture. There was a "fleet"ing moment when I thought it was a model ship - such was the impact of its shape. What is it ? How did you do it ? IT''S FANTASTIC !! Great good luck to you for your final placing ! Er....10 !', '2003-05-10 07:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
