(294080, 20546, 1202, '<td valign="top">It looks as though you were limited with what you could have done with this subject.   If you could have gotton closer to show the detail of the stunning structure your picture would have been improved significantly.You held quite steady for your exposure but a tripod would be a must use item in this situation.  5</td>', 'It looks as though you were limited with what you could have done with this subject.   If you could have gotton closer to show the detail of the stunning structure your picture would have been improved significantly.You held quite steady for your exposure but a tripod would be a must use item in this situation.  5', '2003-05-10 09:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(294082, 20839, 5999, '<td valign="top">Elegant. Wonderful focus and DOF. Lovely colors. Great shot.<br/>Mark</td>', 'Elegant. Wonderful focus and DOF. Lovely colors. Great shot.Mark', '2003-05-10 09:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(294086, 20397, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea and you have me ready to dive in.   There is something about your exposure and clarity of the building detail that could use improvement.   Did you use a tripod,high f stop, and long exposure?   If not I think it would bring out the detail and give you a much sharper result.  6</td>', 'This is a great idea and you have me ready to dive in.   There is something about your exposure and clarity of the building detail that could use improvement.   Did you use a tripod,high f stop, and long exposure?   If not I think it would bring out the detail and give you a much sharper result.  6', '2003-05-10 09:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(294087, 20175, 5999, '<td valign="top">Interesting, sharper focus would have helped I think.<br/>Mark</td>', 'Interesting, sharper focus would have helped I think.Mark', '2003-05-10 09:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(294088, 20642, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have done a great job of retaining the wonderful shades of color on this old piece of glass.  A longer exposure might have brought out more of the detail and white balance adjustment would enhance the colors even more.   7</td>', 'You have done a great job of retaining the wonderful shades of color on this old piece of glass.  A longer exposure might have brought out more of the detail and white balance adjustment would enhance the colors even more.   7', '2003-05-10 10:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(294089, 20559, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, technically okay picture, but I feel the water is the main subject, not the glass.  Think to yourself, which would change the mood of the picture the most, if you removed the glasses or if you removed the water?  6</td>', 'This is a nice, technically okay picture, but I feel the water is the main subject, not the glass.  Think to yourself, which would change the mood of the picture the most, if you removed the glasses or if you removed the water?  6', '2003-05-10 10:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(294091, 20816, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice colorful curves, and good color.   I feel it would be more effective if less centered and a little more exposure to reduce the grain.  Not a bad job though.   5</td>', 'Nice colorful curves, and good color.   I feel it would be more effective if less centered and a little more exposure to reduce the grain.  Not a bad job though.   5', '2003-05-10 10:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
