(294505, 20826, 5007, '<td valign="top">Even though the upper body and feet are cut off, this works for me. I love the depth of color that only stained glass can hold. I used to work with stained glass and still love it today. Very nice photo. Good luck in the contest.</td>', 'Even though the upper body and feet are cut off, this works for me. I love the depth of color that only stained glass can hold. I used to work with stained glass and still love it today. Very nice photo. Good luck in the contest.', '2003-05-10 22:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
