(294521, 20561, 5351, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!  I really like this - I absolutely love the focus, color contrast, and texture contrast of the black netting in the background against the cloudy glass of the floats.  I also really like the composition, including the larger roping/netting in the lower righthand corner.  The lighting and colors are excellent as well.  Good luck in the challenge -extremely high score:)</td>', 'What a great shot!  I really like this - I absolutely love the focus, color contrast, and texture contrast of the black netting in the background against the cloudy glass of the floats.  I also really like the composition, including the larger roping/netting in the lower righthand corner.  The lighting and colors are excellent as well.  Good luck in the challenge -extremely high score:)', '2003-05-10 23:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(294527, 20407, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice pic.  I think of it as more of an abstract.  I really like the colors and the negative space does a lot for this photo.</td>', 'This is a very nice pic.  I think of it as more of an abstract.  I really like the colors and the negative space does a lot for this photo.', '2003-05-10 23:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(294528, 20315, 5351, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  Love the little sparkle on the rim of the glass.  Very nice as is - my only suggestions, would be I would like to see this with the entire butterfly showing, and with the background a bit more out of focus.  good job!</td>', 'Great colors!  Love the little sparkle on the rim of the glass.  Very nice as is - my only suggestions, would be I would like to see this with the entire butterfly showing, and with the background a bit more out of focus.  good job!', '2003-05-10 23:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(294530, 20166, 5351, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Would love to know how this was achieved - good job!</td>', 'Excellent!  Would love to know how this was achieved - good job!', '2003-05-10 23:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
