(294534, 20276, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice work the refraction effects on this photo.  I didn''t see it in the thumb and thought it was just another silly picture of a vase, but I see now that this is one of the best photos i''ve seen so far.  Nice work - 9</td>', 'Nice work the refraction effects on this photo.  I didn''t see it in the thumb and thought it was just another silly picture of a vase, but I see now that this is one of the best photos i''ve seen so far.  Nice work - 9', '2003-05-10 23:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
