(294646, 20723, 3540, '<td valign="top">awesome reflections.  I was sure we''d see tons of these this week but I think this is the first one I''ve seen.  I like the real windows going up the middle.  Gives the interest to this pic.  Nice work.</td>', 'awesome reflections.  I was sure we''d see tons of these this week but I think this is the first one I''ve seen.  I like the real windows going up the middle.  Gives the interest to this pic.  Nice work.', '2003-05-11 08:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(294647, 20758, 3540, '<td valign="top">Hasn''t this guy been on the Pentium commercial?  I like the lighting and the shadows pretty cool. I like the way the light is right in the middle of his face.</td>', 'Hasn''t this guy been on the Pentium commercial?  I like the lighting and the shadows pretty cool. I like the way the light is right in the middle of his face.', '2003-05-11 08:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(294648, 20320, 3540, '<td valign="top">I only have one word for this picture - Winner</td>', 'I only have one word for this picture - Winner', '2003-05-11 08:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(294649, 20847, 3540, '<td valign="top">I would expect the colors to show thru a little more here.  They aren''t bad though.  I like the lighting, particularly what''s showing on the bottom of the piece.  That''s an unusual effect and I believe its effective.</td>', 'I would expect the colors to show thru a little more here.  They aren''t bad though.  I like the lighting, particularly what''s showing on the bottom of the piece.  That''s an unusual effect and I believe its effective.', '2003-05-11 08:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(294650, 20803, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is, so I''ll assume its some kind of abstract.  And I really think its pretty cool.  It has some dynamic motion, good lighting and is a very well taken pic.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, so I''ll assume its some kind of abstract.  And I really think its pretty cool.  It has some dynamic motion, good lighting and is a very well taken pic.', '2003-05-11 08:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(294651, 20693, 3540, '<td valign="top">That''s a mighty busy background.  I see the refraction in the glass, but I''d have chosen something a little sublter in pattern.   The vase is a very unusual piece.  For some reason It reminds me of a rooster.</td>', 'That''s a mighty busy background.  I see the refraction in the glass, but I''d have chosen something a little sublter in pattern.   The vase is a very unusual piece.  For some reason It reminds me of a rooster.', '2003-05-11 08:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(294654, 20634, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good concept for this picture.   not to mention very well done.  The tonal quality of this photo is exceptional.  The magnified part shows that you need to shave :-)   Excellent pic - 10</td>', 'Good concept for this picture.   not to mention very well done.  The tonal quality of this photo is exceptional.  The magnified part shows that you need to shave :-)   Excellent pic - 10', '2003-05-11 08:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(294655, 20566, 3540, '<td valign="top">The colors inside are great.  very nicely done.</td>', 'The colors inside are great.  very nicely done.', '2003-05-11 08:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(294663, 20643, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cool artsy photo.  Love the colors in this one.  I think leaving the space in front to give the viewer some time to look at this before looking at the actual vases helps a lot.  Nice work</td>', 'Cool artsy photo.  Love the colors in this one.  I think leaving the space in front to give the viewer some time to look at this before looking at the actual vases helps a lot.  Nice work', '2003-05-11 09:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(294665, 20754, 3540, '<td valign="top">THis would rock if you could put it more off center an make it less balanced.   A very nice abstract.</td>', 'THis would rock if you could put it more off center an make it less balanced.   A very nice abstract.', '2003-05-11 10:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(294681, 20392, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent composition... the circles work well here and the color is also appealing.  the magnifying glass seems just a tad soft though.... excellent work :)</td>', 'excellent composition... the circles work well here and the color is also appealing.  the magnifying glass seems just a tad soft though.... excellent work :)', '2003-05-11 11:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(294682, 20691, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent black and white.... i like the abstract quality of this photo and the composition is also excellent :)</td>', 'excellent black and white.... i like the abstract quality of this photo and the composition is also excellent :)', '2003-05-11 11:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(294683, 20244, 1570, '<td valign="top">that''s a lot of vodka!</td>', 'that''s a lot of vodka!', '2003-05-11 11:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(294685, 20752, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice abstract... i love the yellow monotone you chose here... that contrasts nicely with the black and darkness... excellent work :)</td>', 'very nice abstract... i love the yellow monotone you chose here... that contrasts nicely with the black and darkness... excellent work :)', '2003-05-11 11:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(294687, 20087, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is an excellent use of ''darkness'' in a photograph.  The darkness adds nicely to the abstract element of the image... great work :)</td>', 'I think this is an excellent use of ''darkness'' in a photograph.  The darkness adds nicely to the abstract element of the image... great work :)', '2003-05-11 11:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(294688, 20810, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent abstract.... the background almost looks painted... nice work :)</td>', 'excellent abstract.... the background almost looks painted... nice work :)', '2003-05-11 11:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(294692, 20458, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent action capture :)  i''m afraid to try something like this on my own... lol... good work :)</td>', 'excellent action capture :)  i''m afraid to try something like this on my own... lol... good work :)', '2003-05-11 11:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(294729, 20846, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Lighting''s a little too bright for my taste - I think this would work better with more subdued lighting.</td>', 'Good subject. Lighting''s a little too bright for my taste - I think this would work better with more subdued lighting.', '2003-05-11 13:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(294730, 20702, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great colors and the backlighting works well. Simple, but effective.</td>', 'Great colors and the backlighting works well. Simple, but effective.', '2003-05-11 13:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(294732, 20460, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pleasant lighting produces an intimate mood. Nice.</td>', 'Pleasant lighting produces an intimate mood. Nice.', '2003-05-11 13:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(294733, 20795, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2003-05-11 13:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(294734, 20737, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the low viewpoint - makes this much more interesting than it would have been. The blue tone gives the sense of coldness too.</td>', 'I like the low viewpoint - makes this much more interesting than it would have been. The blue tone gives the sense of coldness too.', '2003-05-11 13:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(294735, 20831, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good effect.</td>', 'Good effect.', '2003-05-11 13:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(294736, 20569, 3290, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little dark?</td>', 'Perhaps a little dark?', '2003-05-11 13:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(294737, 20223, 3290, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve got the exposure just right here - nice balance between light and dark and some great colour graduations. Well done.</td>', 'I think you''ve got the exposure just right here - nice balance between light and dark and some great colour graduations. Well done.', '2003-05-11 13:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(294738, 20837, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Nice effect and good choice of colour contrast,</td>', 'Interesting. Nice effect and good choice of colour contrast,', '2003-05-11 13:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(294739, 20742, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. If the sky was bluer, it would be more effective.</td>', 'I like the composition. If the sky was bluer, it would be more effective.', '2003-05-11 13:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(294740, 20510, 3290, '<td valign="top">The light band in the background is a distraction and the colours in the marbles could do with a bit more saturation. But good choice of subject and use of DOF.</td>', 'The light band in the background is a distraction and the colours in the marbles could do with a bit more saturation. But good choice of subject and use of DOF.', '2003-05-11 13:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(294741, 20825, 3290, '<td valign="top">Um. Where''s the glass? Have I missed something? Nice portrait though.</td>', 'Um. Where''s the glass? Have I missed something? Nice portrait though.', '2003-05-11 13:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(294742, 20777, 3290, '<td valign="top">Ouch!</td>', 'Ouch!', '2003-05-11 13:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(294743, 20642, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty.</td>', 'Pretty.', '2003-05-11 13:37:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(294744, 20529, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and clarity.</td>', 'Nice composition and clarity.', '2003-05-11 13:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(294745, 20818, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good colours and pattern. Interesting shot.</td>', 'Good colours and pattern. Interesting shot.', '2003-05-11 13:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(294746, 20776, 3290, '<td valign="top">Clever. Good composition.</td>', 'Clever. Good composition.', '2003-05-11 13:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(294747, 20584, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool. Nice distortions.</td>', 'Cool. Nice distortions.', '2003-05-11 13:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(294748, 20800, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great colour - just a bit too dark.</td>', 'Great colour - just a bit too dark.', '2003-05-11 13:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(294749, 20675, 3290, '<td valign="top">Shiny. B&amp;W was a good choice.</td>', 'Shiny. B&W was a good choice.', '2003-05-11 13:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(294750, 20146, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting. A little too bright, which spoils it a little. Good idea, though.</td>', 'Interesting. A little too bright, which spoils it a little. Good idea, though.', '2003-05-11 13:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(294751, 20452, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great clarity.</td>', 'Great clarity.', '2003-05-11 13:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(294752, 20215, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - theflower''s lovely but I don''t like the vase much :-)</td>', 'Nice composition - theflower''s lovely but I don''t like the vase much :-)', '2003-05-11 13:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(294754, 20830, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting effect. Well done.', '2003-05-11 13:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(294756, 20418, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good composition - there are some nice lines and a a great sense of perspective in this.</td>', 'Good composition - there are some nice lines and a a great sense of perspective in this.', '2003-05-11 13:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(294757, 20300, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good composition - diagonal lines give a sense of movement.</td>', 'Good composition - diagonal lines give a sense of movement.', '2003-05-11 13:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(294758, 20231, 3290, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2003-05-11 13:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(294761, 20733, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the colour division and the composition - well done.</td>', 'I like the colour division and the composition - well done.', '2003-05-11 13:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(294771, 20463, 7703, '<td valign="top">How many glasses did you brake to get this great picture ... 10 from me</td>', 'How many glasses did you brake to get this great picture ... 10 from me', '2003-05-11 15:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(294772, 20188, 7703, '<td valign="top">These fingers</td>', 'These fingers', '2003-05-11 15:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(294773, 20827, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is fun. Your presentable end-result must have ended up pretty small but clever you worked it in a nice, non-conventional frame setting to fool a bit more. 8</td>', 'This is fun. Your presentable end-result must have ended up pretty small but clever you worked it in a nice, non-conventional frame setting to fool a bit more. 8', '2003-05-11 15:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(294775, 20635, 2586, '<td valign="top">This has a nice abstract, op-art, Escherian quality to it. Find the title too humdrum but you probably felt a need to identify this image in order to please the meeting-the-challenge nazis. 8</td>', 'This has a nice abstract, op-art, Escherian quality to it. Find the title too humdrum but you probably felt a need to identify this image in order to please the meeting-the-challenge nazis. 8', '2003-05-11 15:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(294779, 20400, 4829, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, would have been pretty cool to have a splash of color in there somewhere, like a flower or maybe some red wine? Very nice!</td>', 'Nice shot, would have been pretty cool to have a splash of color in there somewhere, like a flower or maybe some red wine? Very nice!', '2003-05-11 15:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(294780, 20634, 2586, '<td valign="top">A simple device, known to all of us, used creatively to produce an original image. Like your use of the blue tones. The Picasso allusion in the title is very appropriate - except for the implication that it might harken back to his Blue Period . It''s more representative for his last 30 years or so.  Just toss this out, titles never enter into my scores. 8</td>', 'A simple device, known to all of us, used creatively to produce an original image. Like your use of the blue tones. The Picasso allusion in the title is very appropriate - except for the implication that it might harken back to his Blue Period . It''s more representative for his last 30 years or so.  Just toss this out, titles never enter into my scores. 8', '2003-05-11 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(294781, 20247, 4829, '<td valign="top">The table and the background are very distracting, it''s one of the first things I noticed instead of the intended subject.</td>', 'The table and the background are very distracting, it''s one of the first things I noticed instead of the intended subject.', '2003-05-11 15:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(294782, 20819, 4829, '<td valign="top">Very well executed! Nice clarity and focus! I like the originality.</td>', 'Very well executed! Nice clarity and focus! I like the originality.', '2003-05-11 15:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(294784, 20818, 2586, '<td valign="top">Like this because of its painterly qualities. The use of perfect lighting contributed a lot, imho, to achieve that painterly result. The interesting background, is that more glass? Emphasis of the blue tone,  supplemented with the red, works very well. Good composition. 8</td>', 'Like this because of its painterly qualities. The use of perfect lighting contributed a lot, imho, to achieve that painterly result. The interesting background, is that more glass? Emphasis of the blue tone,  supplemented with the red, works very well. Good composition. 8', '2003-05-11 15:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(294787, 20733, 4829, '<td valign="top">Awesome! Great illusion, your title also helps, because I am not sure if I would have seen the "Stairway" until I read the titel and reevaluated your photo. Very nice!</td>', 'Awesome! Great illusion, your title also helps, because I am not sure if I would have seen the "Stairway" until I read the titel and reevaluated your photo. Very nice!', '2003-05-11 15:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(294792, 20588, 4829, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I wasn''t to sure about this photo. But when you look at it there are many great aspects, the lighting the shadows and reflections...It truly is a beautiful photo! One of the few that I truly liked...good job!</td>', 'At first glance, I wasn''t to sure about this photo. But when you look at it there are many great aspects, the lighting the shadows and reflections...It truly is a beautiful photo! One of the few that I truly liked...good job!', '2003-05-11 15:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(294794, 20678, 2586, '<td valign="top">I like this one but i also believe that with little effort you could have done much more with this. The title is okay but you could have gone for Depression or Anger. I also feel the mundane clothing of the model distracts from the shot. Had the man been naked (you won''t see anything ''bad'' anyway) it would have helped to bring out more the potentially emotive quality of this shot, i.e. a man caught in an intimate moment when he is putting his soul on display. Then again, this may not have been taken at home but in a public place and making that a little difficult to do. I like the colors, like the glass, like the idea. Man, such an emotive potential here - hope you work more on this, unless of course, that''s NOT at all what you had in mind as the meaning of this shot. 8</td>', 'I like this one but i also believe that with little effort you could have done much more with this. The title is okay but you could have gone for Depression or Anger. I also feel the mundane clothing of the model distracts from the shot. Had the man been naked (you won''t see anything ''bad'' anyway) it would have helped to bring out more the potentially emotive quality of this shot, i.e. a man caught in an intimate moment when he is putting his soul on display. Then again, this may not have been taken at home but in a public place and making that a little difficult to do. I like the colors, like the glass, like the idea. Man, such an emotive potential here - hope you work more on this, unless of course, that''s NOT at all what you had in mind as the meaning of this shot. 8', '2003-05-11 15:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(294799, 20803, 4829, '<td valign="top">The first thing that came to my mind when I saw this picture was SEXY. Very nice and sleek, and I am not sure if this was intended, but it reminds me of a womans body, with her arms up. Nice photo...</td>', 'The first thing that came to my mind when I saw this picture was SEXY. Very nice and sleek, and I am not sure if this was intended, but it reminds me of a womans body, with her arms up. Nice photo...', '2003-05-11 15:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(294800, 20591, 2586, '<td valign="top">Well done, reminds me of the Broken Primaries shot i saw at photosig (did i say Primaries????). This was tough to do and you controlled it well, including the light. Funny, it has a nice emotive quality to me. Yeah, it can just reflect an accident but it also can express violence/frustration - the viewer may read, or not, whatever he wants from it, right? That glass has a very nice, warm quality to it. Just from the light or some toning as well? 8</td>', 'Well done, reminds me of the Broken Primaries shot i saw at photosig (did i say Primaries????). This was tough to do and you controlled it well, including the light. Funny, it has a nice emotive quality to me. Yeah, it can just reflect an accident but it also can express violence/frustration - the viewer may read, or not, whatever he wants from it, right? That glass has a very nice, warm quality to it. Just from the light or some toning as well? 8', '2003-05-11 15:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(294803, 20458, 2586, '<td valign="top">A technical feat and a lot of clean-up i bet. 8</td>', 'A technical feat and a lot of clean-up i bet. 8', '2003-05-11 15:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(294804, 20718, 7222, '<td valign="top">Too dark? hehehe, just kidding... I guess you''ve had this comment already...<br/>Very interesting work on the lighting. The white spot close to the left bottom corner is VERY distracting, you should have get rid of it.<br/>Good work anyway.</td>', 'Too dark? hehehe, just kidding... I guess you''ve had this comment already...Very interesting work on the lighting. The white spot close to the left bottom corner is VERY distracting, you should have get rid of it.Good work anyway.', '2003-05-11 15:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(294810, 20228, 2586, '<td valign="top">One for the road, one for my baby, and one too many? :) Nice warm tones, good control of the glass. The grey background helps to underscore the mood and as a result only the glass highlights are the light values. Like the mood of this picture and the story it tells. Very effective composition: the two glasses near the edge and one cropped off allude to many empty and already consumed glasses outside of the picture plane.  It might be rewarding for you to lay off on the liquor and spend that time instead on photography ;) 8</td>', 'One for the road, one for my baby, and one too many? :) Nice warm tones, good control of the glass. The grey background helps to underscore the mood and as a result only the glass highlights are the light values. Like the mood of this picture and the story it tells. Very effective composition: the two glasses near the edge and one cropped off allude to many empty and already consumed glasses outside of the picture plane.  It might be rewarding for you to lay off on the liquor and spend that time instead on photography ;) 8', '2003-05-11 15:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(294813, 20416, 4829, '<td valign="top">AWESOME! This would make a GREAT print! -10-</td>', 'AWESOME! This would make a GREAT print! -10-', '2003-05-11 16:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(294814, 20326, 2586, '<td valign="top">You drunken b@stard! If you had shot this when sober, then everything could have been in sharp focus! Just joking. Really fun and creative shot. Did you take this in the sink/tub with the little handheld shower squirting water in at the other (not shown) end of the glass to make it overflow and create the bubbles? Creative use of color adjustments. 8</td>', 'You drunken b@stard! If you had shot this when sober, then everything could have been in sharp focus! Just joking. Really fun and creative shot. Did you take this in the sink/tub with the little handheld shower squirting water in at the other (not shown) end of the glass to make it overflow and create the bubbles? Creative use of color adjustments. 8', '2003-05-11 16:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(294815, 20774, 5400, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like the border. If it was only blue would be much better. Great picture, and particulary nice crop.</td>', 'I didn''t like the border. If it was only blue would be much better. Great picture, and particulary nice crop.', '2003-05-11 16:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(294818, 20588, 5400, '<td valign="top">I liked this one. Good points are the subject and bacground, includind background reflexes. Bad points are the border (too thick. Without the outer white, I think it would be better), and I think the illumination is a little too strong or direct. Not that the reflexes are bad, but there are too many on the subject itself.</td>', 'I liked this one. Good points are the subject and bacground, includind background reflexes. Bad points are the border (too thick. Without the outer white, I think it would be better), and I think the illumination is a little too strong or direct. Not that the reflexes are bad, but there are too many on the subject itself.', '2003-05-11 16:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(294819, 20311, 2586, '<td valign="top">Very creative with strong graphic overtones. Lost the rhythm somewhat with the right glass but hey, i''m not complaining. 8</td>', 'Very creative with strong graphic overtones. Lost the rhythm somewhat with the right glass but hey, i''m not complaining. 8', '2003-05-11 16:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
