(294822, 20753, 2586, '<td valign="top">Indeed i like the focus, and the dof, on this one. Love the stark simplicity of the shot - that does a lot more to me than those elaborately put together compositions of exquisite glass. 8 After finishing my tweaking, bumped this to a 9. It''s my favorite as i always appreciate when a lot can be conveyed with the greatest economy of means, i.e. props.</td>', 'Indeed i like the focus, and the dof, on this one. Love the stark simplicity of the shot - that does a lot more to me than those elaborately put together compositions of exquisite glass. 8 After finishing my tweaking, bumped this to a 9. It''s my favorite as i always appreciate when a lot can be conveyed with the greatest economy of means, i.e. props.', '2003-05-11 16:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
