(294951, 20397, 6667, '<td valign="top">This is a very, very unique and imaginative shot.  I really like the perspective and the interpretation of the challenge.  My only comment is the crispness of the shot, DOF.  LOL  What would have been out of this world would have been if there were a bird sitting on one of  the steps (of your pool)!!!</td>', 'This is a very, very unique and imaginative shot.  I really like the perspective and the interpretation of the challenge.  My only comment is the crispness of the shot, DOF.  LOL  What would have been out of this world would have been if there were a bird sitting on one of  the steps (of your pool)!!!', '2003-05-11 20:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(294954, 20768, 6667, '<td valign="top">Would have loved to see this lit against a black backgorund instead of the reflection.</td>', 'Would have loved to see this lit against a black backgorund instead of the reflection.', '2003-05-11 20:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(294959, 20389, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very complex image. Can''t quite figure out where you''re shooting from. Very interresting though. Nice reflections and shadows.</td>', 'Very complex image. Can''t quite figure out where you''re shooting from. Very interresting though. Nice reflections and shadows.', '2003-05-11 20:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(294960, 20825, 5044, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is glass. Is it shot in a mirror?</td>', 'Not sure how this is glass. Is it shot in a mirror?', '2003-05-11 20:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(294962, 20635, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Nice reflections.</td>', 'Nicely done. Nice reflections.', '2003-05-11 20:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(294964, 20603, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but too bad the simmetry is a little off.</td>', 'Very nice, but too bad the simmetry is a little off.', '2003-05-11 20:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(294970, 20595, 6938, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too much flaring, and the change in the glass colour (is that achange in the background?) is very distracting from an otherwise great photo.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too much flaring, and the change in the glass colour (is that achange in the background?) is very distracting from an otherwise great photo.', '2003-05-11 21:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(294971, 20266, 6938, '<td valign="top">Good use of ambiant lighting.</td>', 'Good use of ambiant lighting.', '2003-05-11 21:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(294973, 20584, 6325, '<td valign="top">Abstract result. Nice.</td>', 'Abstract result. Nice.', '2003-05-11 21:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(294975, 20251, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good image. I like the vagueness of the bulb - more like a suggestion rather than a reality.</td>', 'Good image. I like the vagueness of the bulb - more like a suggestion rather than a reality.', '2003-05-11 21:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(294977, 20632, 6325, '<td valign="top">Top part of the glass shows good color. Different lighting could have shown off more of it. Also could have been squared up.</td>', 'Top part of the glass shows good color. Different lighting could have shown off more of it. Also could have been squared up.', '2003-05-11 21:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(294978, 20588, 6938, '<td valign="top">perhaps the chage between the floor and wall in the background could have been a bit more subtle<br/></td>', 'perhaps the chage between the floor and wall in the background could have been a bit more subtle', '2003-05-11 21:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(294979, 20847, 6325, '<td valign="top">Colors are very good. Why so small?</td>', 'Colors are very good. Why so small?', '2003-05-11 21:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(294981, 20693, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice piece of glass. I think a different background  material would have worked better.</td>', 'Nice piece of glass. I think a different background  material would have worked better.', '2003-05-11 21:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(294982, 20278, 6938, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  But the use of light and the lack of water at bottom left doesn''t come up to its potential.</td>', 'I like the concept.  But the use of light and the lack of water at bottom left doesn''t come up to its potential.', '2003-05-11 21:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(294983, 20795, 6325, '<td valign="top">Looks as if it is under water.</td>', 'Looks as if it is under water.', '2003-05-11 21:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(294984, 20445, 6325, '<td valign="top">Interesting setup. I think the lighting is a little weak. Maybe a white background would have put more punch in the image.</td>', 'Interesting setup. I think the lighting is a little weak. Maybe a white background would have put more punch in the image.', '2003-05-11 21:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(294989, 20458, 4400, '<td valign="top">Flott mynd!</td>', 'Flott mynd!', '2003-05-11 21:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(294990, 20778, 6325, '<td valign="top">Looks like little eyeballs. A little spooky.</td>', 'Looks like little eyeballs. A little spooky.', '2003-05-11 21:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(294992, 20258, 6325, '<td valign="top">The green is a good effect. Not so sure about the napkin - think showing more of the glass would have been better.</td>', 'The green is a good effect. Not so sure about the napkin - think showing more of the glass would have been better.', '2003-05-11 21:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(294994, 20556, 6325, '<td valign="top">The geometric pattern is interesting.</td>', 'The geometric pattern is interesting.', '2003-05-11 21:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(294998, 20780, 2158, '<td valign="top">I like the wine glass with the glasses in it, but feel you should have left the rest of the stuff out.  The picture if far too cluttered for my liking as it is.</td>', 'I like the wine glass with the glasses in it, but feel you should have left the rest of the stuff out.  The picture if far too cluttered for my liking as it is.', '2003-05-11 22:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(295007, 20752, 332, '<td valign="top">Like the tone of the picture. The contrast is good. Good job.</td>', 'Like the tone of the picture. The contrast is good. Good job.', '2003-05-11 22:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(295008, 20643, 332, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Great lighting. One of my favorites this week.', '2003-05-11 23:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(295009, 20585, 6938, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, Perhaps if you captured some of the background it would have completed the picture.</td>', 'Hmmm, Perhaps if you captured some of the background it would have completed the picture.', '2003-05-11 23:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(295011, 20300, 554, '<td valign="top">absolutely the best of the building photos</td>', 'absolutely the best of the building photos', '2003-05-11 23:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(295012, 20785, 772, '<td valign="top">a little more light and a little larger image would probably make this shot a lot stronger...</td>', 'a little more light and a little larger image would probably make this shot a lot stronger...', '2003-05-11 23:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(295013, 20701, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting light, but the focus seems to be very soft... not sure how that really enhances this image...</td>', 'interesting light, but the focus seems to be very soft... not sure how that really enhances this image...', '2003-05-11 23:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(295014, 20686, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo meets the challenge, but it''s fairly weak subjectively... nothing inspiring or interesting to look at in the photo...</td>', 'This photo meets the challenge, but it''s fairly weak subjectively... nothing inspiring or interesting to look at in the photo...', '2003-05-11 23:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(295015, 20685, 772, '<td valign="top">I don'' think this photo meets the challenge... if there is an element of ''glass'' present, it''s escaping me... the reflection is nice, but the challenge wasn''t reflections...</td>', 'I don'' think this photo meets the challenge... if there is an element of ''glass'' present, it''s escaping me... the reflection is nice, but the challenge wasn''t reflections...', '2003-05-11 23:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(295016, 20585, 554, '<td valign="top">love the colors....I would have shot this in portrait so the flame would not project out of frame. I also wonder what it was like with just a bit of surrounding detail visable.</td>', 'love the colors....I would have shot this in portrait so the flame would not project out of frame. I also wonder what it was like with just a bit of surrounding detail visable.', '2003-05-11 23:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(295019, 20567, 6504, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done..  Very professional looking.  I don\''t know how it could be better.<br/>10.  After you win the contest, will you kindly tell me what background and lighting you used?</td>', 'Beautifully done..  Very professional looking.  I don\''t know how it could be better.10.  After you win the contest, will you kindly tell me what background and lighting you used?', '2003-05-11 23:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(295021, 20608, 554, '<td valign="top">ankles are much too thin</td>', 'ankles are much too thin', '2003-05-11 23:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(295022, 20290, 554, '<td valign="top">background is slightly distracting by it being uneven or wrinkled.  Why not show more of the boat?</td>', 'background is slightly distracting by it being uneven or wrinkled.  Why not show more of the boat?', '2003-05-11 23:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(295023, 20846, 554, '<td valign="top">needs a little more focus and a little less light in some areas</td>', 'needs a little more focus and a little less light in some areas', '2003-05-11 23:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(295029, 20819, 4388, '<td valign="top">neat idea, i think it might be over-sharpened a bt because of the bright white specs along the glass edges. i somehow might try lighting from the sides, almost looks like a flash.</td>', 'neat idea, i think it might be over-sharpened a bt because of the bright white specs along the glass edges. i somehow might try lighting from the sides, almost looks like a flash.', '2003-05-11 23:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(295031, 20822, 4388, '<td valign="top">the main subject of this image doesn''t say glass to me. it seems more of color and candle light, although i like the image, i want it to say glass.</td>', 'the main subject of this image doesn''t say glass to me. it seems more of color and candle light, although i like the image, i want it to say glass.', '2003-05-11 23:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(295032, 20400, 6938, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the crop could have been wider on the left to accomodate both of the bases of the glasses.</td>', 'Perhaps the crop could have been wider on the left to accomodate both of the bases of the glasses.', '2003-05-11 23:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(295033, 20609, 4388, '<td valign="top">it doesn''t have the wow factor to me.</td>', 'it doesn''t have the wow factor to me.', '2003-05-11 23:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(295034, 20737, 4388, '<td valign="top">a little more dof would have made the glass realy look sharp from front to back both literally and figuratively. as it is the image doesn''t say much to me.</td>', 'a little more dof would have made the glass realy look sharp from front to back both literally and figuratively. as it is the image doesn''t say much to me.', '2003-05-12 00:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(295036, 20301, 4388, '<td valign="top">it looks a little off balance, and what''s the point, it doesn''t make a statement to me, it looks like an un-impressive trick to me with the window reflection in the glasses.  maybe some dramatic lighting would help.</td>', 'it looks a little off balance, and what''s the point, it doesn''t make a statement to me, it looks like an un-impressive trick to me with the window reflection in the glasses.  maybe some dramatic lighting would help.', '2003-05-12 00:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(295038, 20809, 4388, '<td valign="top">the reflections under the glass bowl are distracting and the grapes are nice but the glass could possibly use some lighting from the side insteadof the top to make it more dramatic and show the etchings better.</td>', 'the reflections under the glass bowl are distracting and the grapes are nice but the glass could possibly use some lighting from the side insteadof the top to make it more dramatic and show the etchings better.', '2003-05-12 00:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(295041, 20830, 4388, '<td valign="top">interesting concept but not really a wow image, although the more i look at it the more i like it, it gives something to think about.</td>', 'interesting concept but not really a wow image, although the more i look at it the more i like it, it gives something to think about.', '2003-05-12 00:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(295043, 20623, 1031, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even think of shooting a condenser!</td>', 'I didn''t even think of shooting a condenser!', '2003-05-12 00:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(295044, 20827, 3607, '<td valign="top">very neat and creative photo, although i''m not sure if the triple framing rotation thing really does anything for me.</td>', 'very neat and creative photo, although i''m not sure if the triple framing rotation thing really does anything for me.', '2003-05-12 00:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(295045, 20777, 4388, '<td valign="top">not very much effort in this shot and not very creative.</td>', 'not very much effort in this shot and not very creative.', '2003-05-12 00:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(295046, 20593, 3607, '<td valign="top">a little too close in for me - while the detail is good (ie: i can see the dust), i think the properties of the subject were lost with your choice of composition.</td>', 'a little too close in for me - while the detail is good (ie: i can see the dust), i think the properties of the subject were lost with your choice of composition.', '2003-05-12 00:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(295047, 20401, 4388, '<td valign="top">i don''t understand, why the angle? would look better if it was spilling. all this glass should be in sharp focus.</td>', 'i don''t understand, why the angle? would look better if it was spilling. all this glass should be in sharp focus.', '2003-05-12 00:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(295048, 20833, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice focus and shadows.  interesting choice of composition/cropping.  i don''t know if another angle/position/cropping would have been more powerful, but the setup is good and i''m not sure if you maximize its potential.</td>', 'nice focus and shadows.  interesting choice of composition/cropping.  i don''t know if another angle/position/cropping would have been more powerful, but the setup is good and i''m not sure if you maximize its potential.', '2003-05-12 00:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(295049, 20184, 4388, '<td valign="top">distracting reflections  around the tray and i would try different lighting for the red subject, maybe another surface and lighting from underneath or behind.</td>', 'distracting reflections  around the tray and i would try different lighting for the red subject, maybe another surface and lighting from underneath or behind.', '2003-05-12 00:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(295050, 20800, 3607, '<td valign="top">i think the photo would have been more powerful if the liquid in the elixer also glowed in the photo.  as it is i can see the details of the glass come out very sharply - where visible, but much of it isn''t visible.</td>', 'i think the photo would have been more powerful if the liquid in the elixer also glowed in the photo.  as it is i can see the details of the glass come out very sharply - where visible, but much of it isn''t visible.', '2003-05-12 00:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(295051, 20815, 4388, '<td valign="top">it doesn''t really look like glass to me.</td>', 'it doesn''t really look like glass to me.', '2003-05-12 00:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(295053, 20835, 3540, '<td valign="top">Given a little more exposure to the fish with additional lighting would''ve brought more of his vibrant colors out and really helped this photo.  Photos of fish are pretty tough to do though, especially in larger tanks where its much more difficult to manipulate a substantial amount of light in to the tank.</td>', 'Given a little more exposure to the fish with additional lighting would''ve brought more of his vibrant colors out and really helped this photo.  Photos of fish are pretty tough to do though, especially in larger tanks where its much more difficult to manipulate a substantial amount of light in to the tank.', '2003-05-12 00:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(295055, 20690, 3607, '<td valign="top">these are pretty cool subjects, and it like the setup.  the focus seems a little soft (look at their eyes) but clearly you have a nice result here.</td>', 'these are pretty cool subjects, and it like the setup.  the focus seems a little soft (look at their eyes) but clearly you have a nice result here.', '2003-05-12 00:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(295056, 20836, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is cute.  I like the tonal qualities of this pic but I think its a little overexposed.  The toad is adorable and very well posed.  Nice pic</td>', 'This is cute.  I like the tonal qualities of this pic but I think its a little overexposed.  The toad is adorable and very well posed.  Nice pic', '2003-05-12 00:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(295057, 20559, 3607, '<td valign="top">very fun shot - the water looks great, focused, crisp.  my only suggestion would to have maybe tried to take the shot w/out the drain visible (so people would think water and glasses, and not kitchen sink).</td>', 'very fun shot - the water looks great, focused, crisp.  my only suggestion would to have maybe tried to take the shot w/out the drain visible (so people would think water and glasses, and not kitchen sink).', '2003-05-12 00:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(295059, 20329, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good reflections in this one. I think a perspective from a tighter angle would''ve been preferred.  I think you might''ve been able to eliminate some of the distractions from this pic that way.</td>', 'Good reflections in this one. I think a perspective from a tighter angle would''ve been preferred.  I think you might''ve been able to eliminate some of the distractions from this pic that way.', '2003-05-12 00:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(295062, 20394, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice job capturing the flower through the glass.  i wish the black background on the left was as ''invisible'' as the right, but that''s just a small nit.</td>', 'nice job capturing the flower through the glass.  i wish the black background on the left was as ''invisible'' as the right, but that''s just a small nit.', '2003-05-12 00:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(295064, 20229, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good theme for a picture.  I don''t like that they aren''t in actual playing positions.  Good exposure and framing though.</td>', 'Good theme for a picture.  I don''t like that they aren''t in actual playing positions.  Good exposure and framing though.', '2003-05-12 00:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(295066, 20818, 3607, '<td valign="top">fun photo and fun title.  nice focus.  only suggestion:  see how the red bands come out at the top of the bottom right ice cube - if that could have been made to happen on the other cubes that would have been a very cool prism sort of effect.</td>', 'fun photo and fun title.  nice focus.  only suggestion:  see how the red bands come out at the top of the bottom right ice cube - if that could have been made to happen on the other cubes that would have been a very cool prism sort of effect.', '2003-05-12 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(295067, 20602, 3540, '<td valign="top">You should''ve centered or leveled this window, or both.  The color quality is not very good and I''d have cropped out anything having to do with the bricks, or incuded them all around the window</td>', 'You should''ve centered or leveled this window, or both.  The color quality is not very good and I''d have cropped out anything having to do with the bricks, or incuded them all around the window', '2003-05-12 00:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(295068, 20453, 3540, '<td valign="top">That looks like a stamping plate under the glasses. Very nice because it brings the wonderful coppery tones into this photo.  Good shot</td>', 'That looks like a stamping plate under the glasses. Very nice because it brings the wonderful coppery tones into this photo.  Good shot', '2003-05-12 00:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(295069, 20644, 3607, '<td valign="top">i think if you had played with your white balance the light would look more pure.  also, the shadows are a little soft, and i wonder if you needed to have the glass in the photo at all.</td>', 'i think if you had played with your white balance the light would look more pure.  also, the shadows are a little soft, and i wonder if you needed to have the glass in the photo at all.', '2003-05-12 00:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(295070, 20752, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice fisheye view refraction in this glass globe.  I wish the bubble weren''t there.  As great as they look reflecting like, they are distracting when bending images.  Overall its a pretty good concept and shot though.</td>', 'Nice fisheye view refraction in this glass globe.  I wish the bubble weren''t there.  As great as they look reflecting like, they are distracting when bending images.  Overall its a pretty good concept and shot though.', '2003-05-12 00:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(295071, 20783, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice colors and lighting.  i don''t think you needed so much (or at all) the railing, but its not too obtrusive.</td>', 'nice colors and lighting.  i don''t think you needed so much (or at all) the railing, but its not too obtrusive.', '2003-05-12 00:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(295073, 20679, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''d have flipped this one upside down (because I do those kinds of things) and submitted it.  Good reflection on a pretty interesting piece.</td>', 'I''d have flipped this one upside down (because I do those kinds of things) and submitted it.  Good reflection on a pretty interesting piece.', '2003-05-12 00:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(295074, 20460, 3607, '<td valign="top">very nice photo.  one thought would be seeing how having the negative space above the candles instead of below would look.</td>', 'very nice photo.  one thought would be seeing how having the negative space above the candles instead of below would look.', '2003-05-12 00:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(295075, 20746, 3540, '<td valign="top">Too burned out for my tastes, but really along the right lines for a successful pic.   I might have tried a few or 30 more takes of this with varying intensities of light and also other positions for the light.  But maybe you did....  And I didn''t think of it til just now.  Good luck</td>', 'Too burned out for my tastes, but really along the right lines for a successful pic.   I might have tried a few or 30 more takes of this with varying intensities of light and also other positions for the light.  But maybe you did....  And I didn''t think of it til just now.  Good luck', '2003-05-12 00:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(295076, 20718, 3607, '<td valign="top">a little dark.  the subject looks really interesting - i would have liked to see a bit more the details of the glasswork.</td>', 'a little dark.  the subject looks really interesting - i would have liked to see a bit more the details of the glasswork.', '2003-05-12 00:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(295077, 20215, 3607, '<td valign="top">lovely.  nice colors, lighting, perspective, composition, detail.  very nice.</td>', 'lovely.  nice colors, lighting, perspective, composition, detail.  very nice.', '2003-05-12 00:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(295080, 20796, 3607, '<td valign="top">i like the choice of lighting although it is a little dark, and the focus seems soft (like in the text on the labels).</td>', 'i like the choice of lighting although it is a little dark, and the focus seems soft (like in the text on the labels).', '2003-05-12 00:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(295081, 20320, 1031, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do this for Primary Colors (or Secondary or whatever) -- nice job.</td>', 'I wanted to do this for Primary Colors (or Secondary or whatever) -- nice job.', '2003-05-12 00:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(295083, 20777, 3607, '<td valign="top">ouch!  apparently so can photo challenges ;-)  nice focus and use of dof.  lighting is just okay.  i would have liked to have seen more blood (and boosted the saturation to make the red really sizzle.</td>', 'ouch!  apparently so can photo challenges ;-)  nice focus and use of dof.  lighting is just okay.  i would have liked to have seen more blood (and boosted the saturation to make the red really sizzle.', '2003-05-12 00:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(295085, 20276, 3607, '<td valign="top">a very beautiful object, and well executed photo (could have been entered into the symmetry challenge).  one suggestion is not to have cropped to closely on the side and left more negative space there.</td>', 'a very beautiful object, and well executed photo (could have been entered into the symmetry challenge).  one suggestion is not to have cropped to closely on the side and left more negative space there.', '2003-05-12 00:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(295086, 20552, 4388, '<td valign="top">it doesn''t look like blood, and what does the crest mean?</td>', 'it doesn''t look like blood, and what does the crest mean?', '2003-05-12 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(295087, 20812, 4388, '<td valign="top">the lighting is flat, need more light from behind to brighten it up.</td>', 'the lighting is flat, need more light from behind to brighten it up.', '2003-05-12 00:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(295088, 20248, 3607, '<td valign="top">the details and neat, esp. in negative, although the composition seems random and why did you take this on your lawn?  the grass and the rough texture at the top left just seem strange and distracting.</td>', 'the details and neat, esp. in negative, although the composition seems random and why did you take this on your lawn?  the grass and the rough texture at the top left just seem strange and distracting.', '2003-05-12 00:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(295090, 20196, 4388, '<td valign="top">looks like you have a blue light on an orange apple, i think i would like it bette without the blue light, maybe a white light or some other color.</td>', 'looks like you have a blue light on an orange apple, i think i would like it bette without the blue light, maybe a white light or some other color.', '2003-05-12 00:38:02.000000', NULL, 1);
