(295280, 20588, 3540, '<td valign="top">Brilliant lighting effects.  Maybe a little too brilliant at the bottom of this piece.  Nice effects from the refraction of the light as well.  Makes this a real sparkly looking photo.</td>', 'Brilliant lighting effects.  Maybe a little too brilliant at the bottom of this piece.  Nice effects from the refraction of the light as well.  Makes this a real sparkly looking photo.', '2003-05-12 05:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(295284, 20814, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great glass block shot.  Harboring some ill feelings?  They played their ass off though and came real close.  Hopefully they can pick up a veteran forward or two during the offseason.   My regrets.  Oh yea, good idea for this pic too eh.</td>', 'Great glass block shot.  Harboring some ill feelings?  They played their ass off though and came real close.  Hopefully they can pick up a veteran forward or two during the offseason.   My regrets.  Oh yea, good idea for this pic too eh.', '2003-05-12 05:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(295285, 20837, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great effect from this rather regular drinking glass by day.  Really good job finding out that this glass will create this pattern and also a great job capturing it.  -9</td>', 'Great effect from this rather regular drinking glass by day.  Really good job finding out that this glass will create this pattern and also a great job capturing it.  -9', '2003-05-12 05:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(295292, 20584, 3540, '<td valign="top">Odd how discontinuous the images are in adjacent panes.  I''d say you made a pretty good description of it in your title.  It looks like Picasso type stuff or Dali''s weird surrealism they way its just pieced together.</td>', 'Odd how discontinuous the images are in adjacent panes.  I''d say you made a pretty good description of it in your title.  It looks like Picasso type stuff or Dali''s weird surrealism they way its just pieced together.', '2003-05-12 05:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(295294, 20720, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good stop action shot.  I don''t know if this shot is grainy, or the background material is grainy looking but something here is slightly amiss.</td>', 'Good stop action shot.  I don''t know if this shot is grainy, or the background material is grainy looking but something here is slightly amiss.', '2003-05-12 05:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(295296, 20675, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the way this was framed.   I never would''ve thought to put the light that high up in the frame, but I guess I don''t have a car that I could do that with either.  Good shot.  Black and white was also a sound choice</td>', 'I like the way this was framed.   I never would''ve thought to put the light that high up in the frame, but I guess I don''t have a car that I could do that with either.  Good shot.  Black and white was also a sound choice', '2003-05-12 05:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
