(295298, 20585, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool picture, and very interesting.  I can''t say I''ve ever seen glass welding.  I''ve seen my share of welding too :=)   Good colors in the frame and excellent use of negative space here.  Very well done</td>', 'This is a pretty cool picture, and very interesting.  I can''t say I''ve ever seen glass welding.  I''ve seen my share of welding too :=)   Good colors in the frame and excellent use of negative space here.  Very well done', '2003-05-12 05:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
