(295303, 20397, 3540, '<td valign="top">Fantastic perspective shot.  This is really great.  I think this will be in the top 5 if not the top 3.  Very well done.  I like the illusion that this is laying down vs. being the front of a building (or the side i suppose).  Great concept and great shot. - 10</td>', 'Fantastic perspective shot.  This is really great.  I think this will be in the top 5 if not the top 3.  Very well done.  I like the illusion that this is laying down vs. being the front of a building (or the side i suppose).  Great concept and great shot. - 10', '2003-05-12 05:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(295305, 20733, 3540, '<td valign="top">Well done on the perspective illusion, making something horizontal look vertical.  This is a very well done concept.  The sky made it work out perfectly for you too.  Great job -9</td>', 'Well done on the perspective illusion, making something horizontal look vertical.  This is a very well done concept.  The sky made it work out perfectly for you too.  Great job -9', '2003-05-12 05:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
