(295470, 20460, 6325, '<td valign="top">Colors are good. I like the soft glow in the glass. The composition has too much extra stuff going on - a tighter shot would have showed off the glass better in my opinion.</td>', 'Colors are good. I like the soft glow in the glass. The composition has too much extra stuff going on - a tighter shot would have showed off the glass better in my opinion.', '2003-05-12 10:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(295627, 20828, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and colours of this shot a lot.<br/>The shape of the sun at the top of the shadow is wonderful.<br/>Main problems in the image for me: <br/>The liquid is not horizontal within the glass.<br/>The surface that the glass is on is kind of distracting - would it work to have a seamless curved white backdrop on which both the glass and it''s shadow could be positioned?<br/>Would like the negative space around the glass and shadow to be more even at top, bottom, left and right.<br/>I''m also seeing some jagged areas - particulary around the stem of the glass.<br/>Again, I do like the colour and lighting here very much but think that some minor changes would improve it further.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I like the idea and colours of this shot a lot.The shape of the sun at the top of the shadow is wonderful.Main problems in the image for me: The liquid is not horizontal within the glass.The surface that the glass is on is kind of distracting - would it work to have a seamless curved white backdrop on which both the glass and it''s shadow could be positioned?Would like the negative space around the glass and shadow to be more even at top, bottom, left and right.I''m also seeing some jagged areas - particulary around the stem of the glass.Again, I do like the colour and lighting here very much but think that some minor changes would improve it further.5, Kavey', '2003-05-12 13:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
