(295961, 20740, 8666, '<td valign="top">Good composition, very "clean"</td>', 'Good composition, very "clean"', '2003-05-12 18:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(295963, 20723, 6155, '<td valign="top">lovely cloud reflection</td>', 'lovely cloud reflection', '2003-05-12 18:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(295974, 20643, 3087, '<td valign="top">This image really has great ambience - the "night" reference in the title is very appropriate. It has a menacing, silent quality.<br/>I like the lighting and the composition too. <br/>Not sure about the border.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'This image really has great ambience - the "night" reference in the title is very appropriate. It has a menacing, silent quality.I like the lighting and the composition too. Not sure about the border.7, Kavey', '2003-05-12 18:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(295982, 20587, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely image - fantastic high contrast and I really like the shapes of the moulded glass. I don''t know that the choice of crop works for me - I want to see more or less of the left hand bottle, but I like the crop/ position of the right hand one a lot.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Lovely image - fantastic high contrast and I really like the shapes of the moulded glass. I don''t know that the choice of crop works for me - I want to see more or less of the left hand bottle, but I like the crop/ position of the right hand one a lot.8, Kavey', '2003-05-12 18:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(295991, 20251, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is superb - it\''s like my husband\''s entry to Technology but better! (LOL, sorry Pete!)<br/>I absolutely love how you\''ve got the brightness of the filament, all the smaller details AND the pale outline of the bulb itself.<br/>Amazing!<br/>9, Kavey<br/>(8 for how much I like this plus an extra 1 point for sheer skill of capture)</td>', 'This is superb - it\''s like my husband\''s entry to Technology but better! (LOL, sorry Pete!)I absolutely love how you\''ve got the brightness of the filament, all the smaller details AND the pale outline of the bulb itself.Amazing!9, Kavey(8 for how much I like this plus an extra 1 point for sheer skill of capture)', '2003-05-12 18:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(295992, 20798, 6155, '<td valign="top">too bad only the middle one is in focus</td>', 'too bad only the middle one is in focus', '2003-05-12 18:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(295996, 20737, 3087, '<td valign="top">An image I like very much - VERY atmospheric - moody, dramatic and tells a story - but only a small part of it - great perspective and DOF. I like the stark location though the taller building at back left bothers me - I don''t think the image works with it cropped either because you;d lose the wonderful big shard in the foreground. Would rotating your position a few inches to exclude it have worked or was there something else in the background out of shot at the right?<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'An image I like very much - VERY atmospheric - moody, dramatic and tells a story - but only a small part of it - great perspective and DOF. I like the stark location though the taller building at back left bothers me - I don''t think the image works with it cropped either because you;d lose the wonderful big shard in the foreground. Would rotating your position a few inches to exclude it have worked or was there something else in the background out of shot at the right?8, Kavey', '2003-05-12 18:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(296000, 20816, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Simple geometric curves and intersectiond with a wonderful use of reflections. Really shows the glass off beautifully.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Lovely! Simple geometric curves and intersectiond with a wonderful use of reflections. Really shows the glass off beautifully.8, Kavey', '2003-05-12 18:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(296001, 20458, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured and the abstract shapes of the liquid are wonderful - but overall composition of the image isn''t as striking as the content, for me.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Beautifully captured and the abstract shapes of the liquid are wonderful - but overall composition of the image isn''t as striking as the content, for me.7, Kavey', '2003-05-12 18:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(296004, 20810, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way that a scene is captured in the interior bubble of the float and I also really like the blurred effect of the glass behind it next to the sharp clean lines of the float glass. Could do with a little more light on the metal tag but otherwise excellent.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'I like the way that a scene is captured in the interior bubble of the float and I also really like the blurred effect of the glass behind it next to the sharp clean lines of the float glass. Could do with a little more light on the metal tag but otherwise excellent.8, Kavey', '2003-05-12 18:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(296007, 20087, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this - the two spheres infront of a larger circle, and surrounded by that wonderful crackled texture.<br/>Nicely lit - adds mystery to it.<br/>Border doesn''t add anything at all IMHO.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'I love the composition of this - the two spheres infront of a larger circle, and surrounded by that wonderful crackled texture.Nicely lit - adds mystery to it.Border doesn''t add anything at all IMHO.8, Kavey', '2003-05-12 18:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(296031, 20847, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the background and lighting of this shot.  It is technically strong in all regards - focus, exposure, composition even.  I love it.</td>', 'I love the background and lighting of this shot.  It is technically strong in all regards - focus, exposure, composition even.  I love it.', '2003-05-12 19:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(296034, 20212, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think the border is a bit much - the blue line is ok but the black is simply too big.</td>', 'I think the border is a bit much - the blue line is ok but the black is simply too big.', '2003-05-12 19:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(296035, 20727, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of sitting the apple on a wet mirror...  It gives the fruit a fresh look.  I don''t like the green line in the border - at first it looks like a JPG artefact almost and I don''t think it adds anything to the shot.  Other than that it''s a very good shot.</td>', 'I like the idea of sitting the apple on a wet mirror...  It gives the fruit a fresh look.  I don''t like the green line in the border - at first it looks like a JPG artefact almost and I don''t think it adds anything to the shot.  Other than that it''s a very good shot.', '2003-05-12 19:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(296037, 20729, 1647, '<td valign="top">Too dark for my liking - I appreciate the idea and think a dark shot could work well but not quite this dark.</td>', 'Too dark for my liking - I appreciate the idea and think a dark shot could work well but not quite this dark.', '2003-05-12 19:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(296039, 20725, 1647, '<td valign="top">The reflection hints at on-camera flash being used.  Glass is very difficult to light well.  Perhaps try this shot again with different lighting.  You probably need a difused light source - perhaps a window with lace netting on it, or even a very bright light shining through an opaque plastic bag.</td>', 'The reflection hints at on-camera flash being used.  Glass is very difficult to light well.  Perhaps try this shot again with different lighting.  You probably need a difused light source - perhaps a window with lace netting on it, or even a very bright light shining through an opaque plastic bag.', '2003-05-12 19:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(296042, 20652, 1647, '<td valign="top">Those pyramids look really interesting - I want to know what is under them.  You could possibly have used a filter to remove some reflections but I''m not sure if the overall result would be better or worse.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Those pyramids look really interesting - I want to know what is under them.  You could possibly have used a filter to remove some reflections but I''m not sure if the overall result would be better or worse.  Nice composition.', '2003-05-12 19:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(296044, 20733, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice angles and a very interesting crop / composition.</td>', 'Nice angles and a very interesting crop / composition.', '2003-05-12 19:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(296053, 20831, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great work - this will rank very highly this week.  It''s on-topic, is crisp, has lovely colour and even includes glass!  Well done on a lovely shot.</td>', 'Great work - this will rank very highly this week.  It''s on-topic, is crisp, has lovely colour and even includes glass!  Well done on a lovely shot.', '2003-05-12 19:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(296056, 20568, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great work - the angle of this shot is stunning and the sky background is so refreshing.  Lovely detail / sharpness and the shallow depth of field gives a sense of distance between the two teams - well done.</td>', 'Great work - the angle of this shot is stunning and the sky background is so refreshing.  Lovely detail / sharpness and the shallow depth of field gives a sense of distance between the two teams - well done.', '2003-05-12 19:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(296058, 20768, 1647, '<td valign="top">The graininess of this shot implies a lack of available light I suspect.  Lighting glass well without reflection of the lightsource is very difficult.  Also I think the border is too close to the top of the vase.</td>', 'The graininess of this shot implies a lack of available light I suspect.  Lighting glass well without reflection of the lightsource is very difficult.  Also I think the border is too close to the top of the vase.', '2003-05-12 19:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(296061, 20355, 7711, '<td valign="top">marvelous, too bad the focus isn''t a shade crisper!</td>', 'marvelous, too bad the focus isn''t a shade crisper!', '2003-05-12 19:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(296064, 20639, 7711, '<td valign="top">tiny rotation to the right, and just a little closer, and you''d really have it! :)</td>', 'tiny rotation to the right, and just a little closer, and you''d really have it! :)', '2003-05-12 19:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(296066, 20142, 7711, '<td valign="top">its a bit too dark, without enough contrast between the object and the background to make it really stand out.</td>', 'its a bit too dark, without enough contrast between the object and the background to make it really stand out.', '2003-05-12 19:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(296069, 20400, 7711, '<td valign="top">its grainy, which isn''t always a bad thing, but I don''t think the retention of the grain adds anything significant to the picture.</td>', 'its grainy, which isn''t always a bad thing, but I don''t think the retention of the grain adds anything significant to the picture.', '2003-05-12 19:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(296070, 20837, 7711, '<td valign="top">..disco light by night? ;) Very very cool effect. I like the contrast of the green glass against the foreground and the glasses light rays.</td>', '..disco light by night? ;) Very very cool effect. I like the contrast of the green glass against the foreground and the glasses light rays.', '2003-05-12 20:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(296071, 20846, 7711, '<td valign="top">I like the high key portions of this picture. You wouldn''t expect such a thing with the dark lines and shadows here, but the two elements work well together.</td>', 'I like the high key portions of this picture. You wouldn''t expect such a thing with the dark lines and shadows here, but the two elements work well together.', '2003-05-12 20:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(296072, 20374, 7711, '<td valign="top">neat idea, but it seems to need a bit more light to really pull it off. There is no sparkle to your crystal.</td>', 'neat idea, but it seems to need a bit more light to really pull it off. There is no sparkle to your crystal.', '2003-05-12 20:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(296073, 20773, 2158, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this on a plain coloured background.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this on a plain coloured background.', '2003-05-12 20:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
