(296259, 20829, 6938, '<td valign="top">Very Cleaver, Very intreaguing.......    How?<br/>(a bit of the furthest lip does show past the side of the nearer vases close to the top o the right side)</td>', 'Very Cleaver, Very intreaguing.......    How?(a bit of the furthest lip does show past the side of the nearer vases close to the top o the right side)', '2003-05-13 00:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(296263, 20782, 6938, '<td valign="top">Pity the glass wasn''t clean...... I think a balance of how much rimm and base would have made a great improvement (we see a nice bit of curve of the rim, but the base is cut and very incomplete)<br/>(no need to clutter a good title with the "nudge""nudge")</td>', 'Pity the glass wasn''t clean...... I think a balance of how much rimm and base would have made a great improvement (we see a nice bit of curve of the rim, but the base is cut and very incomplete)(no need to clutter a good title with the "nudge""nudge")', '2003-05-13 00:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(296265, 20441, 6938, '<td valign="top">A softer more ambiant light should have been used to show the detail of the bowl without so much flare.  If the shaddow and light refraction is the main subject....  perhaps the bowl could have been almost removed from the shot? (ie: shoot over it making sure it had no focus?)</td>', 'A softer more ambiant light should have been used to show the detail of the bowl without so much flare.  If the shaddow and light refraction is the main subject....  perhaps the bowl could have been almost removed from the shot? (ie: shoot over it making sure it had no focus?)', '2003-05-13 00:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(296267, 20248, 6938, '<td valign="top">A bit too messy for me....  and there seems to be a strange purple arc accooss the dish.</td>', 'A bit too messy for me....  and there seems to be a strange purple arc accooss the dish.', '2003-05-13 00:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
