(296273, 20630, 6325, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and the flow in the image.</td>', 'I really like the colors and the flow in the image.', '2003-05-13 00:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(296276, 20433, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very soothing blues.</td>', 'Very soothing blues.', '2003-05-13 00:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(296281, 20593, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good shading in the shade. I like the abstract design.</td>', 'Good shading in the shade. I like the abstract design.', '2003-05-13 01:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(296283, 20407, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very mesmerizing.</td>', 'Very mesmerizing.', '2003-05-13 01:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(296285, 20460, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nicely shot!  I love the soft glow the glass imparts to the light.  The out of focus object to the left is a bit too distracting, in my opinion.</td>', 'Very nicely shot!  I love the soft glow the glass imparts to the light.  The out of focus object to the left is a bit too distracting, in my opinion.', '2003-05-13 01:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(296286, 20674, 6325, '<td valign="top">This is a nice piece. The background makes it hard to see the pitcher. A white background would have been a good choice. I use poster board.</td>', 'This is a nice piece. The background makes it hard to see the pitcher. A white background would have been a good choice. I use poster board.', '2003-05-13 01:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(296288, 20635, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject.  I especially like the effect the grapes in the glass impart to the shot.  Also, I find the border a bit distracting, but overall, quite nicely done!</td>', 'Very interesting subject.  I especially like the effect the grapes in the glass impart to the shot.  Also, I find the border a bit distracting, but overall, quite nicely done!', '2003-05-13 01:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(296289, 20458, 6325, '<td valign="top">Did you get it on the first shot?</td>', 'Did you get it on the first shot?', '2003-05-13 01:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(296291, 20839, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful subject!  In my opinion, however, the centered composition seems to force my eyes to the center of the frame rather than moving them around the shot... perhaps a rule of thirds composition would work better?</td>', 'Very beautiful subject!  In my opinion, however, the centered composition seems to force my eyes to the center of the frame rather than moving them around the shot... perhaps a rule of thirds composition would work better?', '2003-05-13 01:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(296294, 20793, 6325, '<td valign="top">Vases are positioned well. I assume the background was intended to be white. Looks like you could set the white balance for the lighting or use the post processing to make it white ( in levels). I downloaded this and set the background to white. It really stands out.</td>', 'Vases are positioned well. I assume the background was intended to be white. Looks like you could set the white balance for the lighting or use the post processing to make it white ( in levels). I downloaded this and set the background to white. It really stands out.', '2003-05-13 01:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(296298, 20825, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful photograph. I do not see the connection to the challenge.</td>', 'Very beautiful photograph. I do not see the connection to the challenge.', '2003-05-13 01:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(296299, 20787, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well lighted. Good composition.</td>', 'Well lighted. Good composition.', '2003-05-13 01:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(296302, 20233, 6325, '<td valign="top">Interesting collection. Would have been more dramatic if the whites were white.</td>', 'Interesting collection. Would have been more dramatic if the whites were white.', '2003-05-13 01:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(296304, 20829, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Sharper focus would have enhanced the glass.</td>', 'Nice composition. Sharper focus would have enhanced the glass.', '2003-05-13 01:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(296305, 20715, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very good tones. Simple, strong composition.</td>', 'Very good tones. Simple, strong composition.', '2003-05-13 01:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(296306, 20681, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice glasses. I think the background choice robbed the colors in the glass.</td>', 'Nice glasses. I think the background choice robbed the colors in the glass.', '2003-05-13 02:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(296312, 20825, 1143, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit too dark. Too bad this is a glass challenge instead of a portrait challenge. It really is a nice shot.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit too dark. Too bad this is a glass challenge instead of a portrait challenge. It really is a nice shot.', '2003-05-13 02:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(296320, 20774, 7175, '<td valign="top">nice photo.. dont care for the borders though...</td>', 'nice photo.. dont care for the borders though...', '2003-05-13 03:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(296329, 20223, 5728, '<td valign="top">Vivid colors here. What a good choice for the glass challenge, the detail is very good.</td>', 'Vivid colors here. What a good choice for the glass challenge, the detail is very good.', '2003-05-13 04:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(296330, 20684, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah Lord of the Rings!!! That''s an extra point just for the choice of book you used :-)) I like your set up and the effect through the glasses works very well.</td>', 'Ah Lord of the Rings!!! That''s an extra point just for the choice of book you used :-)) I like your set up and the effect through the glasses works very well.', '2003-05-13 04:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(296331, 20576, 5728, '<td valign="top">The sunlight in the glass marbles comes over well without giving your image that blown out effect.</td>', 'The sunlight in the glass marbles comes over well without giving your image that blown out effect.', '2003-05-13 04:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(296332, 20734, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is interesting, and certainly original! Is it a door hanger? Good idea and well shot.</td>', 'Now this is interesting, and certainly original! Is it a door hanger? Good idea and well shot.', '2003-05-13 04:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(296333, 20763, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice capture! How many glasses did you have to break to get a decent shot? I wanted to do something like this too but my wife wouldn''t let me near the glass cabinet :-) Your image is good, the black and white works well. I would have chosen a different angle on the shot without the power lines in the background.</td>', 'Choice capture! How many glasses did you have to break to get a decent shot? I wanted to do something like this too but my wife wouldn''t let me near the glass cabinet :-) Your image is good, the black and white works well. I would have chosen a different angle on the shot without the power lines in the background.', '2003-05-13 04:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(296334, 20556, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective! The blue tones of the building and the blue sky work well together.</td>', 'Excellent perspective! The blue tones of the building and the blue sky work well together.', '2003-05-13 04:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(296335, 20163, 5728, '<td valign="top">The slightly warped reflection in the mirror creates an interesting effect. Good set up!</td>', 'The slightly warped reflection in the mirror creates an interesting effect. Good set up!', '2003-05-13 04:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(296337, 20510, 5728, '<td valign="top">Two things I might have changed in this image. Firstly I would have deepened the DOF a little more to get all the marbles in focus but still blurring out the background. And secondly, I would have tried a different angle or set up so as not to get the reflections of the buildings in the glass. The idea is very good.</td>', 'Two things I might have changed in this image. Firstly I would have deepened the DOF a little more to get all the marbles in focus but still blurring out the background. And secondly, I would have tried a different angle or set up so as not to get the reflections of the buildings in the glass. The idea is very good.', '2003-05-13 04:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(296338, 20663, 5728, '<td valign="top">I thought I might see more images with etchings but there aren''t many at all. The red works in well here, good job.</td>', 'I thought I might see more images with etchings but there aren''t many at all. The red works in well here, good job.', '2003-05-13 05:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(296339, 20740, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, so clear and detailed. The set up and composition only adds to it, good one!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, so clear and detailed. The set up and composition only adds to it, good one!', '2003-05-13 05:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(296340, 20171, 5728, '<td valign="top">Definitely original! Good luck for the challenge, I''ll be looking back for this one.</td>', 'Definitely original! Good luck for the challenge, I''ll be looking back for this one.', '2003-05-13 05:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(296341, 20819, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well pulled off. The red is so vivid, the broken glass gives your image a lot of impact.</td>', 'Good idea and well pulled off. The red is so vivid, the broken glass gives your image a lot of impact.', '2003-05-13 05:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(296346, 20177, 5728, '<td valign="top">I think we both own the same kind of crystal ball, mine also looks like this one :-) Or is it a marble which looks like a crystal ball? Anyway, I like this, especially the indentation at the base of the ball. Cool effect.</td>', 'I think we both own the same kind of crystal ball, mine also looks like this one :-) Or is it a marble which looks like a crystal ball? Anyway, I like this, especially the indentation at the base of the ball. Cool effect.', '2003-05-13 05:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(296347, 20308, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good, an original idea carried out very well. The graininess works in this image. Only the two white dots on the black background should''t be there.</td>', 'This is good, an original idea carried out very well. The graininess works in this image. Only the two white dots on the black background should''t be there.', '2003-05-13 05:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(296349, 20290, 5728, '<td valign="top">What I like about this is the clearness of the see through glass contrasted with the frostiness of the glass in the sails. Also, cropping out half of the boat instead of taking a shot of the whole thing gives your image much more impact.</td>', 'What I like about this is the clearness of the see through glass contrasted with the frostiness of the glass in the sails. Also, cropping out half of the boat instead of taking a shot of the whole thing gives your image much more impact.', '2003-05-13 05:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(296351, 20738, 5728, '<td valign="top">Although the glass isn''t the main subject in your image and my eyes first went from flowers to coffee to magazine to glasses, the effect is outstanding. You''ve come up with a very good idea and pulled it off well. My only gripe would be the creases in the table cloth at the top of the image.</td>', 'Although the glass isn''t the main subject in your image and my eyes first went from flowers to coffee to magazine to glasses, the effect is outstanding. You''ve come up with a very good idea and pulled it off well. My only gripe would be the creases in the table cloth at the top of the image.', '2003-05-13 05:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(296352, 20568, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting perspective. You''ve even managed to catch some refraction of the sky in those front chess pieces, well done. This would have also been nice to see with everything fully in focus, but this works too.</td>', 'This is an interesting perspective. You''ve even managed to catch some refraction of the sky in those front chess pieces, well done. This would have also been nice to see with everything fully in focus, but this works too.', '2003-05-13 05:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(296353, 20559, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is very funny, and most probably the most original image of the challenge. Everything is fully in focus, the detail is awesome, you have frozen the water, top work!</td>', 'This is very funny, and most probably the most original image of the challenge. Everything is fully in focus, the detail is awesome, you have frozen the water, top work!', '2003-05-13 05:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(296354, 20397, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fantastic perspective. What really works for me is the gradient-like effect in the sky starting from deep blue in the left to white in the right.</td>', 'Fantastic perspective. What really works for me is the gradient-like effect in the sky starting from deep blue in the left to white in the right.', '2003-05-13 06:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(296355, 20780, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very original and well set up. The detail on the glass and the effect of the air bubbles on the glasses is choice!</td>', 'Very original and well set up. The detail on the glass and the effect of the air bubbles on the glasses is choice!', '2003-05-13 06:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(296356, 20758, 5728, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of science fiction movies somehow, don''t ask me why! The deep blue and shadows work well together, good job.<br/> <br/>I remember now it reminds me of "Hollowman" :-)</td>', 'This reminds me of science fiction movies somehow, don''t ask me why! The deep blue and shadows work well together, good job. I remember now it reminds me of "Hollowman" :-)', '2003-05-13 06:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(296357, 20651, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good depiction of the glass challenge. The reds come through well. The red border clashes a little however, especially in the lower left hand corner.</td>', 'Good depiction of the glass challenge. The reds come through well. The red border clashes a little however, especially in the lower left hand corner.', '2003-05-13 06:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(296360, 20522, 5728, '<td valign="top">What an amazing building, never seen anything like that before! And of course and ideal submission for the glass challenge, good job! The perspective you chose is very fitting. Imagine the effect had the sky been crispy blue!</td>', 'What an amazing building, never seen anything like that before! And of course and ideal submission for the glass challenge, good job! The perspective you chose is very fitting. Imagine the effect had the sky been crispy blue!', '2003-05-13 06:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(296361, 20843, 5728, '<td valign="top">The orange glass on the black background creates an amazing effect, especially with the right side of the glass blending off into shadow.</td>', 'The orange glass on the black background creates an amazing effect, especially with the right side of the glass blending off into shadow.', '2003-05-13 06:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(296362, 20691, 5728, '<td valign="top">This looks good! The textures come out very well in B&amp;W, and the very slight sepia toning was a good decision.</td>', 'This looks good! The textures come out very well in B&W, and the very slight sepia toning was a good decision.', '2003-05-13 06:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(296363, 20818, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Those blue tones and the glass work so well together, and the ice is the icing on the cake. You''ve come up with a good image here, be proud of yourself!</td>', 'Beautiful! Those blue tones and the glass work so well together, and the ice is the icing on the cake. You''ve come up with a good image here, be proud of yourself!', '2003-05-13 06:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(296365, 20633, 5728, '<td valign="top">This image is amazing with all its contrasts! The blues and whites, the sun and shadows, the reflections, it all fits. This is very good work. Some people just live in lucky places right?</td>', 'This image is amazing with all its contrasts! The blues and whites, the sun and shadows, the reflections, it all fits. This is very good work. Some people just live in lucky places right?', '2003-05-13 07:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(296367, 20463, 5728, '<td valign="top">What a perfect capture! This is absolutely amazing the effect and the impact, just wow! I keep coming back to look at this. How many glasses did you kill trying this?</td>', 'What a perfect capture! This is absolutely amazing the effect and the impact, just wow! I keep coming back to look at this. How many glasses did you kill trying this?', '2003-05-13 07:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(296368, 20759, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, I like it. The air bubbles do a lot for this image - 8.</td>', 'Wonderful photo, I like it. The air bubbles do a lot for this image - 8.', '2003-05-13 07:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(296369, 20183, 3087, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea but the emphasis seems to be more on the liquids than on the glasses containing them - the glasses themselves almost disappear into the background.</td>', 'An interesting idea but the emphasis seems to be more on the liquids than on the glasses containing them - the glasses themselves almost disappear into the background.', '2003-05-13 07:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(296370, 20510, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and light reflections in the glass. I think this shot could benefit from a little application of the rule of thirds - either a horizontal third given to the black background and 2 thirds to the glass or the other way around. I''d suggest the former which gives more prominence to the glass.</td>', 'I like the colours and light reflections in the glass. I think this shot could benefit from a little application of the rule of thirds - either a horizontal third given to the black background and 2 thirds to the glass or the other way around. I''d suggest the former which gives more prominence to the glass.', '2003-05-13 07:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(296372, 20251, 5728, '<td valign="top">What I like a lot about this pic is that the light is on but everything around it is in shadow. This is an amazing effect and tha''s why this is one of my favourite pics this week.</td>', 'What I like a lot about this pic is that the light is on but everything around it is in shadow. This is an amazing effect and tha''s why this is one of my favourite pics this week.', '2003-05-13 07:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(296374, 20646, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m in two minds about this - on one hand there is the fact that it''s such a close copy of a recent entry in a recent challenge - which means the creativity isn''t your own - on the other hand I do appreciate that one great way to learn more to to try and emulate the work that one admires. The jury is still somewhat out for me - on balance I think it''s great to imitate in order to learn but not so great to then enter the imitation into a challenge as one''s own work.<br/>About the image: I like the colour of the red liquid - it has a nice tone to it. My biggest criticism is the choice of glass - I think this kind of shot works best with a plain glass which really plays on the abstract geometric nature of the shapes created - in this case, the dimples and patterns in the cut glass detract from that geometry.</td>', 'I''m in two minds about this - on one hand there is the fact that it''s such a close copy of a recent entry in a recent challenge - which means the creativity isn''t your own - on the other hand I do appreciate that one great way to learn more to to try and emulate the work that one admires. The jury is still somewhat out for me - on balance I think it''s great to imitate in order to learn but not so great to then enter the imitation into a challenge as one''s own work.About the image: I like the colour of the red liquid - it has a nice tone to it. My biggest criticism is the choice of glass - I think this kind of shot works best with a plain glass which really plays on the abstract geometric nature of the shapes created - in this case, the dimples and patterns in the cut glass detract from that geometry.', '2003-05-13 07:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(296375, 20586, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful! I love the textures and colors. The play of light and shadow is amazing, you can really be proud of yourself with this shot - Gary.<br/> <br/>PS: I got completely wasted on Sljivovica once, once and never again :-)</td>', 'This is wonderful! I love the textures and colors. The play of light and shadow is amazing, you can really be proud of yourself with this shot - Gary. PS: I got completely wasted on Sljivovica once, once and never again :-)', '2003-05-13 07:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(296376, 20723, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture, this is a top image. Congratulations and good luck.</td>', 'Fantastic capture, this is a top image. Congratulations and good luck.', '2003-05-13 07:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(296377, 20459, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition in this image. It''s incredibly simple yet very elegant. For me the weakness is that the object that I''m assuming is made of glass doesn''t really say glass to me - the qualities of the glass itself aren''t really explored or evident.<br/>Lighting is a little low for my tastes but I appreciate that''s perhaps a deliberate decision to strike a certain mood.</td>', 'I really like the composition in this image. It''s incredibly simple yet very elegant. For me the weakness is that the object that I''m assuming is made of glass doesn''t really say glass to me - the qualities of the glass itself aren''t really explored or evident.Lighting is a little low for my tastes but I appreciate that''s perhaps a deliberate decision to strike a certain mood.', '2003-05-13 07:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(296378, 20689, 5728, '<td valign="top">You''ve come up with a good idea for your submission and you''ve set it up and executed it very well. I particularly like the lighting set up, nice and bright but no blow outs anywhere.</td>', 'You''ve come up with a good idea for your submission and you''ve set it up and executed it very well. I particularly like the lighting set up, nice and bright but no blow outs anywhere.', '2003-05-13 07:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(296380, 20548, 5728, '<td valign="top">I love the old-fashioned feel to your pic. The bottle is a little battered and gives the impression it has been around a lot, and this adds to the charachter of your photo. Nice work!</td>', 'I love the old-fashioned feel to your pic. The bottle is a little battered and gives the impression it has been around a lot, and this adds to the charachter of your photo. Nice work!', '2003-05-13 07:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(296381, 20829, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a fascinating image and were it sharper would be a 7 or 8 for me. In this case I think the central composition works well - the colours are great and the border is well chosen.</td>', 'This is a fascinating image and were it sharper would be a 7 or 8 for me. In this case I think the central composition works well - the colours are great and the border is well chosen.', '2003-05-13 07:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(296382, 20592, 5728, '<td valign="top">You can''t go wrong with Jack Daniel''s :-) Everything works here, the glass, the water and most of all the lighting. An excellent idea and well pulled off.</td>', 'You can''t go wrong with Jack Daniel''s :-) Everything works here, the glass, the water and most of all the lighting. An excellent idea and well pulled off.', '2003-05-13 07:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(296384, 20842, 5728, '<td valign="top">The composition, lighting, in fact the whole set up looks very professional. You can be proud of this it is an excellent submission.</td>', 'The composition, lighting, in fact the whole set up looks very professional. You can be proud of this it is an excellent submission.', '2003-05-13 07:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(296385, 20678, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is original. I hope you didn''t get into trouble for breaking that mirror. Decent effect you''ve created, I wish you a lot of luck with this pic!</td>', 'Now this is original. I hope you didn''t get into trouble for breaking that mirror. Decent effect you''ve created, I wish you a lot of luck with this pic!', '2003-05-13 07:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(296387, 20675, 5728, '<td valign="top">This photo gives me an old-fashioned impression. You''ve come up with a good idea here. The shiny chrome adds a lot of impact to your pic.</td>', 'This photo gives me an old-fashioned impression. You''ve come up with a good idea here. The shiny chrome adds a lot of impact to your pic.', '2003-05-13 07:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(296388, 20541, 5728, '<td valign="top">Amazing texture in your glass. This is a good example of a very simple photo with double impact, this is worth a good score anyone who looks at it.</td>', 'Amazing texture in your glass. This is a good example of a very simple photo with double impact, this is worth a good score anyone who looks at it.', '2003-05-13 07:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(296389, 20320, 5728, '<td valign="top">You got it! I wanted to do a prism but do you think I could find one anywhere? Where do you buy those things? And look at those colors! Primary colors! You could have put this one in that challenge too. Good luck in this challenge anyway, this is good.</td>', 'You got it! I wanted to do a prism but do you think I could find one anywhere? Where do you buy those things? And look at those colors! Primary colors! You could have put this one in that challenge too. Good luck in this challenge anyway, this is good.', '2003-05-13 07:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(296390, 20242, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is very simple but very effective - 8.</td>', 'This is very simple but very effective - 8.', '2003-05-13 07:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(296392, 20850, 5728, '<td valign="top">Vivid and detailed, good use of negative space - 8.</td>', 'Vivid and detailed, good use of negative space - 8.', '2003-05-13 07:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(296393, 20642, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful vase. The lighting works well in this image - 8.</td>', 'Beautiful vase. The lighting works well in this image - 8.', '2003-05-13 07:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(296394, 20433, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is so original and creative, the light pen effect gives your pic impact!</td>', 'This is so original and creative, the light pen effect gives your pic impact!', '2003-05-13 07:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(296395, 20783, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice shot! Also a good image for the primary color challenge - 8.</td>', 'Choice shot! Also a good image for the primary color challenge - 8.', '2003-05-13 07:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(296398, 20276, 5333, '<td valign="top">Great effect you''ve got the vase!! Not so crazy bout the cropping though.  :) 7</td>', 'Great effect you''ve got the vase!! Not so crazy bout the cropping though.  :) 7', '2003-05-13 08:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(296399, 20438, 5728, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the green tones this would be a pure black and white photo. I particularly like the detail you''ve brought out in your image. That together with the awesome glass textures make this for a professional looking pic.</td>', 'If it weren''t for the green tones this would be a pure black and white photo. I particularly like the detail you''ve brought out in your image. That together with the awesome glass textures make this for a professional looking pic.', '2003-05-13 08:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(296402, 20753, 8140, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but very smal DOF. IMHO, I think picture would be much better that you were using smaller aperture (higher F number), to get more stuff in focus.</td>', 'nice shot, but very smal DOF. IMHO, I think picture would be much better that you were using smaller aperture (higher F number), to get more stuff in focus.', '2003-05-13 08:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(296405, 20749, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah what a cutey! I love the pensive look on his face, kind of like "I can''t go out to play cos it''s raining!" Cool capture and an excellent submission which meets the challenge head on, even though the glass isn''t the main subject in your photo.</td>', 'Ah what a cutey! I love the pensive look on his face, kind of like "I can''t go out to play cos it''s raining!" Cool capture and an excellent submission which meets the challenge head on, even though the glass isn''t the main subject in your photo.', '2003-05-13 09:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(296407, 20588, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is just soooo good. The play of light is fantastic and is what really boosts the quality of this image from just another glass statue into a professional image.</td>', 'This is just soooo good. The play of light is fantastic and is what really boosts the quality of this image from just another glass statue into a professional image.', '2003-05-13 09:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(296411, 20584, 3418, '<td valign="top">Love the wavy lines on flat panes of glaa</td>', 'Love the wavy lines on flat panes of glaa', '2003-05-13 09:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(296429, 20568, 8689, '<td valign="top">nice idea.</td>', 'nice idea.', '2003-05-13 10:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(296447, 20185, 8687, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!!!!!!</td>', 'Brilliant!!!!!!', '2003-05-13 10:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(296448, 20248, 3087, '<td valign="top">For me this inversion of positive to negative does nothing to enhance the picture or to highlight the qualities of the glass. I actually prefer the original positive image.</td>', 'For me this inversion of positive to negative does nothing to enhance the picture or to highlight the qualities of the glass. I actually prefer the original positive image.', '2003-05-13 10:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(296454, 20674, 5999, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting effects on the pitcher. I would have cropped the bit of wondow on the left though and maybe tried to frame the whole pitcher in the shot.<br/>Mark<br/></td>', 'I like the lighting effects on the pitcher. I would have cropped the bit of wondow on the left though and maybe tried to frame the whole pitcher in the shot.Mark', '2003-05-13 11:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(296468, 20529, 5728, '<td valign="top">The composition is what I particularly like about this photo. First of all the perspective of the building is very enhancing. The tree in the top right corner only fills in the space where there is sky. The reflection of the building is in the left building and the sky reflection in the right building. It is like a gradient layering effect going from top right to bottom left. Very effective!</td>', 'The composition is what I particularly like about this photo. First of all the perspective of the building is very enhancing. The tree in the top right corner only fills in the space where there is sky. The reflection of the building is in the left building and the sky reflection in the right building. It is like a gradient layering effect going from top right to bottom left. Very effective!', '2003-05-13 11:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(296473, 20826, 5728, '<td valign="top">I know this is a photo of a stained glass window but it looks just like a painting. The detail is very good, and I like your idea of displaying on a section instead of the whole window.</td>', 'I know this is a photo of a stained glass window but it looks just like a painting. The detail is very good, and I like your idea of displaying on a section instead of the whole window.', '2003-05-13 11:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(296480, 20311, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good set-up. This image looks very focused and detailed. The refraction brings in an enhancing effect and somehow I get a feeling of cleanliness when I look at this photo, don''t ask me why. Maybe because my wife got me to wash our windows yesterday :-)</td>', 'Good set-up. This image looks very focused and detailed. The refraction brings in an enhancing effect and somehow I get a feeling of cleanliness when I look at this photo, don''t ask me why. Maybe because my wife got me to wash our windows yesterday :-)', '2003-05-13 11:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(296488, 20505, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow abstract! If you hadn''t mentioned in the title what it is I wouldn''t have guessed. But now that I look at it a little longer, I see it is a long cylinder of glass. It sure gives off an amazing effect with the light shining through it. The only part I find a little strange is that there is a gradient of shadows to lightness starting at the back to the front, then there is a sudden area of darkeness at the base of the log. Other than that, a very good submission.</td>', 'Wow abstract! If you hadn''t mentioned in the title what it is I wouldn''t have guessed. But now that I look at it a little longer, I see it is a long cylinder of glass. It sure gives off an amazing effect with the light shining through it. The only part I find a little strange is that there is a gradient of shadows to lightness starting at the back to the front, then there is a sudden area of darkeness at the base of the log. Other than that, a very good submission.', '2003-05-13 11:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(296489, 20231, 8653, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The blurred face in the BG adds to the shot.  I like your  frame it compliments  and your display of DOF and colors are excellent.</td>', 'Interesting composition. The blurred face in the BG adds to the shot.  I like your  frame it compliments  and your display of DOF and colors are excellent.', '2003-05-13 11:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(296491, 20624, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a different angle on the glass challenge, still good and original. If you think you can get an extra point or two by bribing me with chocolates, then you are absolutely right :-) It is colorful! The composition is good, I like the crop you chose to go with here.</td>', 'This is a different angle on the glass challenge, still good and original. If you think you can get an extra point or two by bribing me with chocolates, then you are absolutely right :-) It is colorful! The composition is good, I like the crop you chose to go with here.', '2003-05-13 11:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(296492, 20624, 8653, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. It holds my interest. Good colors and DOF.</td>', 'I like this shot. It holds my interest. Good colors and DOF.', '2003-05-13 11:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(296493, 20761, 5728, '<td valign="top">Did you shoot the window on purpose, just for the glass challenge? The extent some people go to to get a good photo :-) Just joking, it turned out very well in fact. The texture created by your gunshot is very effective. Good luck with the challenge</td>', 'Did you shoot the window on purpose, just for the glass challenge? The extent some people go to to get a good photo :-) Just joking, it turned out very well in fact. The texture created by your gunshot is very effective. Good luck with the challenge', '2003-05-13 11:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(296495, 20567, 8653, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I only wish I could see the whole piece. But good clarity and colors.</td>', 'Nice shot. I only wish I could see the whole piece. But good clarity and colors.', '2003-05-13 11:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(296497, 20391, 5728, '<td valign="top">This glass looks almost liquid with heat bubbles appearing all over the place. The effect is realistic although I know it isn''t. Good depiction and choice use of lighting.</td>', 'This glass looks almost liquid with heat bubbles appearing all over the place. The effect is realistic although I know it isn''t. Good depiction and choice use of lighting.', '2003-05-13 11:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(296498, 20841, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting set up especially with the ciggie hanging off the ashtray there. The lighting turned out well as well, nice work.</td>', 'Interesting set up especially with the ciggie hanging off the ashtray there. The lighting turned out well as well, nice work.', '2003-05-13 11:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(296499, 20720, 5728, '<td valign="top">More broken glass! I wouldn''t like to imagine how much glass was broken for this challenge! You had a good idea here, you didn''t have to go round breaking good drinking glasses, just old light bulbs. Good work, I love the graininess here it works well.</td>', 'More broken glass! I wouldn''t like to imagine how much glass was broken for this challenge! You had a good idea here, you didn''t have to go round breaking good drinking glasses, just old light bulbs. Good work, I love the graininess here it works well.', '2003-05-13 11:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(296500, 20453, 8653, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I like the composition. Excellent clarity and colors displayed.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I like the composition. Excellent clarity and colors displayed.', '2003-05-13 11:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(296501, 20833, 5728, '<td valign="top">I had to look for a while to before I could guess which way around this glasses are - top or bottom! It is an interesting set-up. You managed to avoid getting in any reflections of yourself, good!</td>', 'I had to look for a while to before I could guess which way around this glasses are - top or bottom! It is an interesting set-up. You managed to avoid getting in any reflections of yourself, good!', '2003-05-13 11:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(296503, 20680, 8653, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good colors and DOF. Reminds me of a Valentines Day Card.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good colors and DOF. Reminds me of a Valentines Day Card.', '2003-05-13 11:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(296504, 20785, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject for the challenge. Is that a glass etching? Good shot, the darkness isn''t negative here, in fact it works well. The only thing I could criticise on is maybe that the whole thing gives me the impression it is leaning slightly to the left.</td>', 'This is a good subject for the challenge. Is that a glass etching? Good shot, the darkness isn''t negative here, in fact it works well. The only thing I could criticise on is maybe that the whole thing gives me the impression it is leaning slightly to the left.', '2003-05-13 11:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(296505, 20250, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow this is abstract, and quite interesting! Creative idea, did you put the lens right up to the bottle top?</td>', 'Wow this is abstract, and quite interesting! Creative idea, did you put the lens right up to the bottle top?', '2003-05-13 11:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(296506, 20747, 8653, '<td valign="top">Intersting idea and composition. The focus seems a bit soft.But I really like the idea.</td>', 'Intersting idea and composition. The focus seems a bit soft.But I really like the idea.', '2003-05-13 11:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(296508, 20184, 5728, '<td valign="top">What an interesting shade of red glass! I probably would have tried to have kept the whole tray in the image, you''ve cropped off just a little on the right there.</td>', 'What an interesting shade of red glass! I probably would have tried to have kept the whole tray in the image, you''ve cropped off just a little on the right there.', '2003-05-13 11:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(296511, 20602, 5728, '<td valign="top">This would have a lot more impact had you shot it square on and cropped it a little more evenly. I do like the idea you are trying to depict though.</td>', 'This would have a lot more impact had you shot it square on and cropped it a little more evenly. I do like the idea you are trying to depict though.', '2003-05-13 12:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
