(296598, 20795, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the balance between the dark and light and how they transpose themselves.  I think, though, to have more interest and photographic merit (totally my opinion, you understand) it needs to have something to a source of focus, or maybe have a little more context to it.</td>', 'I like the colors and the balance between the dark and light and how they transpose themselves.  I think, though, to have more interest and photographic merit (totally my opinion, you understand) it needs to have something to a source of focus, or maybe have a little more context to it.', '2003-05-13 13:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
