(297185, 20848, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I''d crop in to lose all the background in the upper corners, or fill that part with coarse sand. Might have tried to saturate the colors a little more, but overall a nice bead assortment.</td>', 'I think I''d crop in to lose all the background in the upper corners, or fill that part with coarse sand. Might have tried to saturate the colors a little more, but overall a nice bead assortment.', '2003-05-13 21:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
