(297192, 20367, 8653, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. Perhaps I would have cropped a bit at the bottom to get rid of the not so attratctive ledge. Good eye!</td>', 'Interesting capture. Perhaps I would have cropped a bit at the bottom to get rid of the not so attratctive ledge. Good eye!', '2003-05-13 21:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(297193, 20755, 1031, '<td valign="top">You chose a good piece of glass to achieve this effect. I thought of something similar to this, but not with a bottle...well done.</td>', 'You chose a good piece of glass to achieve this effect. I thought of something similar to this, but not with a bottle...well done.', '2003-05-13 21:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(297194, 20810, 6325, '<td valign="top">The best of this group of floating temperature globes (or what ever they are). You really captured the floating. Very sharp on the focus and the back wall blurs the background well.</td>', 'The best of this group of floating temperature globes (or what ever they are). You really captured the floating. Very sharp on the focus and the back wall blurs the background well.', '2003-05-13 21:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(297195, 20794, 8653, '<td valign="top">Creative idea. I like how you captured the flames inside.</td>', 'Creative idea. I like how you captured the flames inside.', '2003-05-13 21:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(297196, 20740, 1031, '<td valign="top">I thought of doing something similar, and probably should have...very nice.</td>', 'I thought of doing something similar, and probably should have...very nice.', '2003-05-13 21:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(297198, 20839, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of functional and abstract elements.</td>', 'Nice combination of functional and abstract elements.', '2003-05-13 21:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(297199, 20223, 8653, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! Great colors and detail displayed.</td>', 'Nice idea! Great colors and detail displayed.', '2003-05-13 21:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(297203, 20758, 1031, '<td valign="top">I have one similar to this, but with more texture. Is your''s smooth or did you smooth it out with lighting/software?</td>', 'I have one similar to this, but with more texture. Is your''s smooth or did you smooth it out with lighting/software?', '2003-05-13 21:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(297205, 20567, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well composed and focused. I think a really white background would have been better.</td>', 'Well composed and focused. I think a really white background would have been better.', '2003-05-13 21:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(297206, 20748, 1031, '<td valign="top">I know at least one person who will want one of these...I wonder what it would look like of you took a bit of the blue out of just the clock face.</td>', 'I know at least one person who will want one of these...I wonder what it would look like of you took a bit of the blue out of just the clock face.', '2003-05-13 21:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(297207, 20311, 1031, '<td valign="top">Just to be safe I''d use some bubble gum or something on the right sides of the bases...nice concept, setup.</td>', 'Just to be safe I''d use some bubble gum or something on the right sides of the bases...nice concept, setup.', '2003-05-13 21:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(297208, 20586, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good image of the bottle. I like the little touch of color in the inside. Bold composition.</td>', 'Good image of the bottle. I like the little touch of color in the inside. Bold composition.', '2003-05-13 21:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(297212, 20367, 7674, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Ventress Hall at Ole Miss</td>', 'Reminds me of Ventress Hall at Ole Miss', '2003-05-13 21:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(297214, 20397, 8023, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution!</td>', 'Great idea and execution!', '2003-05-13 21:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(297215, 20776, 8023, '<td valign="top">Love this, excellent idea to flip the photo.  Border is distracting to me.</td>', 'Love this, excellent idea to flip the photo.  Border is distracting to me.', '2003-05-13 21:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(297216, 20458, 8023, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of the liquid and glass motion!!!  Well done!</td>', 'Excellent capture of the liquid and glass motion!!!  Well done!', '2003-05-13 21:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(297217, 20299, 8023, '<td valign="top">Love this picture.  Curious to know how it would have turned out in color!</td>', 'Love this picture.  Curious to know how it would have turned out in color!', '2003-05-13 21:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(297218, 20634, 8023, '<td valign="top">Great combination of the challenge with an artistic approach!</td>', 'Great combination of the challenge with an artistic approach!', '2003-05-13 21:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(297219, 20311, 8023, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  Perfect in black and white!  Is there a soap mark on the second glass from the left??</td>', 'Interesting composition.  Perfect in black and white!  Is there a soap mark on the second glass from the left??', '2003-05-13 21:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(297220, 20837, 8023, '<td valign="top">Great light pattern here.  The bottom of the glass is a bit bright for my eyes.</td>', 'Great light pattern here.  The bottom of the glass is a bit bright for my eyes.', '2003-05-13 21:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(297221, 20586, 8023, '<td valign="top">Well lit, interesting picture.  Great job!</td>', 'Well lit, interesting picture.  Great job!', '2003-05-13 21:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(297223, 20223, 8023, '<td valign="top">My favourite stained glass picture in this challenge!</td>', 'My favourite stained glass picture in this challenge!', '2003-05-13 21:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(297226, 20783, 7226, '<td valign="top">a good exposure despite the sillouetted wood.  maybe that''s how you wanted it to be, but...  it''s really hard to get a good sky exposure with dark objects in the foreground without over exposing the sky (and w/o spot editing =), but when you meter this, you could get away with a stop (f stop that is) or two lower (that means more exposed) w/o over exposing the sky and you would get more detail in the wood.  The best option of course, would be to have some artificial light or a reflector to illuminate the table top.  hope this helps.</td>', 'a good exposure despite the sillouetted wood.  maybe that''s how you wanted it to be, but...  it''s really hard to get a good sky exposure with dark objects in the foreground without over exposing the sky (and w/o spot editing =), but when you meter this, you could get away with a stop (f stop that is) or two lower (that means more exposed) w/o over exposing the sky and you would get more detail in the wood.  The best option of course, would be to have some artificial light or a reflector to illuminate the table top.  hope this helps.', '2003-05-13 22:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(297228, 20087, 7226, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, your color choice is a little unordinary, nice.</td>', 'interesting shot, your color choice is a little unordinary, nice.', '2003-05-13 22:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(297229, 20691, 7226, '<td valign="top">great exposure.  looks like you used a closeup lens with the extremely shallow depth of field.  it probably would be more effective if you had focused on the rim of the glass as that is what carries the most detail in the shot.</td>', 'great exposure.  looks like you used a closeup lens with the extremely shallow depth of field.  it probably would be more effective if you had focused on the rim of the glass as that is what carries the most detail in the shot.', '2003-05-13 22:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(297231, 20735, 7226, '<td valign="top">love the sharp grayscale, a little over exposed as seen with the edge of the glass mixing with the white backgroup.  nice shot</td>', 'love the sharp grayscale, a little over exposed as seen with the edge of the glass mixing with the white backgroup.  nice shot', '2003-05-13 22:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(297233, 20463, 7226, '<td valign="top">real nice (must have taken a few tries to get that).  the only thing that''s hurtin it is the grain.  this would be a tight shot if it was real crisp and sharp.  maybe try a lower iso film or lower iso setting on your camera with more light if needed or lower your fstop</td>', 'real nice (must have taken a few tries to get that).  the only thing that''s hurtin it is the grain.  this would be a tight shot if it was real crisp and sharp.  maybe try a lower iso film or lower iso setting on your camera with more light if needed or lower your fstop', '2003-05-13 22:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(297235, 20522, 7226, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective.  a little more detail in the sky and a little less grain would help this shot.  nice.</td>', 'interesting perspective.  a little more detail in the sky and a little less grain would help this shot.  nice.', '2003-05-13 22:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(297236, 20772, 7226, '<td valign="top">at first glance i thought this was a manip, but after reading your title and taking a second glance i get it.  i was confused and i like that.  good job.</td>', 'at first glance i thought this was a manip, but after reading your title and taking a second glance i get it.  i was confused and i like that.  good job.', '2003-05-13 22:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(297237, 20757, 7226, '<td valign="top">co-ed bathroom? =]</td>', 'co-ed bathroom? =]', '2003-05-13 22:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(297238, 20397, 7226, '<td valign="top">a window, but your perspective is really deceiving like that skylight pic.  great job, i love it.  it would be just a tiny bit more perfect if the shot was slightly more symmetical.  also, it would probably look awesome if you reshot it a little sharper in black &amp; white with some clouds - a more prolific sky.</td>', 'a window, but your perspective is really deceiving like that skylight pic.  great job, i love it.  it would be just a tiny bit more perfect if the shot was slightly more symmetical.  also, it would probably look awesome if you reshot it a little sharper in black & white with some clouds - a more prolific sky.', '2003-05-13 22:29:09.000000', NULL, 1);
