(297604, 20747, 7444, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments guys!  Yeah, definately has focus problems.  I could either have the refraction, or the background in focus and I got neither, haha.  Unfortunately, I went out and took about 30 shots and this is the best that came out...  (was really hoping to get the water lines matched up) I was then too lazy to go for another take. =)  Thanks carolee for the cropping comment, I can definately see what you mean.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments guys!  Yeah, definately has focus problems.  I could either have the refraction, or the background in focus and I got neither, haha.  Unfortunately, I went out and took about 30 shots and this is the best that came out...  (was really hoping to get the water lines matched up) I was then too lazy to go for another take. =)  Thanks carolee for the cropping comment, I can definately see what you mean.', '2003-05-14 05:53:32.000000', NULL, 0),
