(297703, 20366, 6548, '<td valign="top">alright, finally this challenge is over, I thought I would do better then what I did. oh well. anyway, this isn''t anything! it''s a piece of broken 3/4" glass. it had all these neat shapes in it so I decided to photograph it, as for being dark, that was the point, I actually took the photo in the dark with a red led shining from below, and a blue led shining from the side, and no it''s not oversaturated or over anything, I adjusted the levels down a bit to completely blacken the background, that''s it!</td>', 'alright, finally this challenge is over, I thought I would do better then what I did. oh well. anyway, this isn''t anything! it''s a piece of broken 3/4" glass. it had all these neat shapes in it so I decided to photograph it, as for being dark, that was the point, I actually took the photo in the dark with a red led shining from below, and a blue led shining from the side, and no it''s not oversaturated or over anything, I adjusted the levels down a bit to completely blacken the background, that''s it!', '2003-05-14 10:08:22.000000', NULL, 0),
