(297949, 20751, 7369, '<td valign="top">It is amazing to see how sometimes my taste differs so much from the rest of the crowd here at DPC. I think this was one of the better glass shots. It is a little abstract but with that vase in the background, the use of colors, the POV it should have ended far higher than it is now the case. Don''t let this discourage you.</td>', 'It is amazing to see how sometimes my taste differs so much from the rest of the crowd here at DPC. I think this was one of the better glass shots. It is a little abstract but with that vase in the background, the use of colors, the POV it should have ended far higher than it is now the case. Don''t let this discourage you.', '2003-05-14 13:39:30.000000', NULL, 0),
