(298405, 20657, 352, '<td valign="top">MattW, this Kaleidoscope is in fact all glass.  The beads and bobbles insde are all glass, and the mirrors that are reflecting the pieces to create the Kaleidoscope image are glass as well.<br/> <br/>To the rest, good comments all and very well taken.  I guess I was in a bit of a rush on this one, as I just wanted to jump back into the contest after a long absence.  Thank you for the tips.</td>', 'MattW, this Kaleidoscope is in fact all glass.  The beads and bobbles insde are all glass, and the mirrors that are reflecting the pieces to create the Kaleidoscope image are glass as well. To the rest, good comments all and very well taken.  I guess I was in a bit of a rush on this one, as I just wanted to jump back into the contest after a long absence.  Thank you for the tips.', '2003-05-14 20:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
