(299993, 20452, 6740, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kcwhisper379:</b></div><hr/><i>Oooh..this is a lucky shot. You must live in a smaller city to get this shot without any pedestrians in it. Great submission for this challenge.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Would you believe this is part of downtown Minneapolis? It was lots of fun just wandering around and exploring.</td>', 'Originally posted by kcwhisper379:Oooh..this is a lucky shot. You must live in a smaller city to get this shot without any pedestrians in it. Great submission for this challenge. Would you believe this is part of downtown Minneapolis? It was lots of fun just wandering around and exploring.', '2003-05-16 08:28:59.000000', NULL, 0),
