(365093, 20568, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice piece.  Also scored this an 8.  I like the idea of this shot and the details are great!  Suggestion - crop the bottom a bit as the edge of the board creates some odd directional reflections.  All in all, I like this piece very much.  Rob</td>', 'This is a very nice piece.  Also scored this an 8.  I like the idea of this shot and the details are great!  Suggestion - crop the bottom a bit as the edge of the board creates some odd directional reflections.  All in all, I like this piece very much.  Rob', '2003-07-23 15:53:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(379680, 20633, 5982, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BobsterLobster:</b></div><hr/><i>Well, you never can tell...<br/>This was one of my favourites, although I would have to agree that the<br/>drop shadow on the border is unnecessary. Perhaps this is why it didn''t<br/>do so well?</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks so much for your great comment...I don''t understand why a good photo should be down rated because of the frame... the picture itself is in competition, no??<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by BobsterLobster:Well, you never can tell...This was one of my favourites, although I would have to agree that thedrop shadow on the border is unnecessary. Perhaps this is why it didn''tdo so well? Thanks so much for your great comment...I don''t understand why a good photo should be down rated because of the frame... the picture itself is in competition, no?? ', '2003-08-07 02:10:16.000000', NULL, 0),
